<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id">1ch.txt Māori macronized text, extracted 28-07-06</book>
  <para style="h">1 Whakapapa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Wkp</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ko te Pukapuka Tuatahi o ngā</para>
  <para style="mt1">Whakapapa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CH 1" />
  <para style="s">Te Whakapapa mai a Ārama ki Āperahama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 5:1-32">Kenehi 5.1-32</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 10:1-32">10.1-32</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 11:10-26">11.10-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 1:1" />Ko Ārama, ko Heta, ko Ēnoha; <verse eid="1CH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 1:2" />ko Kainana, ko Mahararēre, ko Iarere; <verse eid="1CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 1:3" />ko Ēnoka, ko Matuhara, ko Rameka; <verse eid="1CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 1:4" />ko Noa, ko Hema, ko Hama, ko Iapeta.<verse eid="1CH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 1:5" />Ko ngā tama a Iapeta: ko Kōmere, ko Makoko, ko Marai, ko Iawana, ko Tūpara, ko Meheke, ko Tīraha. <verse eid="1CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 1:6" />Ko ngā tama a Kōmere: ko Ahekenata, ko Rīpata, ko Tokārama. <verse eid="1CH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 1:7" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Iawana: ko Erihaha, ko Tarahihi, ko Kitimi, ko Totanimi.<verse eid="1CH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 1:8" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Hama: ko Kuhu, ko Mitiraima, ko Putu, ko Kanāna. <verse eid="1CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 1:9" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Kuhu: ko Tepa, ko Hāwira, ko Hāpata, ko Rāma, ko Hapateka. Nā, ko ngā tama a Rāma: ko Hēpā, ko Rerana. <verse eid="1CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 1:10" />Nā Kuhu ko Nimirota; nāna i tīmata te whakatangata nui ki te whenua. <verse eid="1CH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 1:11" />Nā Mitiraima ko Rurimi, ko Anamime, ko Rehapimi, ko Napatuhimi, <verse eid="1CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 1:12" />ko Pataruhimi, ko Kaharuhimi, nāna nei ngā Pirihitini, ko Kapatorimi. <verse eid="1CH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 1:13" />Ā, nā Kanāna ko tāna mātāmua, ko Hairona, ko Hete; <verse eid="1CH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 1:14" />me te Iepuhi, me te Amori, me te Kirikahi, <verse eid="1CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 1:15" />me te Hiwi, me te Araki, me te Hini; <verse eid="1CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 1:16" />me te Arawari, me te Temari, me te Hāmati.<verse eid="1CH 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 1:17" />Ko ngā tama a Hema: ko Erama, ko Āhura, ko Arapahata, ko Ruru, ko Arame, ko Uhu, ko Huru, ko Ketere ko Meheke. <verse eid="1CH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 1:18" />Nā Arapahata ko Haraha; nā Haraha ko Ēpere. <verse eid="1CH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 1:19" />Whānau ake a Ēpere, e rua ngā tama: ko te ingoa o tētahi ko Pereke (nō te mea hoki nō ōna rā i wehea ai te whenua); ā, ko te ingoa o tōna teina ko Iokētana. <verse eid="1CH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 1:20" />Nā Iokētana ko Aramotata, ko Herepe, ko Hataramaweta, ko Ieraha; <verse eid="1CH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 1:21" />ko Hatorama, ko Utara, ko Tikera; <verse eid="1CH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 1:22" />ko Ēpara, ko Apimaera, ko Hēpā; <verse eid="1CH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 1:23" />ko Ōpira, ko Hāwira, ko Iopapa. He tama ēnei katoa nā Iokētana.<verse eid="1CH 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 1:24" />Ko Hema, ko Arapahata, ko Haraha; <verse eid="1CH 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 1:25" />ko Ēpere, ko Pereke, ko Reu; <verse eid="1CH 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 1:26" />ko Heruka, ko Nahora, ko Teraha; <verse eid="1CH 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 1:27" />ko Āperama, arā ko Āperahama.<verse eid="1CH 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Ihamaera</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 25:12-16">Kenehi 25.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 1:28" />Ko ngā tama a Āperahama: ko Īhaka, ko Ihimaera. <verse eid="1CH 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 1:29" />Ko ō rātou whakatupuranga ēnei: ko tā Ihimaera mātāmua, ko Nepaioto, muri iho ko Kerara, ko Arapēre, ko Mipihama, <verse eid="1CH 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 1:30" />ko Mihima, ko Rūma, ko Maha, ko Hatara, ko Tema, <verse eid="1CH 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 1:31" />ko Ieturu, ko Nāpihi, ko Kerema. Ko ngā tama ēnei a Ihimaera. <verse eid="1CH 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 1:32" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Ketura wahine iti a Āperahama: whānau ake ana, ko Timirana, ko Iokohana, ko Merana, ko Miriana, ko Ihipaka, ko Huaha. Nā, ko ngā tama a Iokohana: ko Hēpā, ko Rerana. <verse eid="1CH 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 1:33" />Ko ngā tama a Miriana: ko Epa, ko Ēpere, ko Ēnoka, ko Āpira, ko Ererāha. He tama ēnei katoa nā Ketura.<verse eid="1CH 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Ēhau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 36:1-19">Kenehi 36.1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 1:34" />Ā, nā Āperahama ko Īhaka. Ko ngā tama a Īhaka: ko Ēhau, ko Īharaira. <verse eid="1CH 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 1:35" />Ko ngā tama a Ēhau: ko Eripāta, ko Reuere, ko Ieuhu, ko Iārama, ko Koraha. <verse eid="1CH 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 1:36" />Ko ngā tama a Eripāta: ko Temana, ko Ōmara, ko Tepi, ko Katama, ko Kenaha, ko Timina, ko Amareke. <verse eid="1CH 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 1:37" />Ko ngā tama a Reuere: ko Nahata, ko Heraha, ko Hamaha, ko Miha.<verse eid="1CH 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Tāngata Whenua Mātua o Ēroma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 36:20-30">Kenehi 36.20-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 1:38" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Heira: ko Rōtana, ko Hopara, ko Tipeona, ko Anaha, ko Rīhona, ko Ētere, ko Rīhana. <verse eid="1CH 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 1:39" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Rōtana: ko Hori, ko Homama; ā, ko Timina te tuahine o Rōtana. <verse eid="1CH 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 1:40" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Hopara: ko Ariana, ko Manahata, ko Ēpara, ko Hepi, ko Ōnama. Ā, ko ngā tama a Tipeona: ko Aia, ko Anaha. <verse eid="1CH 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 1:41" />Ko ngā tama a Anaha: ko Rīhona. Ko ngā tama a Rīhona: ko Āmarama, ko Ehepana, ko Itirana, ko Kerana. <verse eid="1CH 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 1:42" />Ko ngā tama a Ētere: ko Pirihana, ko Taawana, ko Taakana. Ko ngā tama a Rīhana: ko Uhu, ko Arana.<verse eid="1CH 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Kīngi o Ēroma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 36:31-43">Kenehi 36.31-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 1:43" />Nā, ko ngā kīngi ēnei i kīngi nei ki te whenua o Ēroma i te mea kāhore noa he kīngi i kīngi ki ngā tama a Īharaira: ko Pera tama a Peoro; ko te ingoa o tōna pā ko Rinihapa. <verse eid="1CH 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 1:44" />Ā, ka mate a Pera, ko Iopapa tama a Tera o Potora te kīngi i muri i a ia. <verse eid="1CH 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 1:45" />Ka mate a Iopapa, ko Hūhama o te whenua o ngā Temani te kīngi i muri i a ia. <verse eid="1CH 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 1:46" />Ā, ka mate a Hūhama, ko Harara tama a Perara, nāna nei i patu a Miriana i te pārae o Moapa, te kīngi i muri i a ia, ā, ko Awiti te ingoa o tōna pā. <verse eid="1CH 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 1:47" />Ā, ka mate a Harara, (ko Hāmara o Mahareka te kīngi i muri i a ia.) <verse eid="1CH 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 1:48" />Ā, ka mate a Hāmara, ko Haora o Rehopoto i te taha o te awa te kīngi i muri i a ia. <verse eid="1CH 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 1:49" />Ā, ka mate a Haora, ko Paara-Hanana tama a Akaporo te kīngi i muri i a ia. <verse eid="1CH 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 1:50" />Ā, ka mate a Paara-Hanana, ko Harara te kīngi i muri i a ia; ā, ko Pai te ingoa o tōna pā. Ko Mehetapere te ingoa o tāna wahine; he tamāhine nā Matarere tamāhine a Metāhapa. <verse eid="1CH 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 1:51" />Ā, ka mate a Harara.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 1:51">Nā, ko ngā ariki o Ēroma: ko Ariki Timina, ko Ariki Aria, ko Ariki Ietete, <verse eid="1CH 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 1:52" />ko Ariki Ahoripama, ko Ariki Eraha, ko Ariki Pinona, <verse eid="1CH 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 1:53" />ko Ariki Kenaha, ko Ariki Temana, ko Ariki Mipitara, <verse eid="1CH 1:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 1:54" />ko Ariki Makatiere, ko Ariki Irama. Ko ngā ariki ēnei o Ēroma.<verse eid="1CH 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CH 2" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Hūrā</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 2:1" />Ko ngā tama ēnei a Īharaira: ko Reupena, ko Himiona, ko Rīwai, ko Hūrā, ko Ihākara, ko Hepurona, <verse eid="1CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 2:2" />ko Rāna, ko Hōhepa, ko Pineamine, ko Napatari, ko Kara, ko Āhera. <verse eid="1CH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 2:3" />Ko ngā tama a Hūrā: ko Ere, ko Ōnama, ko Heraha; ā, ko ēnei tama tokotoru āna nā Patehua Kanaani. Nā, i hē a Ere mātāmua a Hūrā i te aroaro o Ihowā; ā, whakamatea ana e ia. <verse eid="1CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 2:4" />Nā, whānau ake tāna, i tāna hunaonga i a Tāmara, ko Parete, ko Tera. Ko ngā tama katoa a Hūrā tokorima.<verse eid="1CH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 2:5" />Ko ngā tama a Parete: ko Heterono, ko Hāmuru. <verse eid="1CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 2:6" />Ko ngā tama a Tera: ko Tīmiri, ko Ētana, ko Hēmana, ko Karakoro, ko Rara, huihuia rātou ka tokorima. <verse eid="1CH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 2:7" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Karami: ko Ākara ko te kaiwhakararu o Īharaira, i hē nei i te mea i kangā. <verse eid="1CH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 2:8" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Ētana: ko Atāria.<verse eid="1CH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Whakapapa o Kīngi Rāwiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 2:9" />Ko ngā tama hoki a Heterono, i whānau māna: ko Ierameere, ko Rame, ko Kerupai. <verse eid="1CH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 2:10" />Nā Rame ko Aminarapa; nā Aminarapa ko Nāhahona, he rangatira nō ngā tama a Hūrā. <verse eid="1CH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 2:11" />Ā, nā Nāhahona ko Hārama, nā Hārama ko Poaha, <verse eid="1CH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 2:12" />ā, nā Poaha ko Ōpere, nā Ōpere ko Hehe. <verse eid="1CH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 2:13" />Ā, ko te mātāmua a Hehe ko Eriapa, ko Apinarapa hoki te tuarua, ā, ko Himea te tuatoru; <verse eid="1CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 2:14" />ko Netanēre te tuawhā, ko Rara te tuarima; <verse eid="1CH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 2:15" />ko Oteme te tuaono, ko Rāwiri te tuawhitu; <verse eid="1CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 2:16" />ā, ko ō rātou tuāhine, ko Teruia rāua ko Apikaira. Ā, ko ngā tama a Teruia: ko Āpihai, ko Ioapa, ko Atahere, tokotoru. <verse eid="1CH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 2:17" />Whānau ake tā Apikaira, ko Amaha: nā, ko te pāpā o Amaha, ko Iētere Ihimaeri.<verse eid="1CH 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Heterono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 2:18" />Ā, ka whānau he tama mā Karepe, mā te tama a Heterono, i tāna wahine i a Atupa, ā, i a Ierioto; ā, ko ēnei a tēnei tama: ko Tehere, ko Hōpapa, ko Ararono. <verse eid="1CH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 2:19" />Nā, ka mate a Atupa, ā, ka tangohia e Karepe māna a Ēparata, ā, whānau ake tā rāua ko Huru. <verse eid="1CH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 2:20" />Whānau ake tā Huru, ko Uri; whānau ake tā Uri, ko Petarēre.<verse eid="1CH 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 2:21" />Nā muri iho ka haere a Heterono ki te tamāhine a Makiri, pāpā o Kireara. E ono tekau ōna tau i tāna tangohanga i a ia; ā, whānau ake tā rāua, ko Hekupu. <verse eid="1CH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 2:22" />Whānau ake tā Hekupu, ko Haira. E rua tekau mā toru ōna pā i te whenua o Kireara. <verse eid="1CH 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 2:23" />Ā, i tangohia e Kehuru rāua ko Arame ngā pā o Haira i a rātou, a Kenata anō hoki, me ōna pā ririki, e ono tekau ngā pā. Ko ēnei katoa he tama nā Makiri, pāpā o Kireara. <verse eid="1CH 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 2:24" />Ā, nō muri i te matenga o Heterono i Karepe Ēparata, ka whānau a Apia wahine a Heterono, ko tā rāua tama ko Ahuru pāpā o Tekoa.<verse eid="1CH 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Ierameere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 2:25" />Ko ngā tama a Ierameere mātāmua a Heterono: ko Rame, ko te mātāmua, ko Puna, ko Orene, ko Oteme, ko Āhia. <verse eid="1CH 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 2:26" />He wahine anō tā Ierameere, ko tōna ingoa ko Atara; ko te whaea ia o Ōnama. <verse eid="1CH 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 2:27" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Rame, a te mātāmua a Ierameere: ko Maata, ko Iamini, ko Ekere. <verse eid="1CH 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 2:28" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Ōnama: ko Hamai, ko Iara. Ko ngā tama a Hamai: ko Nātapa, ko Apihuru. <verse eid="1CH 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 2:29" />Nā, ko te ingoa o te wahine a Apihuru ko Apihaira whānau ake a rāua, ko Ahapana, ko Moriri. <verse eid="1CH 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 2:30" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Nātapa: ko Herere, ko Apaima; i mate urikore ia a Herere. <verse eid="1CH 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 2:31" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Apaima: ko Ihi. Ko ngā tama a Ihi: ko Hehana. Ā, ko ngā tama a Hehana: ko Aharai. <verse eid="1CH 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 2:32" />Ko ngā tama a Iara teina o Hamai: ko Iētere, ko Honatana; i mate urikore anō a Iētere. <verse eid="1CH 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 2:33" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Honatana: ko Perete, ko Tata. Ko ngā tama ēnei a Ierameere. <verse eid="1CH 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 2:34" />Nā, kāhore he tama a Hehana; engari he tamāhine. He pononga ia tā Hehana, he Īhipiana, ko tōna ingoa, ko Iaraha. <verse eid="1CH 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 2:35" />Nā, ka hoatu e Hehana tāna tamāhine ki tāna pononga ki a Iaraha hei wahine māna; ā, whānau ake tā rāua; ko Atai. <verse eid="1CH 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 2:36" />Whānau ake tā Atai ko Nātana, ā, nā Nātana ko Tāpara; <verse eid="1CH 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 2:37" />nā Tāpara ko Eperāra, ā, nā Eperara ko Ōpere. <verse eid="1CH 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 2:38" />Nā Ōpere ko Iehu, ā, nā Iehu ko Atāria. <verse eid="1CH 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 2:39" />Nā Atāria ko Herete, ā, nā Herete ko Ereaha. <verse eid="1CH 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 2:40" />Nā Ereaha ko Hīhāmai, ā, nā Hīhāmai ko Harumu. <verse eid="1CH 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 2:41" />Nā Harumu ko Tekamia, ā, nā Tekamia ko Erihama.<verse eid="1CH 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ētahi atu Uri o Karepe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 2:42" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Karepe teina o Ierameere: ko Meha tāna mātāmua, ko te pāpā ia o Tiwhi; me ngā tama a Mareha te pāpā o Heperona. <verse eid="1CH 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 2:43" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Heperona: ko Koraha, ko Tapua, ko Rekeme, ko Hema. <verse eid="1CH 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 2:44" />Nā Hema ko Rahama, ko te pāpā o Torokoama; ā, nā Rekeme ko Hamai. <verse eid="1CH 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 2:45" />Nā, ko te tama a Hamai ko Maono; ā, ko Maono te pāpā o Peteturu. <verse eid="1CH 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 2:46" />Ā, whānau ake tā Epa, tā te wahine iti a Karepe, ko Harana, ko Mota, ko Katete; nā Harana ko Katete. <verse eid="1CH 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 2:47" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Taharai: ko Rekeme, ko Iotama, ko Kehama, ko Perete, ko Epa, ko Haapa. <verse eid="1CH 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 2:48" />Whānau ake a Maaka, a te wahine iti a Karepe, ko Hēpere, ko Tirihana. <verse eid="1CH 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 2:49" />Whānau ake anō āna, ko Haapa, ko te pāpā o Māramana, ko Hewha pāpā o Makapena, pāpā hoki o Kipea. Nā, ko te tamāhine a Karepe, ko Ākaha.<verse eid="1CH 2:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 2:50" />Ko ngā tama ēnei a Karepe tama a Huru, mātāmua a Ēparata: ko Hopara pāpā o Kiriata Tearimi, <verse eid="1CH 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 2:51" />ko Hārama, pāpā o Pēterehema, ko Harepe pāpā o Petekarere. <verse eid="1CH 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 2:52" />Nā, he tama anō a Hopara pāpā o Kiriata Tearimi: ko Haroe, me tētahi taha o ngā Manaheti, <verse eid="1CH 2:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 2:53" />me ngā hapū o Kiriata Tearimi; ngā Ītiri, ngā Puti, ngā Humati, ngā Mihirai; nō ēnei ngā Torati, me ngā Ehetauri. <verse eid="1CH 2:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 2:54" />Ko ngā tama a Hārama: ko Pēterehema, ko ngā Netopati, ko Ataroto, ko te whare o Ioapa, ko tētahi taha o ngā Manaheti, ko ngā Tori. <verse eid="1CH 2:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 2:55" />Me ngā hapū o ngā kaituhituhi i noho ki Tapete: ngā Tirati, ngā Himeati, ngā Hukati. Ko ngā Keni ēnei, ko ngā uri o Hemata, o te pāpā o te whare o Rekapa.<verse eid="1CH 2:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CH 3" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Kīngi Rāwiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 3:1" />Nā, ko ngā tama ēnei a Rāwiri, āna i whānau ki Heperona: Ko te mātāmua, ko Amanono, nā Ahinoama Ietereeri. Ko te tuarua, ko Raniera, nā Apikaira Karameri. <verse eid="1CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 3:2" />Ko te tuatoru, ko Apohārama, he tama nā Maaka tamāhine a Tāramai kīngi o Kehuru. Ko te tuawhā, ko Aronia ko te tama a Hākiti. <verse eid="1CH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 3:3" />Ko te tuarima, ko Hepatia o Apitara. Ko te tuaono, ko Itireama, nā tāna wahine, nā Ekera.<verse eid="1CH 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 3:4" />Tokoono i whānau māna ki Heperona; ā, e whitu ngā tau e ono ngā marama i kīngi ai ia ki reira.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 3:4">Ā, e toru tekau mā toru ngā tau i kīngi ai ia ki Hiruhārama. <verse eid="1CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 3:5" />Nā, ko ēnei āna i whānau ki Hiruhārama: ko Himea, ko Hōpapa, ko Nātana, ko Horomona, tokowhā nā Patahua tamāhine a Amiere; <verse eid="1CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 3:6" />ko Ipihara, anō hoki, ko Erihama, ko Eriparete; <verse eid="1CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 3:7" />ko Noka, ko Nepeke, ko Iāpia; <verse eid="1CH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 3:8" />ko Erihama, ko Eriara, ko Eriperete, tokoiwa.<verse eid="1CH 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 3:9" />Ko ngā tama katoa ēnei a Rāwiri; tērā anō ētahi, ko ngā tama a ngā wāhine iti; ko Tāmara anō hoki tō rātou tuahine.<verse eid="1CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Kīngi Horomona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 3:10" />Nā, ko te tama a Horomona, ko Rehopoama: ko tāna tama ko Apia, ko tāna tama ko Aha, ko tāna tama ko Iehohāpata, <verse eid="1CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 3:11" />ko tāna tama ko Iorama, ko tāna tama ko Ahatia, ko tāna tama ko Ioaha, <verse eid="1CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 3:12" />ko tāna tama ko Amatia, ko tāna tama ko Atāria, ko tāna tama ko Iotama. <verse eid="1CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 3:13" />Ko tāna tama ko Ahata, ko tāna tama ko Hetekia, ko tāna tama ko Mānahi, <verse eid="1CH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 3:14" />ko tāna tama ko Amono, ko tāna tama ko Hōhia. <verse eid="1CH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 3:15" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Hōhia: ko te tuatahi ko Iohanana, ko te tuarua ko Iehoiakimi, ko te tuatoru ko Terekia, ko te tuawhā ko Harumu. <verse eid="1CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 3:16" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Iehoiakimi: ko tāna tama ko Hekonia, ko tāna tama ko Terekia.<verse eid="1CH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Kīngi Hekonia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 3:17" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Hekonia, a te herehere: ko Haratiera, ko tāna tama, <verse eid="1CH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 3:18" />ko Marakirama, ko Peraia, ko Henatara, ko Iekamia, ko Hōhama, ko Nerāpia. <verse eid="1CH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 3:19" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Peraia: ko Herupapera, ko Himei; ā, ko ngā tama a Herupapera: ko Mehūrāma, ko Hanania; ā, ko Heromiti tō rāua tuahine; <verse eid="1CH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 3:20" />me Hahupa anō, me Ohere, me Perekia, me Hatāria, me Tuhapa Hētere, tokorima. <verse eid="1CH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 3:21" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Hanania: ko Peratia, ko Ihāia; ko ngā tama a Repaia, ko ngā tama a Arana, ko ngā tama a Opāria, ko ngā tama a Hekania. <verse eid="1CH 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 3:22" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Hekania: ko Hemaia. Ko ngā tama a Hemaia: ko Hatuhu, ko Ikara, ko Paria, ko Nearia, ko Hāpata, tokoono. <verse eid="1CH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 3:23" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Nearia: ko Erioenai, ko Hetekia, ko Atarikama, tokotoru. <verse eid="1CH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 3:24" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Erioenai: ko Horaia, ko Eriahipi, ko Peraia, ko Akupu, ko Iohanana, ko Teraia, ko Anani, tokowhitu.<verse eid="1CH 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CH 4" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Hūrā</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 4:1" />Ko ngā tama a Hūrā: ko Parete, ko Heterono, ko Karami, ko Huru, ko Hopara. <verse eid="1CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 4:2" />Nā, whānau ake tā Reaia, tā te tama a Hopara; ko Iahata. Whānau ake tā Iahata, ko Ahumai, ko Rahara. Ko ngā hapū ēnei o ngā Torati. <verse eid="1CH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 4:3" />Nā, ko ngā tama ēnei a te pāpā o Etama: ko Ietereere, ko Ihima, ko Iripaha; ko te ingoa anō o tō rātou tuahine, ko Haterereponi, <verse eid="1CH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 4:4" />ko Penuere pāpā o Keroro, me Ētere pāpā o Huhaha. Ko ngā tama ēnei a Huru a te mātāmua a Ēparata pāpā o Pēterehema. <verse eid="1CH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 4:5" />Nā, tokorua ngā wāhine a Ahuru pāpā o Tekoa; ko Heraha, ko Nāra. <verse eid="1CH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 4:6" />Nā, whānau ake ā rāua ko Naara; ko Ahutama, ko Hewhere, ko Temeni, ko Hatara-arara. Ko ngā tama ēnei a Naara. <verse eid="1CH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 4:7" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Heraha: ko Terete, ko Ietoara, ko Etenana. <verse eid="1CH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 4:8" />Ā, whānau ake a Koto; ko Anupu, ko Topepa, me ngā hapū o Aharahere tama a Harumu.<verse eid="1CH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 4:9" />Nā, nui atu te ingoa o Tapete i tō ōna tuākana, tēina; i huaina anō hoki tōna ingoa e tōna whaea ko Tapete; i mea ia, “Nō te mea i mamae tōku ngākau i a ia i whānau i roto i ahau.” <verse eid="1CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 4:10" />Ā, i karanga a Tapete ki te Atua o Īharaira, i mea, “Auē! Me i pono rawa tāu manaaki mōku, me i whakanuia e koe te wāhi mōku, kia tata mai anō hoki tōu ringa ki ahau, kia āraia atu hoki e koe te kino i ahau, kei mamae tōku ngākau!” Nā, ka hōmai e te Atua tāna i īnoi ai.<verse eid="1CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ētahi atu Whakapapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 4:11" />Nā, whānau ake tā Kerupu, tā te teina o Hua ko Mehiri; ko te pāpā ia o Ehetono. <verse eid="1CH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 4:12" />Whānau ake tā Ehetono; ko Peterapa, ko Pahea, ko Tehina pāpā o Irinahaha. Ko ngā tāngata ēnei o Rekaha. <verse eid="1CH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 4:13" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Kenaha: ko Otoniere, ko Heraia; nā, ko ngā tama a Otoniere; ko Hatata. <verse eid="1CH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 4:14" />Nā, whānau ake tā Meonotai, ko Opora; whānau ake tā Heraia, ko Ioapa matua o Kēharahimi; he hunga mōhio rātou ki te mahi. <verse eid="1CH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 4:15" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Karepe tama a Iepune: ko Iru, ko Eraha, ko Naama; me ngā tama a Eraha: arā a Kenaha. <verse eid="1CH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 4:16" />Me ngā tama a Ieharerēre: ko Tiwhi, ko Tipaha, ko Tiria, ko Atarēre. <verse eid="1CH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 4:17" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Etera: ko Iētere, ko Merere, ko Ēpere, ko Tarono. Ā, whānau ake āna; ko Miriama, ko Hamai, ko Ihīpa, pāpā o Ehetemoa. <verse eid="1CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 4:18" />Ā, whānau ake a tāna wahine, a Iehuria; ko Iarere pāpā o Keroro, ko Hēpere pāpā o Hoko, ko Iekutiere pāpā o Tanoa. Ko ngā tama ēnei a Pitia, tamāhine a Parao i riro nei i a Merere. <verse eid="1CH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 4:19" />Ā, ko ngā tama a te wahine a Horīa, tuahine o Nahama: ko te pāpā o Keira Karami, me Ehetemoa Maakati. <verse eid="1CH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 4:20" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Himono: ko Amanono, ko Rina, ko Penehanana, ko Tirono. Nā, ko ngā tama a Ihi: ko Tohete, ko Penetohete.<verse eid="1CH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Heraha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 4:21" />Ko ngā tama a Heraha tama a Hūrā: ko Ere pāpā o Reka, ko Rāra pāpā o Mareha, me ngā hapū o te whare o ngā kaimahi rīnena, o te whare o Ahapea; <verse eid="1CH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 4:22" />me Tokimi, me ngā tāngata o Kotepa, me Ioaha, me Harapa, ko ngā rangatira nei ēnei o Moapa, me Tahupi Reheme. (Nā, he kōrero nōnamata ēnei). <verse eid="1CH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 4:23" />Ko ēnei ngā kaihanga rīhi, me ngā tāngata i noho ki Netaimi, ki Keteraha; i noho rātou ki reira ki te kīngi ki āna mahi.<verse eid="1CH 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Himiona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 4:24" />Ko ngā tama a Himiona: ko Nemuere, ko Iamini, ko Iaripi, ko Tera, ko Haora; <verse eid="1CH 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 4:25" />ko tāna tama ko Harumu; ko tāna tama ko Mipihama; ko tāna tama ko Mihima. <verse eid="1CH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 4:26" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Mihima: ko tāna tama ko Hāmuere, ko tāna tama ko Tākuru; ko tāna tama ko Himei.<verse eid="1CH 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 4:27" />Nā, kotahi tekau mā ono ngā tama a Himei, tokoono ngā tamāhine; kīhai ia i tokomaha ngā tamariki a ōna tuākana, kīhai hoki ō rātou hapū katoa i nui haere, kīhai i rite ki ngā tama a Hūrā.<verse eid="1CH 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 4:28" />Nā, ko ō rātou nohoanga, i Peerehepa, i Morara, i Hatarahuara, <verse eid="1CH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 4:29" />i Piriha, i Ateme, i Torara, <verse eid="1CH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 4:30" />i Petuere, i Horema, i Tikiraka, <verse eid="1CH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 4:31" />i Petemarakapoto, i Hatarahuhimi, i Petepirei, i Haaraimi. Ko ō rātou pā ēnei, ā tae noa ki te kīngitanga o Rāwiri. <verse eid="1CH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 4:32" />Nā, ko ō rātou kāinga, ko Etama, ko Aina, ko Rimono, ko Tokene, ko Ahana, e rima ngā pā, <verse eid="1CH 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 4:33" />me ō rātou kāinga katoa i ngā taha katoa o aua pā rā anō, tae noa ki Paara. Ko ō rātou nohoanga ēnei, ā, kei a rātou tō rātou whakapapa.<verse eid="1CH 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 4:34" />Me Mehopapa anō, rātou ko Tamareke, ko Hōha tama a Amatia, <verse eid="1CH 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 4:35" />ko Hoera, ko Iehu tama a Tohipia, tama a Heraia, tama a Ahiere, <verse eid="1CH 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 4:36" />ko Erioenai, ko Taakopa, ko Hehohaia, ko Ahaia, ko Ariere, ko Tehimiere, ko Penaia, <verse eid="1CH 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 4:37" />ko Tita tama a Hipi, tama a Arono, tama a Ieraia, tama a Himiri, tama a Hemaia.<verse eid="1CH 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 4:38" />Ko ēnei, kua whakahuatia nei ō rātou ingoa, he rangatira nō ō rātou hapū. I nui haere anō ngā whare o ō rātou mātua. <verse eid="1CH 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 4:39" />I haere hoki rātou ki te tapokoranga atu ki Keroro, ki te rāwhiti rā anō o te raorao, ki te rapu haerenga mō ā rātou kāhui. <verse eid="1CH 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 4:40" />Ā, ka kitea e rātou he haerenga mōmona, he wāhi pai, he whenua whānui anō, āta takoto rangimārie; nō Hama hoki te hunga i noho ki reira i mua.<verse eid="1CH 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 4:41" />Nā, ko te haerenga mai o te hunga kua tuhituhia nei ō rātou ingoa i ngā rā o Hetekia kīngi o Hūrā, patua iho e rātou ō rātou tēneti me ngā Meunimi, i kitea ki reira, hunā rawatia iho hoki rātou taea noatia tēnei rā, noho iho ana ki tō rātou wāhi; nō te mea he haerenga i reira mō ā rātou hipi. <verse eid="1CH 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 4:42" />Nā, ko ētahi o rātou, arā o ngā tama a Himiona, e rima rau tāngata, i haere ki Maunga Heira, ko ō rātou rangatira ko Peratia, ko Nearia, ko Repaia, ko Utiere, he tama ēnei nā Ihi. <verse eid="1CH 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 4:43" />Ā, patua iho e rātou ngā oranga o ngā Amareki i mawhiti i mua; noho ana i reira ā taea noatia tēnei rā.<verse eid="1CH 4:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CH 5" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Reupena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 5:1" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Reupena mātāmua a Īharaira. (Ko ia hoki te mātāmua. Heoi, i te mea i whakapokea e ia te moenga o tōna pāpā, ka hoatu tōna mātāmuatanga ki ngā tama a Hōhepa, tama a Īharaira; nā, e kore te whakapapa e tīmata i te mātāmua. <verse eid="1CH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 5:2" />I nui ake hoki a Hūrā i ōna tuākana, tēina, he uri hoki nōna te tino rangatira; otiia i a Hōhepa te mātāmuatanga.) <verse eid="1CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 5:3" />Ko ngā tama a Reupena mātāmua a Īharaira: ko Ēnoka, ko Paru, ko Heterono, ko Karami. <verse eid="1CH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 5:4" />Ko ngā tama a Hoera: ko tāna tama ko Hemaia, ko tāna tama ko Koko, ko tāna tama ko Himei, <verse eid="1CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 5:5" />ko tāna tama ko Mika, ko tāna tama ko Reaia, ko tāna tama ko Paara, <verse eid="1CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 5:6" />ko tāna tama ko Pēraha, ko tērā i riro pārau rā i a Tirikata Pirinehere kīngi o Ahiria; he rangatira ia nō ngā Reupeni. <verse eid="1CH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 5:7" />Nā, ko ōna tēina me ō rātou hapū, ki te whakapapatia ō rātou whakatupuranga: ko ngā tino rangatira ko Teiere, ko Hakaraia, <verse eid="1CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 5:8" />ko Pera tama a Atata, tama a Hema, tama a Hoera, i noho nei ki Aroere ā tae noa ki Nepo, ki Paara-Meono. <verse eid="1CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 5:9" />I nohoia anō e ia te taha ki te rāwhiti, tae noa ki te koraha e takoto mai ana i te awa i Uparati; nō te mea i nui haere ā rātou kararehe ki te whenua o Kireara. <verse eid="1CH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 5:10" />Nā, i ngā rā o Haora ka whawhaitia e rātou ngā Hākari, hinga iho i ō rātou ringa; noho ana rātou ki ō rātou tēneti i te whenua katoa o Kireara ki te rāwhiti.<verse eid="1CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Kara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 5:11" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Kara i noho i te ritenga mai o tō rātou i te whenua o Pahana tae noa ki Hareka: <verse eid="1CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 5:12" />ko Hoera te upoko, muri iho ko Hapama, ko Tānai, ko Hāpata i Pahana. <verse eid="1CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 5:13" />Nā, ko ō rātou tēina o ngā whare o ō rātou mātua: ko Mikaera, ko Mehūrāma, ko Hēpā, ko Torai, ko Takana, ko Tia, ko Ēpere, tokowhitu. <verse eid="1CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 5:14" />Ko ngā tama ēnei a Apihaira tama a Huri, tama a Taroa, tama a Kireara, tama a Mikaera, tama a Tehihai, tama a Taharo, tama a Putu; <verse eid="1CH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 5:15" />ko Ahi tama a Apariere, tama a Kuni; ko te upoko ia o ngā whare o ō rātou mātua. <verse eid="1CH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 5:16" />Ā, noho ana rātou ki Kireara o Pahana, ki ōna pā ririki, ki ngā taha anō o Harono, ki ō rātou taha ki waho.<verse eid="1CH 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 5:17" />He mea whakapapa ēnei katoa i ngā rā o Iotama kīngi o Hūrā, i ngā rā anō o Ieropoama kīngi o Īharaira.<verse eid="1CH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Ope Taua o ngā Iwi ki te Rāwhiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 5:18" />Ko ngā tama a Reupena, rātou ko ngā Kari, ko tētahi tānga o te hapū o Mānahi, nō te hunga toa, he hunga hāpai i te whakangungu rākau, i te hoari, he hunga kōpere i te kōpere, e mōhio ana hoki ki te whawhai, e whā tekau mā whā mano e whitu rau e ono tekau taua hunga i āhei te haere ki te whawhai. <verse eid="1CH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 5:19" />I whawhai hoki rātou ki ngā Hākari, ki Ieturu, ki Nāpihi, ki Norapa; <verse eid="1CH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 5:20" />i āwhinatia anō rātou ki te whawhai ki a rātou, ā, ka hōmai ngā Hākari ki ō rātou ringa, rātou ko ō rātou hoa katoa. I karanga hoki rātou ki te Atua i te whawhaitanga, ā, tahuri ana ia ki a rātou; mō rātou i whakawhirinaki ki a ia. <verse eid="1CH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 5:21" />I riro anō hoki i a rātou ā rātou kararehe: o ā rātou kāmera e rima tekau mano, o ngā hipi e rua rau e rima tekau mano, o ngā kāihe e rua mano, o ngā tāngata kotahi rau mano. <verse eid="1CH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 5:22" />He tokomaha hoki i hinga, mate rawa; nā te Atua hoki te whawhai; ā, noho ana rātou ki tō rātou wāhi ā taea noatia te whakaraunga.<verse eid="1CH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Hapū o Mānahi ki Rāwhiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 5:23" />I noho anō ngā tama a tētahi tānga o te hapū o Mānahi ki te whenua; i tini haere anō rātou ki Pahana ā tae noa ki Paara-Heremona, ki Heniri, ki Maunga Heremona anō.<verse eid="1CH 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 5:24" />Nā, ko ngā upoko ēnei o ngā whare o ō rātou mātua; arā ko Ēpere, ko Ihi, ko Eriere, ko Atariere, ko Heremaia, ko Horawia, ko Tahariere, he hunga nunui, he mārohirohi, he hunga ingoa nui, he upoko anō nō ngā whare o ō rātou mātua. <verse eid="1CH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 5:25" />Nā, kua hē rātou ki te Atua o ō rātou mātua, kua whai, kua pūremu ki ngā atua o ngā iwi o te whenua i hunā nei e te Atua i tō rātou aroaro. <verse eid="1CH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 5:26" />Nā, ka whakaohokia e te Atua o Īharaira te wairua o Puru kīngi o Ahiria, te wairua hoki o Tirikata Pirinehere kīngi o Ahiria, ā, whakaraua ana rātou e ia, arā ngā Reupeni, ngā Kari, me tētahi tānga o te hapū o Mānahi, ā, kawea ana rātou e ia ki Haraha, ki Haporo, ki Hara, ki te awa o Kotana ā taea noatia tēnei rā.<verse eid="1CH 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CH 6" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Rīwai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 6:1" />Ko ngā tama a Rīwai: ko Kerehona, ko Kohata, ko Merari. <verse eid="1CH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 6:2" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Kohata: ko Āmarama, ko Itihara, ko Heperona, ko Utiere. <verse eid="1CH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 6:3" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Āmarama: ko Ārona, ko Mohi, ko Miriama. Ā, ko ngā tama a Ārona: ko Nātapa, ko Apihu, ko Ereātara, ko Itamara. <verse eid="1CH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 6:4" />Nā Ereātara ko Pinehaha, nā Pinehaha ko Apīhua, <verse eid="1CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 6:5" />nā Apīhua ko Puki, ā, nā Puki ko Uti, <verse eid="1CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 6:6" />nā Uti ko Terahia, ā, nā Terahia ko Meraioto; <verse eid="1CH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 6:7" />nā Meraioto ko Amaria, ā, nā Amaria ko Ahitupu; <verse eid="1CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 6:8" />nā Ahitupu ko Hāroko, ā, nā Hāroko ko Ahimāta; <verse eid="1CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 6:9" />nā Ahimāta hoki ko Atāria, ā, nā Atāria ko Iohanana; <verse eid="1CH 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 6:10" />nā Iohanana ko Atāria, (ko ia nei te tohunga i mahi i roto i te whare i hangā e Horomona ki Hiruhārama). <verse eid="1CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 6:11" />Ā, nā Atāria ko Amaria, nā Amaria ko Ahitupu; <verse eid="1CH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 6:12" />nā Ahitupu ko Hāroko, nā Hāroko ko Harumu; <verse eid="1CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 6:13" />nā Harumu ko Hirikia, ā, nā Hirikia ko Atāria, <verse eid="1CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 6:14" />nā Atāria ko Heraia, ā, ko tā Heraia ko Iohereke; <verse eid="1CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 6:15" />i whakaraua atu a Iohereke i te mauranga atu a Ihowā i a Hūrā, i Hiruhārama hoki, nā te ringa o Nepukaneha.<verse eid="1CH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ētahi atu Uri o Rīwai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 6:16" />Ko ngā tama a Rīwai: ko Kerehoma, ko Kohata, ko Merari. <verse eid="1CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 6:17" />Ā, ko ngā ingoa ēnei o ngā tama a Kerehoma: ko Ripini, ko Himei. <verse eid="1CH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 6:18" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Kohata: ko Āmarama, ko Itihara, ko Heperona, ko Utiere. <verse eid="1CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 6:19" />Ko ngā tama a Merari: ko Māhari, ko Muhi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 6:19">Ko ngā hapū anō ēnei o ngā Rīwaiti i te tikanga iho o ngā whare o ō rātou mātua.<verse eid="1CH 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 6:20" />Nā Kerehoma ko tāna tama ko Ripini, ko tāna tama ko Iahata, ko tāna tama ko Tima, <verse eid="1CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 6:21" />ko tāna tama ko Ioaha, ko tāna tama ko Iro, ko tāna tama ko Tera, ko tāna tama ko Teaterai.<verse eid="1CH 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 6:22" />Ko ngā tama a Kohata: ko tāna tama ko Aminarapa, ko tāna tama ko Koraha, ko tāna tama ko Ahiri, <verse eid="1CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 6:23" />ko tāna tama ko Erekana, ko tāna tama ko Epiahapa, ko tāna tama ko Ahiri, <verse eid="1CH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 6:24" />ko tāna tama ko Tahata, ko tāna tama ko Uriere, ko tāna tama ko Utia, ko tāna tama ko Haora. <verse eid="1CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 6:25" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Erekana: ko Amahai, ko Ahimoto, <verse eid="1CH 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 6:26" />nā, mō Erekana, ko ngā tama a Erekana; ko tāna tama ko Towhai, ko tāna tama ko Nahata; <verse eid="1CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 6:27" />ko tāna tama ko Eriapa, ko tāna tama ko Ierohama, ko tāna tama ko Erekana. <verse eid="1CH 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 6:28" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Hamuera: ko te mātāmua ko Hoera, ā, ko te tuarua ko Apia.<verse eid="1CH 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 6:29" />Ko ngā tama a Merari: ko Māhari, ko tāna tama ko Ripini, ko tāna tama ko Himei, ko tāna tama ko Uha, <verse eid="1CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 6:30" />ko tāna tama Himeia, ko tāna tama ko Hakia, ko tāna tama ko Ahaia.<verse eid="1CH 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Kaiwhakatangitangi o te Temepara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 6:31" />Ā, ko te hunga tēnei i whakaritea e Rāwiri mō te mahi waiata i te whare o Ihowā, i te mea ka whai okiokinga te āka. <verse eid="1CH 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 6:32" />I minita anō rātou ki te ritenga atu o te nohoanga o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, i waiata, ā taea noatia te hanganga a Horomona i te whare o Ihowā ki Hiruhārama; kātahi rātou ka tūturu ki tā rātou mahi i whakaritea mā rātou. <verse eid="1CH 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 6:33" />Nā, ko te hunga tēnei i tūturu, me ā rātou tama:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 6:33">Nō ngā tama a ngā Kohati: ko Hēmana, he kaiwaiata, he tama nā Hoera, tama a Hamuera, <verse eid="1CH 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 6:34" />tama a Erekana, tama a Ierohama, tama a Eriere, tama a Toaha, <verse eid="1CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 6:35" />tama a Tupu, tama a Erekana, tama a Mahata, tama a Amahai, <verse eid="1CH 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 6:36" />tama a Erekana, tama a Hoera, tama a Atāria, tama a Tepania, <verse eid="1CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 6:37" />tama a Tahata, tama a Ahiri, tama a Epiahapa, tama a Koraha, <verse eid="1CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 6:38" />tama a Itihara, tama a Kohata, tama a Rīwai, tama a Īharaira.<verse eid="1CH 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 6:39" />Ko tōna teina anō hoki ko Āhapa, i tū nei ki tōna ringa matau: arā a Āhapa, tama a Perekia, tama a Himea, <verse eid="1CH 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 6:40" />tama a Mikaera, tama a Paaheia, tama a Marakia, <verse eid="1CH 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 6:41" />tama a Eteni, tama a Tera, tama a Araia, <verse eid="1CH 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 6:42" />tama a Ētana, tama a Tima, tama a Himei, <verse eid="1CH 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 6:43" />tama a Iahata, tama a Kerehoma, tama a Rīwai.<verse eid="1CH 6:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 6:44" />Nā, i te taha ki mauī ko ō rātou tēina, ko ngā tama a Merari: ko Ētana tama a Kihihi, tama a Apari, tama a Maruku, <verse eid="1CH 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 6:45" />tama a Hahapia, tama a Amatia, tama a Hirikia, <verse eid="1CH 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 6:46" />tama a Amati, tama a Pani, tama a Hamere, <verse eid="1CH 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 6:47" />tama a Māhari, tama a Muhi, tama a Merari, tama a Rīwai.<verse eid="1CH 6:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 6:48" />I whakaritea anō hoki ō rātou tuākana, tēina, ngā Rīwaiti, ki ngā mahi katoa o te tapenākara o te whare o te Atua.<verse eid="1CH 6:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Ārona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 6:49" />Ko Ārona ia i mea whakahere, rātou ko āna tama, ki runga ki te āta tahunga tinana, ki runga hoki ki te āta tahu whakakakara; ko tā rātou ko ngā mahi katoa o te whare tino tapu, ko te whakamārie mō Īharaira; ko ngā mea katoa i whakahaua e Mohi pononga a te Atua.<verse eid="1CH 6:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 6:50" />Nā, ko ngā tama ēnei a Ārona: ko tāna tama ko Ereātara, ko tāna tama ko Pinehaha, ko tāna tama ko Apīhua, <verse eid="1CH 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 6:51" />ko tāna tama ko Puki, ko tāna tama ko Uti, ko tāna tama ko Terahia, <verse eid="1CH 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 6:52" />ko tāna tama ko Meraioto, ko tāna tama ko Amaria, ko tāna tama ko Ahitupu, <verse eid="1CH 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 6:53" />ko tāna tama ko Hāroko, ko tāna tama ko Ahimāta.<verse eid="1CH 6:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Nohoanga o ngā Rīwaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 6:54" />Nā, ko ō rātou nohoanga ēnei i te tātai o ō rātou puni i roto i ō rātou rohe: i ngā tama a Ārona, o ngā whānau o ngā Kohati, nō rātou nei hoki te rota tuatahi. <verse eid="1CH 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 6:55" />I hoatu ki a rātou a Heperona i te whenua o Hūrā, me ngā wāhi i waho ake o tērā ā whawhe noa, <verse eid="1CH 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CH 6:56" />ko ngā māra ia o te pā, me ōna pā ririki, i hoatu ki a Karepe tama a Iepune. <verse eid="1CH 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CH 6:57" />Ā, i hoatu ki ngā tama a Ārona, o ngā pā o Hūrā, ko Heperona, ko te pā whakaora: ko Rīpina me ōna wāhi o waho ake, ko Iatiri, ko Ehetemoa me ngā wāhi o waho ake, <verse eid="1CH 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CH 6:58" />ko Hirene me ōna wāhi o waho ake, ko Repiri me ōna wāhi o waho ake, <verse eid="1CH 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1CH 6:59" />ko Ahana me ōna wāhi o waho ake, ko Petehemehe me ōna wāhi o waho ake. <verse eid="1CH 6:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1CH 6:60" />Ā, nō o te iwi o Pineamine, ko Kepa me ōna wāhi o waho ake, ko Aremete me ōna wāhi o waho ake, ko Anatoto me ōna wāhi o waho ake. Ko ō rātou pā katoa i ō rātou hapū katoa, kotahi tekau mā toru pā.<verse eid="1CH 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="1CH 6:61" />Ā, ki te toenga atu o ngā tama a Kohata i hoatu, he mea nā te rota, nō roto i o tētahi hapū o te iwi, nō tētahi tānga o te iwi, te tānga o Mānahi, tekau ngā pā.<verse eid="1CH 6:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1CH 6:62" />Ā, ki ngā tama a Kerehoma i ō rātou hapū, tekau mā toru ngā pā, nō te iwi o Ihākara, nō te iwi o Āhera, nō te iwi o Napatari, nō te iwi o Mānahi i Pahana.<verse eid="1CH 6:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="1CH 6:63" />Ā, ki ngā tama a Merari i ō rātou hapū, i hoatu tekau mā rua ngā pā, he mea rota; nō te iwi o Reupena, nō te iwi o Kara, nō te iwi o Hepurona.<verse eid="1CH 6:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="1CH 6:64" />Nā, he mea hoatu ēnei pā me ngā wāhi o waho ake e ngā tama a Īharaira ki ngā Rīwaiti. <verse eid="1CH 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="1CH 6:65" />I hoatu anō e rātou, he mea rota, ēnei pā kua huaina nei ngā ingoa, nō roto i ō te iwi o ngā tama a Hūrā, i ō te iwi anō hoki o ngā tama a Himiona, i ō te iwi anō hoki o ngā tama a Pineamine.<verse eid="1CH 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="1CH 6:66" />Nā, ko ētahi o ngā hapū o ngā tama a Kohata i ā rātou ētahi pā i ō rātou rohe, nō o te iwi o Ēparaima. <verse eid="1CH 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="1CH 6:67" />Ā, i hoatu e rātou ki a rātou ngā pā whakaora: a Hekeme i te whenua pukepuke o Ēparaima me ngā wāhi o waho ake ōna, a Kētere hoki me ōna wāhi o waho ake, <verse eid="1CH 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="1CH 6:68" />a Iokomēama me ōna wāhi o waho ake, a Petehorono me ōna wāhi o waho ake, <verse eid="1CH 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="1CH 6:69" />a Atarono, me ōna wāhi o waho ake, a Katarimono me ōna wāhi o waho ake. <verse eid="1CH 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="1CH 6:70" />Ā, nō tētahi tānga o te iwi o Mānahi, ko Anere me ōna wāhi o waho ake, ko Pireama me ōna wāhi o waho ake, mō te hapū o ngā mea i mahue o ngā tama a Kohata.<verse eid="1CH 6:70" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="1CH 6:71" />Ā, ki ngā tama a Kerehoma: i hoatu i roto i o tētahi tānga o te iwi o Mānahi: ko Korana i Pahana me ōna wāhi o waho ake, ko Ahataroto me ōna wāhi o waho ake; <verse eid="1CH 6:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="1CH 6:72" />nō roto i ō te iwi o Ihākara: ko Kerehe me ōna wāhi o waho ake, ko Taperata me ōna wāhi o waho ake, <verse eid="1CH 6:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="1CH 6:73" />ko Rāmoto me ōna wāhi o waho ake, ko Aneme me ōna wāhi o waho ake; <verse eid="1CH 6:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="1CH 6:74" />ā, nō o te iwi o Āhera: ko Mahara me ōna wāhi o waho ake, ko Aparono me ōna wāhi o waho ake, <verse eid="1CH 6:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="1CH 6:75" />ko Hukoko me ōna wāhi o waho ake ko Rehopo me ōna wāhi o waho ake; <verse eid="1CH 6:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="1CH 6:76" />ā, nō o te iwi o Napatari: ko Kerehe i Karirī me ōna wāhi o waho ake, ko Hamono me ōna wāhi o waho ake, ko Kiriataima me ōna wāhi o waho ake.<verse eid="1CH 6:76" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="1CH 6:77" />Ki ērā atu o ngā Rīwaiti, ki ngā tama a Merari, i hoatu: nō o te iwi o Hepurona ko Rimono me ōna wāhi o waho ake, ko Taporo me ōna wāhi o waho ake, <verse eid="1CH 6:77" /><verse number="78" style="v" sid="1CH 6:78" />ā, i tērā taha o Horano, i te ritenga o Heriko, i te taha ki te rāwhiti o Horano i hoatu ki a rātou ētahi pā nō o te iwi o Reupena: ko Pētere i te koraha me ōna wāhi o waho ake, ko Iahata me ōna wāhi o waho ake, <verse eid="1CH 6:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="1CH 6:79" />ko Keremoto me ōna wāhi o waho ake, ko Mepaata me ōna wāhi o waho ake; <verse eid="1CH 6:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="1CH 6:80" />ā, nō o te iwi o Kara: ko Rāmoto i Kireara me ōna wāhi o waho ake, ko Mahanaima me ōna wāhi o waho ake, <verse eid="1CH 6:80" /><verse number="81" style="v" sid="1CH 6:81" />ko Hehepona me ōna wāhi o waho ake, ko Iatere me ōna wāhi o waho ake.<verse eid="1CH 6:81" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CH 7" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Ihākara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 7:1" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Ihākara: ko Tora, ko Pua, ko Iahupu, ko Himirono, tokowhā. <verse eid="1CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 7:2" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Tora: ko Uti, ko Repaia, ko Teriere, ko Iahamai, ko Tipihama, ko Hemuera, ko ngā upoko o ngā whare o ō rātou pāpā, arā o tō Tora, he hunga māia rātou, he mārohirohi i ō rātou whakatupuranga, ko tō rātou tokomaha i ngā rā o Rāwiri e rua tekau mā rua mano, e ono rau. <verse eid="1CH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 7:3" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Uti: ko Itirahia. Ko ngā tama a Itirahia: ko Mikaera, ko Opāria, ko Hoera, ko Ihīa, tokorima, he upoko ēnei katoa. <verse eid="1CH 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 7:4" />Nā, ka hui ki a rātou, i ō rātou whakatupuranga, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, ko ngā rōpū hōia mō te whawhai, e toru tekau mā ono mano: he tokomaha hoki ā rātou wāhine, ā rātou tamariki. <verse eid="1CH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 7:5" />Nā, ko ō rātou tēina i roto i ngā hapū katoa o Ihākara, he toa, he mārohirohi, e waru tekau mā whitu mano, ki te whakapapatia rātou katoa.<verse eid="1CH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Pineamine me ngā Uri o Rāna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 7:6" />Ko ngā tama a Pineamine: ko Pera, ko Pekere, ko Teriaere, tokotoru. <verse eid="1CH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 7:7" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Pera: ko Etepono, ko Uti, ko Utiere, ko Terimoto, ko Iri, tokorima; he upoko ēnei nō ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, he hunga toa, he mārohirohi; taua ana rātou i ō rātou whakapapa e rua tekau mā rua mano e toru tekau mā whā. <verse eid="1CH 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 7:8" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Pekere: ko Temira, ko Toaha, ko Eriētere, ko Erioenai, ko Omori, ko Teremoto, ko Apia, ko Anatoto, ko Aramete. He tama ēnei katoa nā Pekere, <verse eid="1CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 7:9" />ā, ka taua rātou i ō rātou whakapapa, i ō rātou whakatupuranga, ngā upoko o ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, ngā toa, ngā mārohirohi, e rua tekau mano e rua rau. <verse eid="1CH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 7:10" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Teriaere: ko Pirihana. Nā, ko ngā tama a Pirihana: ko Ieuhu, ko Pineamine, ko Ehuru, ko Kenāna, ko Tetana, ko Tarahihi, ko Ahīhāhara. <verse eid="1CH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 7:11" />Ko ēnei katoa he tama nā Teriaere, he upoko nō ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, he toa, he mārohirohi, kotahi tekau mā whitu mano rātou e rua rau, he hōia hei haere ki te whawhai, ki te tūranga riri. <verse eid="1CH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 7:12" />Ko Tupimi anō, ko Hupimi, ko ngā tama a Iri, ko Huhimi, ko ngā tama a Ahere.<verse eid="1CH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Napatari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 7:13" />Ko ngā tama a Napatari: ko Tahatiere, ko Kuni, ko Iētere, ko Harumu, arā ko ngā tama a Piriha.<verse eid="1CH 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Mānahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 7:14" />Ko ngā tama a Mānahi: ko Ahariere, i whānau nei i tāna wahine; nā tāna wahine iti hoki, nā te Arami, a Makiri pāpā o Kireara. <verse eid="1CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 7:15" />Nā, ka tangohia e Makiri hei wahine māna ko te tuahine o Hupimi rāua ko Tupimi, ko te ingoa o tō rāua tuahine ko Maaka. Ko te ingoa o te tuarua o āna tama ko Teropēhara; ā, he tamāhine anō a Teropēhara. <verse eid="1CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 7:16" />Nā, kua whānau a Maaka wahine a Makiri he tama, ā, huaina iho tōna ingoa ko Perehe; ā, ko te ingoa o tōna teina ko Herehe; ko āna tama; ko Urama, ko Rakeme. <verse eid="1CH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 7:17" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Urama: ko Perana. Ko ngā tama ēnei a Kireara, tama a Makiri, tama a Mānahi. <verse eid="1CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 7:18" />Nā, whānau ake a tōna tuahine, a Hamorekete, ko Ihihoro, ko Apiētere, ko Mahara. <verse eid="1CH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 7:19" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Hemira: ko Ahiana, ko Hekeme, ko Rikihi, ko Aniama.<verse eid="1CH 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Ēparaima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 7:20" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Ēparaima: ko Hutera, ko tāna tama ko Pereke, ko tāna tama ko Tahata, ko tāna tama ko Erara, ko tāna tama ko Tahata, <verse eid="1CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 7:21" />ko tāna tama ko Tāpara, ko tāna tama ko Hutera, ko Ētere, ko Eriara. I patua ēnei e ngā tāngata o Kāta i whānau nei ki taua whenua, mō rātou i haere atu ki te tango i ā rātou kararehe. <verse eid="1CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 7:22" />Ā, he tini ngā rā i tangihia ai rātou e tō rātou pāpā, e Ēparaima, ā, haere ana mai ōna tuākana, tēina, ki te whakamārie i a ia. <verse eid="1CH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 7:23" />Ā, i haere atu ia ki tāna wahine, ka hapū, ā, ka whānau he tama, ā, huaina iho tōna ingoa ko Peria, nō te mea kei roto tōna whare i te hē. <verse eid="1CH 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 7:24" />Ā, ko Heraha tāna tamāhine, nāna nei i hanga a Petehorono, tō raro me tō runga, me Uteneheraha. <verse eid="1CH 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 7:25" />Nā, ko Repaha tāna tama, ko Rehepe hoki; ko tāna tama ko Teraha, ko tāna tama ko Tahana, <verse eid="1CH 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 7:26" />ko tāna tama ko Rārana, ko tāna tama ko Amihuru, ko tāna tama ko Erihama, <verse eid="1CH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 7:27" />ko tāna tama ko Nunu, ko tāna tama ko Hohua.<verse eid="1CH 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 7:28" />Nā, ko ō rātou kāinga tupu, me ō rātou nohoanga, ko Pētēre, me ōna pā ririki; ki te taha ki te rāwhiti ko Naarana; ki te taha ki te hauāuru ko Kētere me ōna pā ririki; ko Hekeme anō hoki me ōna pā ririki, tae noa ki Kaha me ōna pā ririki; <verse eid="1CH 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 7:29" />ā, i ngā taha o ngā tama a Mānahi ko Peteheana me ōna pā ririki, ko Tānaka me ōna pā ririki, ko Mekiro me ōna pā ririki, ko Roro me ōna pā ririki. I noho ki ēnei ngā tama a Hōhepa tama a Īharaira.<verse eid="1CH 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Āhera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 7:30" />Ko ngā tama a Āhera: ko Imina, ko Ihua, ko Ihui, ko Peria, me tō rātou tuahine, me Hera. <verse eid="1CH 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 7:31" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Peria: ko Hēpere, ko Marakiere, ko te pāpā nei ia o Piritawiti. <verse eid="1CH 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 7:32" />Nā Hēpere ko Taparete, ko Homere, ko Hōtama, me tō rātou tuahine anō, me Hua. <verse eid="1CH 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 7:33" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Taparete: ko Pahaka, ko Pimihara, ko Ahawata. Ko ngā tama ēnei a Taparete. <verse eid="1CH 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 7:34" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Homere: ko Ahi, ko Rohoka, ko Tehupa, ko Arame. <verse eid="1CH 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 7:35" />Ā, ko ngā tama a tōna teina, a Hēreme: ko Topaha, ko Imina, ko Herehe, ko Amara. <verse eid="1CH 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 7:36" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Topaha: ko Hua, ko Haranēpere, ko Huara, ko Peri, ko Imirā, <verse eid="1CH 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 7:37" />ko Pētere, ko Horo, ko Hamama, ko Hiriha, ko Itirana, ko Pēra. <verse eid="1CH 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 7:38" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Iētere: ko Iepune, ko Pihipa, ko Āra. <verse eid="1CH 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 7:39" />Ko ngā tama a Ura: ko Araha, ko Haniere, ko Retia.<verse eid="1CH 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 7:40" />Ko ēnei katoa he tama nā Āhera, he upoko nō ngā whare o ngā pāpā, he hunga whiriwhiri, he mārohirohi, he māia, ko ngā rangatira nunui tonu. I tō rātou tauanga i runga i te whakapapa, ko te tokomaha o te hunga hei haere ki te whawhai, ki te tūranga riri, e rua tekau mā ono mano tāngata.<verse eid="1CH 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CH 8" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Uri o Pineamine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 8:1" />Nā, whānau ake a Pineamine, ko tāna mātāmua ko Pera, ko te tuarua ko Ahapere, ko te tuatoru ko Ahara, <verse eid="1CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 8:2" />ko te tuawhā ko Noha, ko te tuarima ko Rapa. <verse eid="1CH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 8:3" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Pera: ko Arara, ko Kera, ko Apihuru, <verse eid="1CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 8:4" />ko Apīhua, ko Naamana, ko Ahoa, <verse eid="1CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 8:5" />ko Kera, ko Hepupana, ko Hūrāma. <verse eid="1CH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 8:6" />Ā, ko ngā tama ēnei a Ehuru, ko ngā upoko ēnei o ngā whare o ngā mātua o ngā tāngata o Kepa, ā, whakahekea ana rātou e rātou ki Manahata: <verse eid="1CH 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 8:7" />me Naamana, me Āhia, me Kera, i whakahekea rātou e ia; ā, whānau ake āna ko Uha, ko Ahihuru. <verse eid="1CH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 8:8" />I whānau anō hoki he tamariki mā Haharaima i te whenua o Moapa i muri iho i tāna tononga atu i a rātou; ko āna wāhine ko Huhimi, ko Paara. <verse eid="1CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 8:9" />Whānau ake ā rāua ko tāna wahine ko Horehe; ko Iopapa, ko Tipia, ko Meha, ko Marakama, <verse eid="1CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 8:10" />ko Teutu, ko Hakia, ko Mirima. Ko āna tama ēnei, ko ngā upoko o ngā whare o ngā mātua. <verse eid="1CH 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 8:11" />Ā, whānau ake ā rāua ko Huhimi, ko Apitupu, ko Erepāra. <verse eid="1CH 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 8:12" />Ko ngā tama a Erepāra: ko Ēpere, ko Mihama, ko Hamere, nāna nei i hanga a Ono, a Roro me ō reira pā ririki, <verse eid="1CH 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 8:13" />ko Peria hoki rāua ko Hema (ko ngā upoko rāua o ngā whare o ngā mātua o ngā tāngata o Atarono i peia ai ngā tāngata o Kāta); <verse eid="1CH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 8:14" />ko Ahio, ko Hahaka, ko Teremoto. <verse eid="1CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 8:15" />Ko Tepāria, ko Arara, ko Arere, <verse eid="1CH 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 8:16" />ko Mikaera, ko Ihīpa, ko Toha, ko ngā tama a Peria. <verse eid="1CH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 8:17" />Ko Tepāria, ko Mehūrāma, ko Heteki, ko Hēpere, <verse eid="1CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 8:18" />ko Ihimerai anō hoki, ko Ieteria, ko Iopapa, ko ngā tama a Erepāra. <verse eid="1CH 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 8:19" />Ko Iākimi, ko Tīkiri, ko Tapari; <verse eid="1CH 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 8:20" />ko Erienai, ko Tiretai, ko Eriere; <verse eid="1CH 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 8:21" />ko Araia, ko Peraia, ko Himirata, ko ngā tama ēnei a Himei. <verse eid="1CH 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 8:22" />Ko Ihipana, ko Ēpere, ko Eriere, <verse eid="1CH 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 8:23" />ko Aparono, ko Tīkiri, ko Hanana, <verse eid="1CH 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 8:24" />ko Hanania, ko Erama, ko Anatotia, <verse eid="1CH 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 8:25" />ko Ipēreia, ko Penuere, ko ngā tama ēnei a Hahaka. <verse eid="1CH 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 8:26" />Ko Hamāherai, ko Heharia, ko Atāria, <verse eid="1CH 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 8:27" />ko Tarehia, ko Īraia, ko Tīkiri, ko ngā tama a Ierohama.<verse eid="1CH 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 8:28" />Ko ngā upoko ēnei o ngā whare o ngā mātua i ō rātou whakatupuranga, he upoko rātou. I noho ēnei ki Hiruhārama.<verse eid="1CH 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Whānau o Kīngi Haora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 8:29" />Ā, i Kipeono e noho ana te pāpā o Kipeono, a Teiere, ā, ko te ingoa o tāna wahine ko Maaka. <verse eid="1CH 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 8:30" />Ā, ko tāna mātāmua ko Aparono, ko Turu, ko Kihi, ko Paara, ko Nātapa, <verse eid="1CH 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 8:31" />ko Keroro, ko Ahio, ko Takere. <verse eid="1CH 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 8:32" />Nā, whānau ake tā Mikiroto, ko Himea. I noho anō ēnei ki ō rātou tuākana ki Hiruhārama, i te wāhi e anga tonu mai ana ki a rātou. <verse eid="1CH 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 8:33" />Whānau ake tā Nere, ko Kihi; whānau ake tā Kihi, ko Haora; whānau ake tā Haora, ko Honatana, ko Marikihua, ko Apinarapa, ko Ehepaara. <verse eid="1CH 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 8:34" />Nā, ko te tama a Honatana: ko Meripaara; ā, whānau ake tā Meripaara, ko Mika. <verse eid="1CH 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 8:35" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Mika: ko Pitono, ko Mereke, ko Tarea, ko Ahata. <verse eid="1CH 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 8:36" />Nā Ahata ko Tehoara; nā Tehoara ko Aremete, ko Ātamawete, ko Tīmiri; ā, nā Tīmiri ko Mota. <verse eid="1CH 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 8:37" />Nā Mota ko Pinea; ko Rapa tāna tama, ko Ereaha tāna tama, ko Atere tāna tama. <verse eid="1CH 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 8:38" />Nā, tokoono ngā tama a Atere; ko ō rātou ingoa ēnei: ko Atarikama, ko Pokeru, ko Ihimaera, ko Hearia, ko Opāria, ko Hanana. He tama ēnei katoa nā Atere. <verse eid="1CH 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 8:39" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Ēheke, a tōna teina: ko Urama tāna mātāmua, ko Ieuhu te tuarua, ko Eriperete te tuatoru. <verse eid="1CH 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 8:40" />Nā, he māia, he mārohirohi ngā tama a Urama, he kaikōpere, he tokomaha hoki ā rātou tama, me ngā tama a ngā tama, kotahi rau e rima tekau. He tama ēnei katoa nā Pineamine.<verse eid="1CH 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="1CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CH 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 9:1" />Nā, he mea whakapapa a Īharaira katoa; heoi, tēnā kua tuhituhia ki te pukapuka o ngā kīngi o Īharaira. Nā, i whakaraua atu a Hūrā ki Papurōna mō ā rātou mahi hē. <verse eid="1CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 9:2" />Nā, ko ngā tāngata tuatahi i noho ki ō rātou wāhi, ki ō rātou pā, ko Īharaira, ko ngā tohunga, ko ngā Rīwaiti, ko ngā Netinimi.<verse eid="1CH 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Iwi Kāinga i muri mai o te Whakarau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 9:3" />Nā, noho iho ki Hiruhārama o ngā tama a Hūrā, o ngā tama a Pineamine, o ngā tama a Ēparaima rāua ko Mānahi: <verse eid="1CH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 9:4" />Ko Utai tama a Amihuru, tama a Omori, tama a Imiri, tama a Pani; nō ngā tama a Parete tama a Hūrā. <verse eid="1CH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 9:5" />Ā, o ngā Hironi: ko Ahaia te mātāmua rātou ko āna tama. <verse eid="1CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 9:6" />O ngā tama a Tera: ko Teuere rātou ko ō rātou tēina, e ono rau e iwa tekau. <verse eid="1CH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 9:7" />O ngā tama a Pineamine: ko Hāru tama a Mehūrāma, tama a Horawia, tama a Hahenua, <verse eid="1CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 9:8" />ko Ipineia tama a Ierohama, ko Eraha tama a Uti, tama a Mikiri, ko Mehūrāma tama a Hepatia, tama a Reuere, tama a Ipinīa; <verse eid="1CH 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 9:9" />me ō rātou tēina anō hoki i ō rātou whakatupuranga, e iwa rau e rima tekau mā ono. He upoko ēnei tāngata katoa nō ngā whare o ngā mātua i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua.<verse eid="1CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Tohunga i Noho i Hiruhārama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 9:10" />Ā, o ngā tohunga: ko Ieraia, ko Tehoiaripi, ko Iakini, <verse eid="1CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 9:11" />ko Atāria, tama a Hirikia, tama a Mehūrāma, tama a Hāroko, tama a Meraioto, tama a Ahitupu, ko te rangatira ia o te whare o te Atua. <verse eid="1CH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 9:12" />Ko Araia tama a Ierohama, tama a Pahuru, tama a Marakia, ko Māhiai tama a Ariere, tama a Tahatera, tama a Mehūrāma, tama a Mehiremiti, tama a Imere. <verse eid="1CH 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 9:13" />Me ō rātou tēina, ngā upoko o ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, kotahi mano e whitu rau e ono tekau, he tāngata pakari rawa hei mahi i ngā mahi o te whare o te Atua.<verse eid="1CH 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Rīwaiti i Noho i Hiruhārama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 9:14" />Ā, o ngā Rīwaiti: ko Hemaia tama a Hahupu, tama a Atarikama, tama a Hahapia; nō ngā tama a Merari; <verse eid="1CH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 9:15" />ko Pakapakakara, ko Herehe, ko Karara, ko Matania, tama a Mika, tama a Tīkiri, tama a Āhapa; <verse eid="1CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 9:16" />ko Opāria tama a Hemaia, tama a Karara, tama a Ierutunu, ko Perekia tama a Aha, tama a Erekana, i noho nei ki ngā kāinga koraha o ngā Netopati. <verse eid="1CH 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 9:17" />Ko ngā kaitiaki kūwaha: ko Harumu, ko Akupu, ko Taramono, ko Ahimana, me ō rātou tēina; ko Harumu te upoko; <verse eid="1CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 9:18" />ko tō rātou tūranga i mua, kei te kūwaha o te kīngi, kei te rāwhiti. He kaitiaki kūwaha rātou i roto i ngā rōpū o ngā tama a Rīwai. <verse eid="1CH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 9:19" />Nā, ko Harumu tama a Kore, tama a Epiahapa, tama a Koraha, rātou ko ōna tēina o te whare o tōna matua, ko ngā Korahi, ko rātou ngā rangatira o ngā mahi e mahia ana, ngā kaitiaki o ngā kūwaha o te tapenākara. Nā, he rangatira ō rātou mātua nō te ope a Ihowā, he kaitiaki anō nō te tomokanga. <verse eid="1CH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 9:20" />Nā, ko Pinehaha tama a Ereātara tō rātou rangatira i mua; ā, i a ia anō a Ihowā. <verse eid="1CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 9:21" />Ko Hakaraia tama a Meheremia te kaitiaki o te kūwaha o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga.<verse eid="1CH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 9:22" />Ko ēnei katoa i whiriwhiria nei hei kaitiaki mō ngā kūwaha, e rua rau kotahi tekau mā rua. He mea whakapapa ēnei ki ō rātou kāinga ake; nā Rāwiri rāua ko Hamuera matakite rātou i whakarite kia tūturu ki taua mahi. <verse eid="1CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 9:23" />I a rātou ko ā rātou tama te mahi tirotiro i ngā kūwaha o te whare o Ihowā, arā o te whare o te tapenākara i tēnei tiakitanga, i tēnei tiakitanga. <verse eid="1CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 9:24" />He kaitiaki kūwaha i ngā taha e whā, whaka te rāwhiti, whaka te hauāuru, whaka te raki, whaka te tonga. <verse eid="1CH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 9:25" />Nā, i whakaritea ō rātou tēina i ō rātou kāinga koraha kia haere mai i te takanga o ngā rā e whitu, i ia wā, i ia wā, hei hoa mō rātou.<verse eid="1CH 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 9:26" />Ko ngā tino kaitiaki tokowhā hoki o te kūwaha, he Rīwaiti nei rātou, he tūturu tonu tā rātou mahi, ā, ko rātou ngā rangatira o ngā rūma, o ngā takotoranga taonga o te whare o te Atua. <verse eid="1CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 9:27" />He nohoanga hoki tō rātou i ngā taha o te whare o te Atua; mā rātou hoki te tiaki; mā rātou anō te uaki o ngā tatau i tēnei ata, i tēnei ata.<verse eid="1CH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ētahi atu Rīwaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 9:28" />Ko ētahi hoki o rātou ki te tiaki i ngā oko mō te mahi, tatau ai ina kawea mai ki roto, tatau ai anō ina mauria ki waho. <verse eid="1CH 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 9:29" />I whakaritea hoki ētahi o rātou hei tiaki mō ngā oko, mō ngā mea mahi katoa anō o te wāhi tapu, mō te parāoa, mō te wāina, mō te hinu, mō te parakihe, mō ngā mea kakara. <verse eid="1CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 9:30" />Ko ētahi anō o ngā tama a ngā tohunga hei hanga i te hinu o ngā mea kakara. <verse eid="1CH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 9:31" />Nā, ko Matitia, ko tētahi o ngā Rīwaiti, ko te mātāmua a Harumu Korahi, ko tāna mahi tūturu ko te tirotiro i ngā mea i tunua ki te rīhi. <verse eid="1CH 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 9:32" />Nā, ko ētahi o ō rātou tēina, o ngā tama a ngā Kohati, ngā kaiwhakaaro ki te taro aroaro, kia oti te hanga i tēnei hāpati, i tēnei hāpati.<verse eid="1CH 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 9:33" />Ko ngā kaiwaiata anō ēnei, ko ngā upoko o ngā whare o ngā mātua o ngā Rīwaiti, i noho rātou i roto i ngā rūma, ā, i noho wātea rātou i ērā atu mahi i tā rātou nā mahi hoki rātou i te ao, i te pō. <verse eid="1CH 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 9:34" />Nā, ko ēnei ngā upoko o ngā whare o ngā mātua o ngā Rīwaiti, ko ngā upoko anō rātou i ō rātou whakatupuranga; i noho ēnei ki Hiruhārama.<verse eid="1CH 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Tūpuna me ngā Uri o Kīngi Haora</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 8:29-38">1 Whakapapa 8.29-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 9:35" />I noho anō ki Kipeono te pāpā o Kipeono, a Teiere; ko te ingoa o tāna wahine ko Maaka. <verse eid="1CH 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 9:36" />Nā, ko tāna mātāmua ko Aparono, ko Turu hoki, ko Kihi, ko Paara, ko Nere, ko Nātapa, <verse eid="1CH 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 9:37" />ko Keroro, ko Ahio, ko Hakaraia, ko Mikiroto. <verse eid="1CH 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 9:38" />Whānau ake tā Mikiroto, ko Himeana. I noho anō ēnei ki ō rātou tuākana ki Hiruhārama, ki te wāhi e anga tonu ana ki ō rātou tuākana. <verse eid="1CH 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 9:39" />Whānau ake tā Nere, ko Kihi; whānau ake tā Kihi, ko Haora; whānau ake tā Haora, ko Honatana, ko Marikihua, ko Apinarapa, ko Ehepaara. <verse eid="1CH 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 9:40" />Ko te tama a Honatana: ko Meripaara; whānau ake tā Meripaara, ko Mika. <verse eid="1CH 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 9:41" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Mika: ko Pitono, ko Mereke, ko Taharea, ko Ahata. <verse eid="1CH 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 9:42" />Whānau ake tā Ahata, ko Iaraha; whānau ake tā Iaraha, ko Aremete, ko Ātamawete, ko Tīmiri. Whānau ake tā Tīmiri, ko Mota. <verse eid="1CH 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 9:43" />Whānau ake tā Mota, ko Pinea; ko tāna tama ko Repaia, ko tāna tama ko Ereaha, ko tāna tama ko Atere. <verse eid="1CH 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 9:44" />Nā, tokoono ngā tama a Atere, ko ō rātou ingoa ēnei: ko Atarikama, ko Pokeru, ko Ihimaera, ko Hearia, ko Opāria, ko Hanana; ko ngā tama ēnei a Atere.<verse eid="1CH 9:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CH 10" />
  <para style="s">Te Matenga o Haora rātou ko āna Tama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1SA 31:1-13">1 Hamuera 31.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 10:1" />Nā, kua whawhai ngā Pirihitini ki a Īharaira; ā, ka whati ngā tāngata o Īharaira i te aroaro o ngā Pirihitini, ā, hinga ana, mate rawa, i Maunga Kiripoa. <verse eid="1CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 10:2" />Nā, ka whāia e ngā Pirihitini a Haora rātou ko āna tama; ā, patua iho e ngā Pirihitini a Honatana rātou ko Apinarapa, ko Marikihua, ngā tama a Haora. <verse eid="1CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 10:3" />Nā, kua taikaha haere te whawhai ki a Haora, ā, kua mau ia i ngā kaikōpere; ā, kua hē tōna manawa i ngā kaikōpere.<verse eid="1CH 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 10:4" />Kātahi a Haora ka mea ki tāna kaimau patu, “Unuhia tāu hoari, werohia hoki ahau; kei haere mai tēnei hunga kokotikore, kei whakatupu kino i ahau.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 10:4">Otiia kīhai i pai tāna kaimau patu; he nui hoki nō tōna hopohopo. Heoi, ka mau a Haora ki tāna hoari, hinga iho ana ki runga. <verse eid="1CH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 10:5" />Ā, nō te kitenga o tāna kaimau patu kua mate a Haora, ka hinga hoki ia ki runga ki tāna hoari, ā, ka mate. <verse eid="1CH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 10:6" />Heoi, ka mate a Haora me āna tama tokotoru; mate tahi ana tōna whare katoa.<verse eid="1CH 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 10:7" />Ā, nō te kitenga o ngā tāngata katoa o Īharaira i te raorao kua whati rātou, kua mate hoki a Haora rātou ko āna tama, whakarērea ake e rātou ō rātou pā, ā, rere ana. Nā, ka haere mai ngā Pirihitini, ā, nohoia iho e rātou.<verse eid="1CH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 10:8" />Ā, i te aonga ake, i te haerenga mai o ngā Pirihitini ki te muru i te hunga i patua, nā, ka kitea a Haora rātou ko āna tama e takoto ana i runga i Maunga Kiripoa. <verse eid="1CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 10:9" />Nā, huia ana ōna e rātou, tangohia ana tōna upoko me āna patu, tukua ana kia kawea puta noa i te whenua o ngā Pirihitini ā tawhio noa, kia kauwhautia ki ā rātou whakapakoko, ki te iwi. <verse eid="1CH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 10:10" />I whakatakotoria hoki e rātou āna patu ki te whare o ō rātou atua, ā, ko tōna upoko titia ake e rātou ki te whare o Rakono.<verse eid="1CH 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 10:11" />Ā, nō te rongonga o Iapehe Kireara katoa ki ngā mea katoa i mea ai ngā Pirihitini ki a Haora, <verse eid="1CH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 10:12" />ka whakatika ngā mārohirohi katoa, tangohia iho e rātou te tinana o Haora, me ngā tinana o āna tama, kawea ana ki Iapehe, tanumia ana ō rātou wheua ki raro i tētahi oki i Iapehe, ā, e whitu ngā rā i nohopuku ai rātou.<verse eid="1CH 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 10:13" />Heoi, kua mate a Haora mō tōna hē; i hē ai ia ki a Ihowā, mō te kupu a Ihowā kīhai nei i puritia e ia; mōna hoki i ui ki tētahi, i a ia nei te atua māori, he rapu whakaaro, <verse eid="1CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 10:14" />ā, kīhai i rapu whakaaro i a Ihowā. Nō reira, i whakamatea ai ia e ia, ā, hurihia kētia ana te kīngitanga ki a Rāwiri tama a Hehe.<verse eid="1CH 10:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CH 11" />
  <para style="s">Ka Whakawahia hei Kīngi a Rāwiri o Īharaira me Hūrā</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:1-10">2 Hamuera 5.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 11:1" />Nā, ka huihui a Īharaira katoa ki a Rāwiri ki Heperona, ā, ka mea, “Tēnei mātou, he wheua nōu he kikokiko nōu. <verse eid="1CH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 11:2" />I mua ake nei, i te mea anō ko Haora te kīngi, ko koe te kaikawe atu te kaikawe mai, i a Īharaira. Kua kōrerotia anō koe e Ihowā, e tōu Atua: Ko koe hei hēpara mō tāku iwi, mō Īharaira, ko koe anō hei tino tangata mō tāku iwi, mō Īharaira.”<verse eid="1CH 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 11:3" />Nā, ka haere ngā kaumātua katoa o Īharaira ki te kīngi, ki Heperona, ka whakarite kawenata a Rāwiri ki a rātou ki Heperona ki te aroaro o Ihowā; ā, whakawahia ana e rātou a Rāwiri hei kīngi mō Īharaira, ko tā Ihowā hoki i kī ai, arā ko tā Hamuera.<verse eid="1CH 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ka Riro a Hiruhārama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 11:4" />Nā, ka haere a Rāwiri rātou ko Īharaira katoa ki Hiruhārama arā ki Iepuhu; i reira anō ngā Iepuhi, ngā tāngata whenua. <verse eid="1CH 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 11:5" />Nā, ka mea ngā tāngata o Iepuhu ki Rāwiri, “E kore koe e tae mai ki konei.” Heoi, kua riro i a Rāwiri te pourewa i Hiona; ko te pā ia o Rāwiri.<verse eid="1CH 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 11:6" />Nā, ka mea a Rāwiri, “Ko te tangata māna te patu tuatahi ki ngā Iepuhi, hei tino tangata ia, hei rangatira.” Nā, ko Ioapa tama a Teruia kua tae wawe, ā, meinga ana ko ia te tino tangata.<verse eid="1CH 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 11:7" />Nā, ka noho a Rāwiri ki te pourewa; koia i huaina ai e rātou a reira ko te pā o Rāwiri. <verse eid="1CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 11:8" />Ā, i hangā e ia te pā ā tawhio noa, o Miro mai ā taka noa; ā, nā Ioapa i whakaora tērā atu wāhi o te pā. <verse eid="1CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 11:9" />Nā, ka tino nui haere a Rāwiri, i a ia hoki a Ihowā, te Atua o ngā mano.<verse eid="1CH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Tāngata Mārohirohi a Rāwiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 23:8-39">2 Hamuera 23.8-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 11:10" />Nā, ko ngā tino tāngata ēnei a Rāwiri, i kaha rawa nei me ia mō tōna rangatiratanga, rātou ko Īharaira katoa, hei whakakīngi i a ia; hei pērā me tā Ihowā i kī ai mō Īharaira. <verse eid="1CH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 11:11" />Ā, ko te tokomaha tēnei o ngā mārohirohi a Rāwiri: ko Iahopeama, tama a tētahi Hakamoni, te rangatira o te toru tekau; i ara ake tāna tao ki ngā rau e toru ā patua iho e ia i te whakaekenga kotahi.<verse eid="1CH 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 11:12" />I muri i a ia ko Ereātara tama a Roro Ahohi; ko ia tētahi o ngā mārohirohi tokotoru. <verse eid="1CH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 11:13" />I a Rāwiri ia i Paharamime, ā, i huihui ngā Pirihitini ki reira ki te whawhai, ā, i reira tētahi wāhi whenua e kapi ana i te pārei; nā, kua rere te iwi i te aroaro o ngā Pirihitini. <verse eid="1CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 11:14" />Nā, tū ana rāua i waenganui o taua wāhi, ā, ka mau i a rāua, patua iho e rāua ngā Pirihitini; nā, nui atu te whakaoranga i whakaora ai a Ihowā.<verse eid="1CH 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 11:15" />Nā, ka haere ngā rangatira tokotoru, nō te toru tekau, ki raro, ki te kāmaka ki a Rāwiri, ki te ana o Aturama; ā, ko te ope o ngā Pirihitini i te raorao i Repaima e noho ā-puni ana. <verse eid="1CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 11:16" />Nā, i roto a Rāwiri i te pourewa i taua wā, ā, ko ngā hōia pupuri a ngā Pirihitini i Pēterehema i taua wā. <verse eid="1CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 11:17" />Nā, ka minamina a Rāwiri, ā, ka mea, “Auē, me he tangata hei mea wai mai mōku i te puna i Pēterehema, i tērā i te kūwaha!” <verse eid="1CH 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 11:18" />Nā, tika ana taua tokotoru nā waenganui o te puni o ngā Pirihitini, ā, utuhia mai ana he wai i te puna o Pēterehema, i tērā i te kūwaha; tangohia ana e rātou, mauria ana ki a Rāwiri. Otiia kīhai a Rāwiri i pai ki te inu, engari ringihia ana e ia hei mea ki a Ihowā. <verse eid="1CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 11:19" />I mea ia, “Auē, mā tōku Atua ahau e ārai kei mea i tēnei! Kia inumia koia e ahau ngā toto o ēnei tāngata, me i kotahi nei kua mate?” Me i kotahi hoki rātou kua mate i te tikinga atu. Nā reira i kore ai ia i pai ki te inu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 11:19">Ko ēnei ngā mahi a aua toa tokotoru.<verse eid="1CH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 11:20" />Nā, ko Āpihai teina o Ioapa te rangatira o taua tokotoru; i ara ake tāna tao ki ngā rau e toru, patua iho e ia; i whai ingoa ia i roto i te tokotoru. <verse eid="1CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 11:21" />O te tokotoru, nui atu tōna korōria i tō te tokorua, ā, meinga ana ko ia hei rangatira mō rātou. Otiia, kīhai ia i uru ki te tokotoru tuatahi.<verse eid="1CH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 11:22" />Me Penaia tama a Iehoiara, he tama nā tētahi tangata toa o Kapateere, he nui āna mahi, nāna i patu ngā tama tokorua a Ariere o Moapa; i haere anō ia ki raro, ā, patua ana e ia tētahi raiona i roto i te rua i te wā o te hukarere. <verse eid="1CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 11:23" />Nāna hoki tētahi Īhipiana i patu, he tangata nui, e rima ngā whatīanga te roa. He tao anō i te ringa o taua Īhipiana koia anō kei te rākau a te kaiwhatu; nā, haere ana ia ki raro, ki a ia, he tokotoko hoki tāna, ā, kapohia ana e ia te tao i roto i te ringa o te Īhipiana, patua iho ia ki tāna tao anō. <verse eid="1CH 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 11:24" />Nā Penaia tama a Iehoiara ēnei mahi; i whai ingoa anō ia i ngā toa tokotoru. <verse eid="1CH 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 11:25" />Nā, nōna te korōria nui o te toru tekau; otiia kīhai ia i uru ki te tokotoru tuatahi. Nā, meinga ana ia e Rāwiri hei rangatira mō āna kaitiaki.<verse eid="1CH 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 11:26" />Me ngā māia hoki o ngā ope: ko Atahere teina o Ioapa, ko Erehanana tama a Roro o Pēterehema, <verse eid="1CH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 11:27" />ko Hamoto Harori, ko Herete Peroni; <verse eid="1CH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 11:28" />ko Ira tama a Ikehe Tekoi, ko Apiētere Anatoti; <verse eid="1CH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 11:29" />ko Hipekai Huhati, ko Irai Ahohi; <verse eid="1CH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 11:30" />ko Maharai Netopati, ko Herere tama a Paana, he Netopati; <verse eid="1CH 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 11:31" />ko Itai tama a Ripai, nō Kipea, nō ngā tama a Pineamine, ko Penaia Piratoni; <verse eid="1CH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 11:32" />ko Hūrai, nō ngā awaawa o Kāha, ko Apiere Arapati; <verse eid="1CH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 11:33" />ko Ātamawete Paharumi, ko Eriāhapa Haaraponi; <verse eid="1CH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 11:34" />ko ngā tama a Hāheme Kitoni, ko Honatana tama a Hake Harari; <verse eid="1CH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 11:35" />ko Ahiama tama a Hakara Harari, ko Eripara tama a Uru; <verse eid="1CH 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 11:36" />ko Hewhere Mekerati, ko Āhia Peroni; <verse eid="1CH 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 11:37" />ko Hetero Karameri, ko Naarai tama a Etepai; <verse eid="1CH 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 11:38" />ko Hoera teina o Nātana, ko Mipihara tama a Hakeri; <verse eid="1CH 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 11:39" />Ko Tereke Āmoni, ko Nahari Peeroti, ko te kaimau o ngā patu a Ioapa tama a Teruia; <verse eid="1CH 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 11:40" />ko Ira Ītiri, ko Karepa Ītiri; <verse eid="1CH 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 11:41" />ko Uria Hiti, ko Tāpara tama a Aharai; <verse eid="1CH 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 11:42" />ko Arina tama a Hiti Reupeni, he rangatira nō ngā Reupeni, e toru tekau ōna hoa; <verse eid="1CH 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 11:43" />ko Hanana tama a Maaka, ko Iohapata Mitini; <verse eid="1CH 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 11:44" />ko Utia Ahaterati, ko Hama rāua ko Teiere, ko ngā tama a Hōtama Aroeri; <verse eid="1CH 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 11:45" />ko Teriaere tama a Himiri, rāua ko tōna teina ko Toha te Titi; <verse eid="1CH 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 11:46" />ko Eriere Mahawi, rātou ko Teripai, ko Tohawia, he tama nā Erenaama, ko Itima Moapi; <verse eid="1CH 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 11:47" />ko Eriere, ko Ōpere, ko Taahiere Metopai.<verse eid="1CH 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CH 12" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Rangapū a Rāwiri i te Koraha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 12:1" />Ko te hunga tēnei i haere ki a Rāwiri ki Tikiraka, i a ia anō e pūtiki tonu ana i roto i te pā i te wehi o Haora tama a Kihi; nō ngā mārohirohi rātou, hei tuarā mōna ki te whawhai. <verse eid="1CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 12:2" />He hunga kukume kōpere rātou, ko te mauī, ko te matau, ki te kōtaha kōhatu, ki te kōpere i te pere; nō ngā tēina anō o Haora, nō Pineamine.<verse eid="1CH 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 12:3" />Ko Ahiētere te upoko, nā ko Ioaha, he tama rāua nā Hemaa Kipeati; ko Ietiere, ko Perete he tama nā Ātamawete; ko Peraka, ko Iehu Anatoti, <verse eid="1CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 12:4" />ko Ihimāia Kipeoni, he mārohirohi ia i roto i te toru tekau, he rangatira anō nō te toru tekau; ko Heremaia, ko Tahatiere, ko Iohanana, ko Iotāpara Kererati, <verse eid="1CH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 12:5" />ko Erutai, ko Terimoto, ko Pearia, ko Hemaria, ko Hepatia Harupi; <verse eid="1CH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 12:6" />ko Erekana, ko Ihīa, ko Atarēre, ko Toētere, ko Iahopeama, he Korahi rātou; <verse eid="1CH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 12:7" />ko Toera, ko Tepāria, he tama nā Ierohama o Keroro.<verse eid="1CH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 12:8" />Nā, o ngā Kari i maunu ētahi ki a Rāwiri ki te pourewa i te koraha, he tangata mārohirohi, i rauhangatia mō te whawhai, he hunga hāpai i te whakangungu rākau, i te tao. Ko ō rātou mata me te mea he kanohi raiona, rite tonu ō rātou tere ki tō ngā anaterope i runga i ngā maunga: <verse eid="1CH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 12:9" />ko Ētere te upoko, ko Opāria te tuarua, ko Eriapa te tuatoru; <verse eid="1CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 12:10" />ko Mihimana te tuawhā, ko Heremaia te tuarima; <verse eid="1CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 12:11" />ko Atai te tuaono, ko Eriere te tuawhitu; <verse eid="1CH 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 12:12" />ko Iohanana te tuawaru, ko Eretāpara te tuaiwa; <verse eid="1CH 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 12:13" />ko Heremaia te tuatekau, ko Makapanai te tekau mā tahi.<verse eid="1CH 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 12:14" />Ko ēnei o ngā tama a Kara he rangatira ope; ko te mea iti rawa hei rangatira mō te rau, ā, ko te mea nui rawa hei rangatira mō te mano. <verse eid="1CH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 12:15" />Ko te hunga tēnei i whiti nei i Horano i te marama tuatahi, i te mea kua ngawhā ki runga i ōna pareparenga katoa; ā, whati ana i a rātou te hunga katoa o ngā raorao whaka te rāwhiti, ā, whaka te hauāuru.<verse eid="1CH 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 12:16" />I haere mai anō ētahi o ngā tama a Pineamine me ētahi o a Hūrā ki te pourewa ki a Rāwiri. <verse eid="1CH 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 12:17" />Nā, ka puta a Rāwiri ki te whakatau i a rātou, ā, ka oho, ka mea ki a rātou, “Ki te mea he haere pai mai tā koutou ki ahau, he whakauru, ka kotahi tonu ō tātou ngākau. Tēnā ki te tinihanga, he tuku i ahau ki ōku hoariri, i te mea kāhore nei he tutū a ōku ringa, mā te Atua o ō tātou mātua e titiro mai, e riri.”<verse eid="1CH 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 12:18" />Nā, kua tau te wairua ki a Amahai, ko ia nei te rangatira o te toru tekau, ā, ka kī ia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">“Kei a koe mātou, e Rāwiri!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 12:18">Hei hoa mōu, e te tama a Hehe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">Kia mau, kia mau te rongo ki a koe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 12:18">kia mau anō ki ōu whakauru!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 12:18">Ko tōu Atua hoki hei whakauru mōu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 12:18">Nā, kua riro rātou i a Rāwiri, ā, meinga ana rātou e ia hei rangatira rangapū.<verse eid="1CH 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 12:19" />Nā, o Mānahi hoki i papahoro ētahi ki a Rāwiri, i a ia i haere tahi ai me ngā Pirihitini ki te whawhai ki a Haora. (Otiia, kīhai rātou i uru ki a rātou; i panaia hoki ia e ngā rangatira o ngā Pirihitini, he mea whakaaro anō e rātou, i mea rātou, “Tērā ia e taka atu ki tōna ariki, ki a Haora, ko ō tātou upoko e raru.”) <verse eid="1CH 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 12:20" />I a ia e haere ana ki Tikiraka, ka papahoro mai ki a ia o Mānahi: ko Arana, ko Iotāpara, ko Teriaere, ko Mikaera, ko Iotāpara, ko Erihu, ko Tiritai, he rangatira nō ngā mano o Mānahi. <verse eid="1CH 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 12:21" />Ko rātou ngā whakauru mō Rāwiri ki te whawhai ki ngā torohē; he mārohirohi hoki, he toa, rātou katoa, he rangatira ope. <verse eid="1CH 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 12:22" />I haere hoki rātou i taua wā ki a Rāwiri i tēnā rā, i tēnā rā, hei whakauru mōna, nō kua nui te ope, ānō he ope nā te Atua.<verse eid="1CH 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Ope Taua a Rāwiri kei Heperona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 12:23" />Ko te tokomaha tēnei o ngā rangatira, he hunga i rite rawa mō te whawhai, i haere ki a Rāwiri ki Heperona hei whakariro i te kīngitanga o Haora ki a ia, kia rite ai ki tā Ihowā kupu.<verse eid="1CH 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 12:24" />Ko ngā tama a Hūrā, he hunga hāpai i te whakangungu rākau, i te tao, e ono mano e waru rau, rite rawa i te patu mō te whawhai. <verse eid="1CH 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 12:25" />O ngā tama a Himiona, he mārohirohi, he toa mō te whawhai, e whitu mano kotahi rau. <verse eid="1CH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 12:26" />O ngā tama a Rīwai e whā mano e ono rau. <verse eid="1CH 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 12:27" />Nā, ko Iehoiara te rangatira o te whare o Ārona, ā, e toru mano e whitu rau ōna hoa; <verse eid="1CH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 12:28" />me Hāroko anō, he taitama mārohirohi, he toa, rātou ko te whare o tōna pāpā, e rua tekau mā rua ngā rangatira. <verse eid="1CH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 12:29" />Ā, o ngā tama a Pineamine, o ngā tēina o Haora, e toru mano. Ko tō rātou nuinga hoki i mau tonu ki te whare o Haora ā taea noatia taua rā. <verse eid="1CH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 12:30" />Nā, o ngā tama a Ēparaima, e rua tekau mano e waru rau, he mārohirohi, he toa, he hunga whai ingoa i roto i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua. <verse eid="1CH 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 12:31" />Ā, o tētahi tānga o te iwi o Mānahi, kotahi tekau mā waru mano, he mea whakahua ō rātou ingoa, hei haere ki te whakakīngi i a Rāwiri. <verse eid="1CH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 12:32" />Nā, o ngā tama a Ihākara, he hunga mōhio ki ngā wā, i mōhio ai ki ngā mahi mā Īharaira; e rua rau ō rātou ariki; kei o ēnei māngai anō he tikanga mō ō rātou tēina. <verse eid="1CH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 12:33" />O Hepurona, ko te hunga e āhei te haere ki te whawhai, he mōhio ki te tātai i te riri, e mau ana i ngā mea katoa mō te whawhai, e rima tekau mano. He hunga e taea te whakatika te tātai o te riri, ā, kāhore ō rātou ngākau rua. <verse eid="1CH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 12:34" />Ā, o Napatari kotahi mano ngā rangatira, e toru tekau mā whitu mano ō rātou hoa, rite rawa i te whakangungu rākau, i te tao. <verse eid="1CH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 12:35" />Nā, o ngā Rāni, he hunga mōhio ki te tatau, e rua tekau mā waru mano e ono rau. <verse eid="1CH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 12:36" />O Āhera, he hunga haere ki te whawhai, he mōhio ki te tatau, e whā tekau mano. <verse eid="1CH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 12:37" />Nā, o tērā taha o Horano, o ngā Reupeni, o ngā Kari, o tētahi tānga o te hapū o Mānahi, e mau ana i ngā mea whawhai katoa mō te tatau, kotahi rau e rua tekau mano.<verse eid="1CH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 12:38" />Ko ēnei, he tangata whawhai katoa, he mōhio ki te tatau, he tapatahi tonu te ngākau i haere ai ki Heperona ki te mea i a Rāwiri hei kīngi mō Īharaira katoa. Nā, ko ērā atu katoa o Īharaira, kotahi tonu te ngākau mō te whakakīngi i a Rāwiri. <verse eid="1CH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 12:39" />Ā, i reira rātou i a Rāwiri, e toru ngā rā e kai ana, e inu ana; he mea taka hoki nā ō rātou tuākana, tēina. <verse eid="1CH 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 12:40" />Nā, ko te hunga tata ki a rātou, tae noa atu ki a Ihākara, ki a Hepurona, ki a Napatari, i kawe taro mai i runga i ngā kāihe, i ngā kāmera, i ngā muera, ā, i ngā kau, he kai, he parāoa, he papa piki, he tautau karepe, he wāina, he hinu, he kau, he hipi, tōna tini; he koa hoki nō Īharaira.<verse eid="1CH 12:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CH 13" />
  <para style="s">Ka Kawea te Āka o te Kawenata mai i Kiriata Tearimi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 6:1-11">2 Hamuera 6.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 13:1" />Nā, ka rūnanga a Rāwiri ki ngā rangatira o ngā mano, o ngā rau, arā ki ngā rangatira katoa. <verse eid="1CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 13:2" />Ā, i mea a Rāwiri ki te whakaminenga katoa o Īharaira, “Ki te pai koutou, ā, ka tika mai i tō tātou Atua, i a Ihowā, me tuku tāngata tātou ki ia wāhi, ki ia wāhi, ki ō tātou tēina kua mahue nei ki ngā whenua katoa o Īharaira, ki a rātou ko ngā tohunga, ko ngā Rīwaiti, ki ngā pā, ki ngā wāhi o waho ake o aua pā, kia huihui mai rātou ki a tātou. <verse eid="1CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 13:3" />Ā, me whakahoki mai e tātou te āka a tō tātou Atua ki a tātou. Kīhai hoki tātou i rapu tikanga ki reira i ngā rā o Haora.” <verse eid="1CH 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 13:4" />Nā, ka mea te whakaminenga katoa kia pērā anō rātou; he tika hoki taua mea ki te titiro a te iwi katoa.<verse eid="1CH 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 13:5" />Heoi, ka huihuia e Rāwiri a Īharaira katoa i Hihoro, i te awa o Īhipa ā tae i noa ki te haerenga atu ki Hāmata, hei mau ake i te āka a te Atua i Kiriata Tearimi. <verse eid="1CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 13:6" />Nā, ko te haerenga o Rāwiri rātou ko Īharaira katoa ki Paaraha, arā ki Kiriata Tearimi o Hūrā, hei mau ake i reira i te āka a te Atua, a Ihowā e noho nei i runga o ngā kerupima, i huaina nei ki te Ingoa.<verse eid="1CH 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 13:7" />Nā, ka mauria e rātou te āka a te Atua i runga i te kāta hou, ā, tangohia ana mai i te whare o Apinarapa; ā, nā Uha rāua ko Ahio i ārahi te kāta. <verse eid="1CH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 13:8" />Nā, ka whakapaua te kaha e Rāwiri rātou ko Īharaira katoa ki te tākaro ki te aroaro o te Atua; he waiata anō tā rātou, he hāpa, he timipera, he himipora, he tētere.<verse eid="1CH 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 13:9" />Ā, ka tae ki te patunga wīti a Hirono, ka totoro te ringa o Uha ki te pupuri i te āka; i tāpatupatu, hoki ngā kau. <verse eid="1CH 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 13:10" />Nā, ka mura te riri o Ihowā ki a Uha; patua iho mō tōna ringa i totoro ki te āka; ā mate iho ia i reira i te aroaro o te Atua.<verse eid="1CH 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 13:11" />Nā, ka pōuri a Rāwiri mō te tōreretanga i tōrere ai a Ihowā ki a Uha. Nā, huaina ana e ia taua wāhi ko Pereteuha; e mau nei anō ā taea noatia tēnei rā.<verse eid="1CH 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 13:12" />Nā, ka wehi a Rāwiri i a Ihowā i taua rā; ā, ka mea ia, “Me pēhea tāku kawe mai i te āka a Ihowā ki ahau ki tōku whare?” <verse eid="1CH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 13:13" />Heoi, kīhai a Rāwiri i tango i te āka ki a ia, ki te pā o Rāwiri; i kawea kētia e ia ki te whare o Opere-Eroma Kiti. <verse eid="1CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 13:14" />Nā, noho ana te āka a te Atua ki te whānau a Opere-Eroma, ki tōna whare hoki, e toru ngā marama, ā, ka manaakitia e Ihowā te whare o Opere-Eroma me āna mea katoa.<verse eid="1CH 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CH 14" />
  <para style="s">Te Whare me te Whānau a Rāwiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:11-16">2 Hamuera 5.11-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 14:1" />Nā, ka tonoa ētahi karere e Hīrama kīngi o Tāira ki a Rāwiri, me ētahi rākau, he hīta, me ngā kaimahi kōhatu, me ngā kaimahi rākau, hei hanga whare mōna. <verse eid="1CH 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 14:2" />Nā, ka mōhio a Rāwiri kua whakapūmautia ia e Ihowā hei kīngi mō Īharaira, kua whakanuia hoki tōna rangatiratanga, he whakaaro ki tāna iwi, ki a Īharaira.<verse eid="1CH 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 14:3" />Nā, ka tangohia anō e Rāwiri he wāhine māna ki Hiruhārama, ā, ka whānau anō ētahi atu tama, ētahi atu tamāhine mā Rāwiri. <verse eid="1CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 14:4" />Ā, ko ngā ingoa ēnei o āna i whānau ki Hiruhārama: ko Hāmua, ko Hōpapa, ko Nātana, ko Horomona, <verse eid="1CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 14:5" />ko Ipihara, ko Erihua, ko Ereparete; <verse eid="1CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 14:6" />ko Noka, ko Nepeke, ko Iāpia; <verse eid="1CH 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 14:7" />ko Erihama, ko Pēriara, ko Eriparete.<verse eid="1CH 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Patunga o ngā Piritihini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:17-25">2 Hamuera 5.17-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 14:8" />Ā, nō te rongonga o ngā Pirihitini kua oti a Rāwiri te whakawahi hei kīngi mō Īharaira katoa, ka haere ngā Pirihitini katoa ki te rapu i a Rāwiri; ā, ka rongo a Rāwiri, ā, ka puta ia ki te tū i a rātou. <verse eid="1CH 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 14:9" />Nā, tērā ngā Pirihitini kua haere mai, ā, kua takahi i te raorao o Repaima. <verse eid="1CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 14:10" />Nā, ka ui a Rāwiri ki te Atua, ka mea, “Me haere rānei ahau ki ngā Pirihitini? E hōmai rānei rātou e koe ki tōku ringa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 14:10">Nā, ka mea a Ihowā ki a ia, “Haere; ka hoatu hoki rātou e ahau ki tōu ringa.”<verse eid="1CH 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 14:11" />Heoi, kua tae mai rātou ki Paara-Peratimi; patua iho rātou i reira e Rāwiri. Nā, ka mea a Rāwiri, “Pakaru ana i te Atua ōku hoariri, he mea nā tōku ringa; koia anō kei te pākaruhanga wai.” Nā reira i huaina ai te ingoa o taua wāhi ko Pāraperatimi. <verse eid="1CH 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 14:12" />Ā, mahue ana i a rātou ō rātou atua ki reira, nā, ka whakahau a Rāwiri, ā, tahuna ana ki te ahi.<verse eid="1CH 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 14:13" />Nā, ka takahia anō e ngā Pirihitini te raorao. <verse eid="1CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 14:14" />Ā, ka ui anō a Rāwiri ki te Atua, ā, ka mea te Atua ki a ia, “Kaua e haere ki te whai i a rātou; me tahuri i a rātou, ka āwhio haere ki a rātou, ka whakaeke i a rātou i te ritenga o ngā maperi. <verse eid="1CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 14:15" />Ā, ka rangona e koe te tapuwae haruru i runga i ngā maperi, ko reira koe puta ai ki te whawhai; nō te mea kua riro te Atua ki mua i a koe ki te patu i te ope o ngā Pirihitini.” <verse eid="1CH 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 14:16" />Nā, pērātia ana e Rāwiri me tā te Atua i whakahau ai ki a ia; ā, patua iho e rātou te ope o ngā Pirihitini i Kipeono, ā tae noa ki Katere.<verse eid="1CH 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 14:17" />Nā, kua pakū te ingoa o Rāwiri ki ngā whenua katoa, ā, ka mea a Ihowā i te wehi ki a ia kia pā ki ngā iwi katoa.<verse eid="1CH 14:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CH 15" />
  <para style="s">E Whakarite ana kia Kawea te Āka o te Kawenata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 15:1" />Nā, ka hangā e Rāwiri ētahi whare mōna ki te pā o Rāwiri; i whakapaia anō e ia he wāhi, i whakatū tēneti hoki mō te āka a te Atua. <verse eid="1CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 15:2" />Kātahi a Rāwiri ka mea, “E kore e pai kia kawea te āka a te Atua e tētahi atu, engari mā ngā Rīwaiti; ko rātou hoki tā Ihowā i whiriwhiri ai hei mau i te āka a te Atua, hei mahi hoki ki a ia i ngā wā katoa.”<verse eid="1CH 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 15:3" />Nā, ka huihuia e Rāwiri a Īharaira katoa ki Hiruhārama, ki te kawe i te āka a Ihowā ki tōna wāhi i whakapaia rā e ia mōna. <verse eid="1CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 15:4" />I huihuia anō e Rāwiri ngā tama a Ārona rātou ko ngā Rīwaiti: <verse eid="1CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 15:5" />o ngā tama a Kohata, ko Uriere, ko te rangatira, rātou ko ōna tēina kotahi rau e rua tekau; <verse eid="1CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 15:6" />o ngā tama a Merari, ko Ahaia, ko te rangatira, rātou ko ōna tēina e rua rau e rua tekau; <verse eid="1CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 15:7" />o ngā tama a Kerehoma, ko Hoera, ko te rangatira, rātou ko ōna tēina kotahi rau e toru tekau; <verse eid="1CH 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 15:8" />o ngā tama a Eritapana, ko Hemaia, ko te rangatira, rātou ko ōna tēina e rua rau; <verse eid="1CH 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 15:9" />o ngā tama a Heperona, ko Eriere, ko te rangatira, rātou ko ōna tēina e waru tekau; <verse eid="1CH 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 15:10" />o ngā tama a Utiere, ko Aminarapa, ko te rangatira, rātou ko ōna tēina kotahi rau kotahi tekau mā rua.<verse eid="1CH 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 15:11" />I karangatia anō e Rāwiri a Hāroko rāua ko Apiātara, ngā tohunga, rātou ko ngā Rīwaiti, ko Uriere, ko Ahaia, ko Hoera, ko Hemaia, ko Eriere, ko Aminarapa, <verse eid="1CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 15:12" />i mea ia ki a rātou, “Ko koutou ngā rangatira o ngā whare o ngā mātua o ngā Rīwaiti. Whakatapua koutou, koutou ko ō koutou tēina; mā koutou hoki e kawe te āka a Ihowā, a te Atua o Īharaira ki te wāhi i whakapaia e ahau mōna. <verse eid="1CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 15:13" />Nō te mea hoki ehara i a koutou i kawe i te tuatahi, nō reira i tōrere mai ai a Ihowā, tō tātou Atua ki a tātou, nō te mea kīhai i rite ki te tikanga tā tātou rapu i a ia.” <verse eid="1CH 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 15:14" />Heoi, kei te whakatapu ngā tohunga me ngā Rīwaiti i a rātou, kia kawea ai e rātou te āka a Ihowā, a te Atua o Īharaira. <verse eid="1CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 15:15" />Nā, ka amohia e ngā tama a ngā Rīwaiti te āka a te Atua, ka pērā me tā Mohi i whakahau ai, me tā Ihowā i kōrero ai, ko ngā amo i runga i ō rātou pokohiwi.<verse eid="1CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 15:16" />I kōrero anō a Rāwiri ki ngā rangatira o ngā Rīwaiti kia whakaritea ō rātou tēina hei kaiwaiata i runga i ngā mea waiata, i ngā hātere, i ngā hāpa, i ngā himipora, he mea e rangona, he reo koa hoki e whakaarahia ana e rātou.<verse eid="1CH 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 15:17" />Nā, ka whakaritea e ngā Rīwaiti, ko Hēmana tama a Hoera; o ōna tēina hoki ko Āhapa tama a Perekia; o ō rātou tēina, o ngā tama a Merari ko Ētana tama a Kuhaia; <verse eid="1CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 15:18" />o ō rātou tēina, ngā tuarua, hei hoa mō rātou, ko Hakaraia, ko Pene, ko Taatiere, ko Hemirāmoto, ko Tehiere, ko Uni, ko Eriapa, ko Penaia, ko Maaheia, ko Matitia, ko Eriperehe, ko Mikineia, ko Opere-Eroma, ko Teiere; he kaitiaki kūwaha rātou.<verse eid="1CH 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 15:19" />Nā, whakaritea ana ko ngā kaiwaiata, ko Hēmana, ko Āhapa, ko Ētana, hei whakatangi i ngā himipora parāhi; <verse eid="1CH 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 15:20" />nā, ko Hakaraia, ko Atiere, ko Hemirāmoto, ko Tehiere, ko Uni, ko Eriapa, ko Maaheia, ko Penaia, he mea i runga i ngā hātere, he mea Arāmoto; <verse eid="1CH 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 15:21" />ā, ko Matitia, ko Eriperehe, ko Mikineia, ko Opere-Eroma, ko Teiere, ko Atatia, i runga i ngā hāpa, he mea Heminiti, hei whakarewa. <verse eid="1CH 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 15:22" />Nā, ko Kenania anō, ko te upoko a ngā Rīwaiti, hei whakahua: i whakaako anō ia ki te whakahua waiata; he mōhio hoki ia.<verse eid="1CH 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 15:23" />Ko Perekia rāua ko Erekana ngā kaitiaki tatau mō te āka. <verse eid="1CH 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 15:24" />Ko ngā tohunga anō, ko Hepania, ko Iohapata, ko Netanēre, ko Amahai, ko Hakaraia, ko Penaia, ko Eriētere, hei whakatangi i ngā tētere ki mua i te āka a te Atua; ā, ko Opere-Eroma rāua ko Iahia ngā kaitiaki tatau mō te āka.<verse eid="1CH 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ka Kawea te Āka ki Hiruhārama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 6:12-22">2 Hamuera 6.12-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 15:25" />Nā, haere ana a Rāwiri rātou ko ngā kaumātua o Īharaira, ko ngā rangatira o ngā mano ki te kawe i te āka o te kawenata a Ihowā i te whare o Opere-Eroma i runga i te koa. <verse eid="1CH 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 15:26" />Ā, ka āwhina te Atua i ngā Rīwaiti, nā rātou nei i amo te āka o te kawenata a Ihowā, nā, ka patua e rātou te whakahere, e whitu ngā pūru, e whitu ngā hipi toa. <verse eid="1CH 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 15:27" />Nā, he koroka rīnena pai te kākahu o Rāwiri, o ngā Rīwaiti katoa i amohia ai te āka, o ngā kaiwaiata, o Kenania anō, o te rangatira o te waiata, me ngā kaiwaiata hoki. He epora rīnena anō tō Rāwiri. <verse eid="1CH 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 15:28" />Nā, kei te kawe a Īharaira katoa i te āka o te kawenata a Ihowā, me te hāmama anō rātou, me te tangi anō te koronete, te tētere, te himipora; pakū ana te rongo o ngā hātere, o ngā hāpa.<verse eid="1CH 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 15:29" />Nā, i te taenga o te āka o te kawenata a Ihowā ki te pā o Rāwiri, ka titiro atu a Mikara tamāhine a Haora i te matapihi, ka kite i a Kīngi Rāwiri e kanikani ana, e tākaro ana; nā, ka whakahāwea ki a ia i roto i tōna ngākau.<verse eid="1CH 15:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CH 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 16:1" />Heoi, kawea ana e rātou te āka a te Atua, whakatūria ana ki waenganui o te tēneti i whakaarahia e Rāwiri mōna; ā, tāpaea ana e rātou he tahunga tinana, he whakahere mō te pai ki te aroaro o te Atua. <verse eid="1CH 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 16:2" />Ā, ka mutu tā Rāwiri whakaeke i ngā tahunga tinana, i ngā whakahere mō te pai, ka manaakitia e ia te iwi i runga i te ingoa o Ihowā. <verse eid="1CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 16:3" />I tuwhaina anō e ia mā ngā tāngata katoa o Īharaira, mā te tāne, mā te wahine, kotahi rohi taro mā tēnei, mā tēnei, tētahi wāhi kikokiko, me tētahi keke karepe whakamaroke.<verse eid="1CH 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 16:4" />I whakaritea anō e ia ētahi o ngā Rīwaiti hei minita ki mua i te āka a Ihowā, hei whakamahara, hei whakawhetai, hei whakamoemiti ki a Ihowā, ki te Atua o Īharaira. <verse eid="1CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 16:5" />Ko Āhapa hei tuatahi; i muri i a ia ko Hakaraia, ko Teiere, ko Hemirāmoto, ko Tehiere, ko Matitia, ko Eriapa, ko Penaia, ko Opere-Eroma, ko Teiere hoki ki ngā hātere, ki ngā hāpa, ko Āhapa hei whakatangi i ngā himipora; <verse eid="1CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 16:6" />ko Penaia hoki rāua ko Tahatiere, ko ngā tohunga, kia tūturu tonu tā rāua mau tētere ki mua i te āka o te kawenata a te Atua.<verse eid="1CH 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Waiata Whakamoemiti a Rāwiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 105:1-15">Waiata 105.1-15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 96:1-13">96.1-13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106.1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 106:47-48">47-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 16:7" />I reira anō i taua rā ka whakaritea tuatahitia e Rāwiri he whakamoemiti mō Ihowā, nā te ringa o Āhapa rātou ko ōna tēina.<verse eid="1CH 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 16:8" />Whakawhetai atu ki a Ihowā, karanga ki tōna ingoa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:8">whakapuakina āna mahi ki waenganui o ngā iwi.<verse eid="1CH 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 16:9" />Waiata ki a ia, hīmene ki a ia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:9">kōrerotia āna mahi whakamīharo katoa.<verse eid="1CH 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 16:10" />Kia whakamanamana koutou ki tōna ingoa tapu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:10">kia hari ngā ngākau o te hunga e rapu ana i a Ihowā.<verse eid="1CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 16:11" />Rapua a Ihowā, me tōna kaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:11">rapua tonutia tōna mata.<verse eid="1CH 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 16:12" />Maharatia āna mahi whakamīharo i mahi ai ia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:12">āna merekara, me ngā whakaritenga a tōna māngai;<verse eid="1CH 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 16:13" />e ngā uri o Īharaira, o tāna pononga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:13">e ngā tama a Hākopa, e āna i whiriwhiri ai.<verse eid="1CH 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 16:14" />Ko Ihowā ia, ko tō tātou Atua;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:14">kei te whenua katoa āna whakaritenga.<verse eid="1CH 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 16:15" />Maharatia tonutia tāna kawenata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:15">te kupu i kīia iho e ia ki te mano o ngā whakatupuranga;<verse eid="1CH 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 16:16" />te kawenata i whakarite ai ia ki a Āperahama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:16">tāna oati hoki ki a Īhaka;<verse eid="1CH 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 16:17" />ā, whakapūmautia iho hei tikanga ki a Hākopa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:17">hei kawenata mau tonu ki a Īharaira,<verse eid="1CH 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 16:18" />i a ia i mea rā, “Ka hoatu e ahau ki a koe te whenua o Kanaana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:18">hei wāhi pūmau mō koutou.”<verse eid="1CH 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 16:19" />I te mea e torutoru ana anō koutou;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:19">āe, e tokoiti rawa ana, he manene hoki ki reira;<verse eid="1CH 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 16:20" />i a rātou e hāereere ana i tēnei iwi ki tērā atu iwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:20">i tētahi rangatiratanga ki tētahi iwi kē.<verse eid="1CH 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 16:21" />Kīhai rātou i tukua e ia kia tūkinotia e te tangata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:21">āe rā, i rīria e ia ngā kīngi, he whakaaro ki a rātou.<verse eid="1CH 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 16:22" />I mea ia, “Kei pā ki āku i whakawahi ai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:22">kei kino hoki ki āku poropiti.”<verse eid="1CH 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 16:23" />Waiata, e te whenua katoa ki a Ihowā;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:23">kauwhautia tāna mahi whakaora i tēnā rangi, i tēnā rangi.<verse eid="1CH 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 16:24" />Whakapuakina tōna korōria i waenganui i ngā tauiwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:24">āna mahi whakamīharo i waenganui i ngā iwi katoa.<verse eid="1CH 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 16:25" />He nui hoki a Ihowā, kia nui te whakamoemiti ki a ia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:25">kia wehingia nuitia atu hoki ia i ngā atua katoa.<verse eid="1CH 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 16:26" />He whakapakoko hoki ngā atua katoa o ngā iwi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:26">nā Ihowā ia i hanga ngā rangi.<verse eid="1CH 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 16:27" />He hōnore, he kīngitanga kei tōna aroaro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:27">kei tōna wāhi te kaha me te koa.<verse eid="1CH 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 16:28" />Tukua ki a Ihowā, e ngā hapū o ngā iwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:28">tukua ki a Ihowā te korōria me te kaha.<verse eid="1CH 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 16:29" />Tukua atu ki a Ihowā te korōria e tika ana mō tōna ingoa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:29">maua mai he whakahere, haere mai ki tōna aroaro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:29">Koropiko ki a Ihowā i roto i te ātaahua o te tapu;<verse eid="1CH 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 16:30" />kia wehi rā ki tōna aroaro, e te whenua katoa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:30">E ū anō te ao, tē taea te whakanekeneke.<verse eid="1CH 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 16:31" />Kia hari ngā rangi, kia koa te whenua;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:31">kia mea rātou i roto i ngā iwi, “Ko Ihowā te kīngi!”<verse eid="1CH 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 16:32" />Kia haruru te moana, me ngā mea hua ana i roto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:32">kia koa te māra, me ngā mea katoa i runga!<verse eid="1CH 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 16:33" />Ko reira ngā rākau o te ngahere waiata ai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:33">i te hari i te aroaro o Ihowā,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:33">e haere mai ana hoki ia ki te whakarite i runga i te whenua.<verse eid="1CH 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 16:34" />Whakawhetai ki a Ihowā, he pai hoki ia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:34">he pūmau tonu hoki tāna mahi tohu.<verse eid="1CH 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 16:35" />Mea atu hoki: “Whakaorangia mātou, e te Atua o tō mātou whakaoranga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:35">kohikohia mātou, whakaorangia mātou i ngā tauiwi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:35">kia whakawhetai ai mātou ki tōu ingoa tapu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:35">kia whakamanamana ai ki tōu whakamoemititanga.<verse eid="1CH 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 16:36" />Kia whakapaingia a Ihowā, te Atua o Īharaira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:36">ake nei, ā ake nei!”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CH 16:36">Nā, ka mea te iwi katoa, “Āmine!” ā, whakamoemiti ana rātou ki a Ihowā.<verse eid="1CH 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Koropiko kei Hiruhārama me Kipeono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 16:37" />Heoi, ka waiho e ia i reira, i mua i te āka o te kawenata a Ihowā, a Āhapa rātou ko ōna tēina, hei minita tonu ki mua i te āka, i ngā meatanga o tēnei rā, o tēnei rā, <verse eid="1CH 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 16:38" />a Opere-Eroma me ō rātou tēina, e ono tekau mā waru; a Opere-Eroma hoki tama a Ierutunu, rāua ko Hōha hei kaitiaki tatau.<verse eid="1CH 16:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 16:39" />Ko Hāroko tohunga me ōna tēina, me ngā tohunga, ki mua o te tapenākara o Ihowā i te wāhi tiketike i Kipeono, <verse eid="1CH 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 16:40" />hei whakaeke tonu i ngā tahunga tinana mā Ihowā ki runga ki te āta tahunga tinana i te ata, i te ahiahi, hei mea i ngā mea katoa i tuhituhia ki te Ture a Ihowā, i whakahaua e ia ki a Īharaira. <verse eid="1CH 16:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 16:41" />Ā, hei hoa mō rātou a Hēmana rāua ko Ierutunu, me ērā atu i whiriwhiria, i whakahuatia nei ngā ingoa, hei whakawhetai ki a Ihowā, nō te mea he pūmau tonu tāna mahi tohu. <verse eid="1CH 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 16:42" />Hei hoa hoki mō rātou a Hēmana rāua ko Ierutunu me ngā tētere me ngā himipora mā ngā kaiwhakatangi kaha, me ngā whakatangi mō ngā waiata a te Atua. Ā, ko ngā tama a Ierutunu hei kaitiaki kūwaha.<verse eid="1CH 16:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 16:43" />Nā, haere ana te iwi katoa ki tōna whare, ki tōna whare, ā, hoki ana a Rāwiri ki te manaaki i tōna whare.<verse eid="1CH 16:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1CH 17" />
  <para style="s">Te Pānui a Nātana ki a Rāwiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 7:1-17">2 Hamuera 7.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 17:1" />Ā, i a Rāwiri e noho ana i tōna whare, ka mea a Rāwiri ki a Nātana poropiti, “Nā, kei te noho ahau ki te whare hīta, ko te āka ia o te kawenata a Ihowā kei raro i te ārai kākahu e noho ana.”<verse eid="1CH 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 17:2" />Anō rā ko Nātana ki a Rāwiri, “Meatia ngā mea katoa i tōu ngākau; kei a koe hoki te Atua.”<verse eid="1CH 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 17:3" />Nā, i taua pō ka puta te kupu a te Atua ki a Nātana, ka mea:<verse eid="1CH 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 17:4" />“Haere, mea atu ki tāku pononga, ki a Rāwiri: ‘Ko te kupu tēnei a Ihowā: Kaua e hangā e koe he whare hei nohoanga mōku. <verse eid="1CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 17:5" />Kāhore nei hoki ahau i noho i roto i te whare, nō te rangi i kawea mai ai e ahau a Īharaira ā taea noatia tēnei rā. Heoi, he noho haere tōku i tētahi tēneti ki tētahi tēneti, i tētahi tapenākara ki tētahi tapenākara. <verse eid="1CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 17:6" />I ōku hāereerenga katoa i roto i a Īharaira katoa i puaki rānei tētahi kupu āku ki tētahi o ngā kaiwhakarite o Īharaira i whakaritea e ahau hei hēpara mō tāku iwi, i mea rānei ahau, “He aha koutou tē hanga whare hīta ai mōku?” ’<verse eid="1CH 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 17:7" />“Nō reira kia pēnei tāu kī atu āianei ki tāku pononga, ki a Rāwiri: ‘Ko te kupu tēnei a Ihowā o ngā mano: Nāku koe i tango i te nohoanga hipi, i te whai hipi, hei rangatira mō tāku iwi, mō Īharaira; <verse eid="1CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 17:8" />ā, i a koe ahau i ōu haerenga katoa; hautopea atu ana e ahau ōu hoariri katoa i tōu aroaro; ā, meinga ana koe e ahau hei ingoa, hei pērā anō me te ingoa o ngā mea nunui o te whenua. <verse eid="1CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 17:9" />Nā, māku e whakarite he wāhi mō tāku iwi, mō Īharaira; ka whakatōkia anō rātou e ahau kia noho ki tō rātou ake, e kore anō rātou e ngāueue ā muri ake nei; e kore anō rātou e pēhia ki raro i muri nei e ngā tama a te kino; e kore e pērā me tō mua, <verse eid="1CH 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 17:10" />me tō te wā anō i whakaritea ai e ahau ngā kaiwhakarite mō tāku iwi, mō Īharaira; ā, ka pēhia e ahau ki raro ōu hoariri katoa.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="1CH 17:10">“ ‘Ko tētahi, e mea atu ana ahau ki a koe, mā Ihowā e hanga he whare mōu. <verse eid="1CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 17:11" />Ā, ka tutuki ōu rā, ka haere koe ki ōu mātua, nā, ka whakaarahia e ahau tōu uri i muri i a koe i roto i āu tama, ka whakapūmautia anō e ahau tōna kīngitanga. <verse eid="1CH 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 17:12" />Māna e hanga he whare mōku, ā, ka whakapūmautia e ahau tōna torōna ā ake ake. <verse eid="1CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 17:13" />Ko ahau hei matua ki a ia, ko ia hei tama ki ahau, e kore anō e mutu tōku aroha ki a ia, e kore e pērā me tōku i mutu ki tērā i mua atu nā i a koe, <verse eid="1CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 17:14" />ā, ka tūturu ia ki tōku whare, ki tōku kīngitanga ā ake ake; ā, ka mau tonu tōna torōna mō ake tonu atu.’ ”<verse eid="1CH 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 17:15" />Rite tonu ki ēnei kupu katoa, ki tēnei putanga katoa, ngā kupu a Nātana ki a Rāwiri.<verse eid="1CH 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Īnoi Whakawhetai a Rāwiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 7:18-29">2 Hamuera 7.18-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 17:16" />Nā, ka haere a Kīngi Rāwiri, ka noho ki te aroaro o Ihowā, ā, ka mea ia:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CH 17:16" />
  <para style="pi" vid="1CH 17:16">“Ko wai ahau, e Ihowā, e te Atua, he aha hoki tōku whare, i kawea mai ai ahau e koe ki konei? <verse eid="1CH 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 17:17" />He mea iti anō tēnei ki tāu titiro, e te Atua; kua kōrerotia nei hoki e koe te whare o tāu pononga a tau tini noa atu, ā, kua titiro mai hoki koe ki ahau, ānō ki te tangata nui rawa, e Ihowā, e te Atua.<verse eid="1CH 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 17:18" />“Ko te aha ake hei kōrerotanga mā Rāwiri ki a koe mō te whakahōnore i tāu pononga? E mōhio ana hoki koe ki tāu pononga. <verse eid="1CH 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 17:19" />He whakaaro ki tāu pononga, e Ihowā, rite tonu anō ki tā tōu ngākau, i mea ai koe i ēnei mea nunui katoa, i whakaritea mai ai ēnei mea nunui katoa.<verse eid="1CH 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 17:20" />“Kāhore he rite mōu, e Ihowā, kāhore atu hoki he atua, ko koe anake; rite tonu ki ngā mea katoa i rongo ai ō mātou taringa. <verse eid="1CH 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 17:21" />Ko tēhea iwi hoki o te whenua hei rite mō tāu iwi, mō Īharaira, i haere nei te Atua ki te hoko hei iwi māna ake, hei mea ingoa mōu, ki ngā hanga nunui, whakamataku hoki, i te peinga atu i ngā tauiwi i te aroaro o tāu iwi i hokona nei e koe i Īhipa? <verse eid="1CH 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 17:22" />Kua meinga nei hoki e koe tāu iwi, a Īharaira, hei iwi māu ā ake ake; me koe hoki, e Ihowā hei Atua mō rātou.<verse eid="1CH 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 17:23" />“Nā, whakamanā āianei, e Ihowā, te kupu i kōrerotia e koe mō tāu pononga, mō tōna whare hoki ake ake, meatia hoki tāu i kōrero ai. <verse eid="1CH 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 17:24" />Kia mana anō, kia whakanuia hoki tōu ingoa ā ake ake, kia kōrerotia ai, ‘Ko Ihowā o ngā mano te Atua o Īharaira, hei Atua anō ki a Īharaira!’ Ā, ka tūturu tonu te whare o tāu pononga, o Rāwiri, ki tōu aroaro.<verse eid="1CH 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 17:25" />“Nāu nei hoki, e tōku Atua, i whakapuaki mai ki tāu pononga, ka hangā e koe he whare mōna; koia te ngākau o tāu pononga i anga ai ki te īnoi ki tōu aroaro. <verse eid="1CH 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 17:26" />Nā, ko koe, e Ihowā, te Atua, ā, kua kōrerotia e koe tēnei mea pai ki tāu pononga. <verse eid="1CH 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 17:27" />Ā, kua pai tēnei koe ki te manaaki i te whare o tāu pononga, kia pūmau tonu ai ki tōu aroaro; ko koe hoki hei manaaki, e Ihowā, ā, ka manaakitia ake ake.”<verse eid="1CH 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1CH 18" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Wikitōria a Rāwiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 8:1-18">2 Hamuera 8.1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 18:1" />Nā, muri iho i tēnei, ka patua e Rāwiri ngā Pirihitini, ā, pēhia ana e ia ki raro; tangohia ana e ia a Kāta me ōna pā ririki i te ringa o ngā Pirihitini.<verse eid="1CH 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 18:2" />I patua anō e ia a Moapa, nā, kua waiho ngā Moapi hei pononga mā Rāwiri, ā, hōmai ana he hākari e rātou.<verse eid="1CH 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 18:3" />I patua anō e Rāwiri a Hararētere kīngi o Topa ā tae noa ki Hāmata, i tōna haerenga ki te whakaū i tōna rohe ki te awa, ki Uparati. <verse eid="1CH 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 18:4" />Nā, tangohia ana e Rāwiri i a ia kotahi mano ngā hāriata, e whitu mano ngā hōia eke hōiho, e rua tekau mano ngā tāngata haere i raro. Ā, i whakangongea e Rāwiri ngā hōiho katoa o ngā hāriata, engari i whakatoea o rātou ngā mea mō ngā hāriata kotahi rau.<verse eid="1CH 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 18:5" />Ā, nō te haerenga mai o ngā Hīriani o Ramahiku ki te whakauru i a Hararētere kīngi o Topa, patua iho e Rāwiri o ngā Hīriani e rua tekau mā rua mano tāngata. <verse eid="1CH 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 18:6" />Kātahi ka whakanohoia e Rāwiri he hōia pupuri ki Hīria o Ramahiku; ā, ka waiho ngā Hīriani hei pononga mā Rāwiri, ā, hōmai ana he hākari e rātou. Nā, hōmai ana e Ihowā kia toa a Rāwiri i ōna haerenga katoa.<verse eid="1CH 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 18:7" />Ā, tangohia ana e Rāwiri ngā whakangungu rākau kōura o ngā tāngata a Hararētere, ā, kawea ana ki Hiruhārama. <verse eid="1CH 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 18:8" />Ā, nui atu te parāhi i tangohia e Rāwiri i Tipihata, i Kunu; i ngā pā o Hararētere; nō reira te moana parāhi, ngā pou, me ngā oko parāhi i hangā nei e Horomona.<verse eid="1CH 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 18:9" />Ā, nō te rongonga o Tohu kīngi o Hāmata kua patua e Rāwiri te ope katoa a Hararētere kīngi o Topa, <verse eid="1CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 18:10" />ka tonoa e ia a Hatorama, tāna tama, ki a Kīngi Rāwiri ki te oha ki a ia, ki te manaaki hoki i a ia, mōna i whawhai ki a Hararētere, i patu hoki i a ia. He hoariri hoki a Hararētere nō Tohu; ā, he taonga ana, te tini o ngā oko kōura, hiriwa, parāhi.<verse eid="1CH 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 18:11" />Whakatapua ake ērā e Kīngi Rāwiri mā Ihowā hei tāpiri mō te hiriwa, mō te kōura, i maua mai e ia i ngā iwi katoa, i ngā Ēromi, i ngā Moapi, i ngā tama a Āmona, i ngā Pirihitini, i ngā Amareki.<verse eid="1CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 18:12" />Nā, i patua hoki e Āpihai tama a Teruia ētahi o ngā Ēromi ki te Raorao Tote, kotahi tekau mā waru mano. <verse eid="1CH 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 18:13" />I whakanohoia anō e ia he hōia pupuri ki Ēroma; ā, ka meinga ngā Ēromi katoa hei pononga mā Rāwiri. Nā, hōmai ana e Ihowā kia toa a Rāwiri i ōna haerenga katoa.<verse eid="1CH 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Tino Rangatira a Rāwiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 18:14" />Nā, ko Rāwiri te kīngi o Īharaira katoa; ā, i mahi i te whakawā, i te tika mō tōna iwi katoa. <verse eid="1CH 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 18:15" />Ā, ko Ioapa tama a Teruia te rangatira ope, ko Iehohāpata tama a Ahiruru te kaiwhakamahara. <verse eid="1CH 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 18:16" />Ko Hāroko tama a Ahitupu rāua ko Apīmereke tama a Apiātara ngā tohunga; ko Hawaha hoki te kaituhituhi; <verse eid="1CH 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 18:17" />ko Penaia tama a Iehoiara te rangatira mō ngā Kereti, mō ngā Pereti; ko ngā tama ia a Rāwiri ngā tino rangatira i te taha o te kīngi.<verse eid="1CH 18:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1CH 19" />
  <para style="s">Te Hinganga o ngā Tama a Āmona me ngā Hīriani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 10:1-19">2 Hamuera 10.1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 19:1" />Nā, i muri i tēnei ka mate a Nahaha kīngi o ngā tama a Āmona, ā, ko tāna tama te kīngi i muri i a ia. <verse eid="1CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 19:2" />Nā, ka mea a Rāwiri, “Ka puta tōku aroha ki a Hanunu tama a Nahaha; i puta hoki te aroha o tōna pāpā ki ahau.” Nā, ka ungā e Rāwiri ētahi tāngata ki te whakamārie i a ia mō tōna pāpā.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 19:2">Nā, kua tae ngā tāngata a Rāwiri ki te whenua o ngā tama a Āmona ki a Hanunu, ki te whakamārie i a ia. <verse eid="1CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 19:3" />Otiia ka mea ngā rangatira o ngā tama a Āmona ki a Hanunu, “Ki tōu whakaaro he whakahōnore nā Rāwiri i tōu pāpā i tonoa mai ai e ia ngā kaiwhakamārie ki a koe? He teka ianei he titiro, he whakangaro, he tūtei i te whenua te mea i haere mai ai āna tāngata ki a koe?” <verse eid="1CH 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 19:4" />Heoi, ka mau a Hanunu ki ngā tāngata a Rāwiri, heua ana e ia, tapahia ana ō rātou kākahu ki waenga, i te ritenga iho o ō rātou papa, ā tonoa atu ana rātou.<verse eid="1CH 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 19:5" />Kātahi ka haere ētahi, ka kōrero ki a Rāwiri i te meatanga ki aua tāngata. Nā, ka tono tāngata ia ki te whakatau i a rātou; he nui hoki te whakamā o aua tāngata, ā, ka mea te kīngi, “Hei Heriko koutou noho ai, kia tupu rā anō ō koutou pāhau, ko reira hoki mai ai.”<verse eid="1CH 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 19:6" />Ā, nō te kitenga o ngā tama a Āmona e piro ana rātou ki a Rāwiri ka hoatu e Hanunu rātou ko ngā tama a Āmona ētahi taranata hiriwa kotahi mano kia kawea hei utu hāriata kaieke hōiho, i Mehopotamia, i Āramamāka, i Topa. <verse eid="1CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 19:7" />Heoi, e toru tekau mā rua mano hāriata i utua e rātou, me te kīngi anō o Maaka rātou ko āna tāngata, ā, haere mai ana rātou, noho ana ki mua i Merepa. Nā, ka huihui ngā tama a Āmona i ō rātou pā, haere ana mai ki te whawhai.<verse eid="1CH 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 19:8" />Ā, i te rongonga o Rāwiri, ka tonoa e ia a Ioapa rātou ko te ope katoa, arā ngā mārohirohi. <verse eid="1CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 19:9" />Nā, ka puta ngā tama a Āmona ki waho, ā, whakatakotoria ana ō rātou ngohi ki te kūwaha o te pā. Nā, ko ngā kīngi i haere nei, he mea motu kē rātou i te pārae.<verse eid="1CH 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 19:10" />Ā, nō te kitenga o Ioapa e ākina ana a mua, a muri ōna e te hoariri, ka whiriwhiria e ia ētahi i roto i te hunga whiriwhiri katoa o Īharaira, ā, whakaritea ana e ia hei tū i ngā Hīriani. <verse eid="1CH 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 19:11" />Ko te nuinga atu hoki o te iwi i tukua e ia ki te ringa o Āpihai, o tōna teina, ā, ka whakatikaia rātou e rātou hei tū i ngā tama a Āmona. <verse eid="1CH 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 19:12" />I mea anō ia, “Ki te kaha ngā Hīriani i ahau, me āwhina mai ahau e koe; ki te kaha ia ngā tama a Āmona i a koe, nā māku koe e āwhina atu. <verse eid="1CH 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 19:13" />Kia māia, kia whakatāne tātou; me whakaaro ki tō tātou iwi, ki ngā pā o tō tātou Atua, ā, mā Ihowā e mea te mea e pai ana ki tāna titiro.”<verse eid="1CH 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 19:14" />Heoi, ko te whakatatanga o Ioapa rātou ko tōna nuinga ki te whawhai ki ngā Hīriani, nā, rere ana rātou i tōna aroaro. <verse eid="1CH 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 19:15" />Ā, nō te kitenga o ngā tama a Āmona kua rere ngā Hīriani, nā, ka rere anō rātou i te aroaro o tōna teina, o Āpihai, ā, haere ana ki roto ki te pā. Kātahi ka haere a Ioapa ki Hiruhārama.<verse eid="1CH 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 19:16" />Ā, nō te kitenga o ngā Hīriani kua patua rātou e Īharaira, ka tono tāngata, ā, ka tīkina atu ngā Hīriani i tāwāhi o te awa; ā, ko Topaka rangatira o te ope a Hararētere ki mua i a rātou.<verse eid="1CH 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 19:17" />Nā, ka kōrerotia ki a Rāwiri, ā, ka huihuia e ia a Īharaira katoa, ā, whiti ana ki tāwāhi o Horano, whakaekea ana e ia, whakatikaia ana e ia ngā ngohi hei tū i a rātou. Nā, ka oti ngā ngohi te whakatika e Rāwiri hei tū i ngā Hīriani, ka whawhai rātou ki a ia. <verse eid="1CH 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 19:18" />Nā, ka rere ngā Hīriani i te aroaro o Īharaira; ā, patua iho o ngā Hīriani e Rāwiri ngā tāngata o ngā hāriata e whitu mano, e whā tekau mano ngā tāngata haere i raro; i patua anō e ia a Topaka te rangatira ope.<verse eid="1CH 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 19:19" />Ā, i te kitenga o ngā tāngata a Hararētere kua mate rātou i a Īharaira, ka houhia e rātou te rongo ki a Rāwiri, ā, ka meinga rātou hei tāngata māna; kīhai hoki ngā Hīriani i pai ki te āwhina i ngā tama a Āmona i muri atu.<verse eid="1CH 19:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1CH 20" />
  <para style="s">Te Pāhoro a Rapa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 12:26-31">2 Hamuera 12.26-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 20:1" />Ā, i te takanga o te tau, i te wā e haere ai ngā kīngi ki te whawhai, nā, ka ārahina atu he taua māia e Ioapa, ā, hunā iho e rātou te whenua o ngā tama a Āmona, haere ana, kei te whakapae i Rapa. Ko Rāwiri ia i noho ki Hiruhārama. Nā, ka patua a Rapa e Ioapa, ngaro ana i a ia. <verse eid="1CH 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 20:2" />Tangohia ana e Rāwiri te karauna o tō rātou kīngi i tōna mātenga, ā, ko tōna taimaha i kitea e ia, kotahi taranata kōura, he kōhatu utu nui anō o taua karauna; pōtaea iho ki te mātenga o Rāwiri. I whakaputaina anō e ia ngā taonga o te pā, tōna tini. <verse eid="1CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 20:3" />Nā, ko ngā tāngata i roto, whakaputaina ana e ia ki waho, poroporoa iho e ia ki te kani, ki te rakaraka rino, ki te toki. Ko tā Rāwiri tēnei i mea ai ki ngā pā katoa o ngā tama a Āmona. Nā, hoki ana a Rāwiri me te iwi katoa ki Hiruhārama.<verse eid="1CH 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">He Whawhai ki ngā Pirihitini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 21:15-22">2 Hamuera 21.15-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 20:4" />Ā, i muri iho i tēnei ka tupu te whawhai ki ngā Pirihitini ki Kētere; kātahi ka patua e Hipekai Huhati a Hipai o ngā tama a Rapa, nā, pēhia ana rātou ki raro.<verse eid="1CH 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 20:5" />Ā, ka ara anō he whawhai ki ngā Pirihitini; nā, ka patua e Erehanana, tama a Iāre, a Rahami teina o Koriata o Kāta, ko te kakau o tāna taoroa, rite tonu ki te rākau a te kaiwhatu.<verse eid="1CH 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 20:6" />Nā, i whawhai anō ki Kāta, ā, i reira tētahi tangata roa, ko ngā maihao o ōna ringa me ōna waewae e rua tekau mā whā, takiono ki ia ringa, ā, takiono ki ia waewae; ā, he uri ia nō Rapa. <verse eid="1CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 20:7" />I tāna whakataranga i a Īharaira, patua ana ia e Honatana tama a Himea tuakana o Rāwiri.<verse eid="1CH 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 20:8" />I whānau ēnei a Rapa ki Kāta; ā, hinga ana i te ringa o Rāwiri, i te ringa anō o āna tāngata.<verse eid="1CH 20:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1CH 21" />
  <para style="s">Te Tatau me te Urutā</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 24:1-25">2 Hamuera 24.1-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 21:1" />Nā, ka tū a Hātana hei hoariri mō Īharaira, ā, ka whakakīkī a Rāwiri ki te tatau i a Īharaira. <verse eid="1CH 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 21:2" />Nā, ka kī a Rāwiri ki a Ioapa rātou ko ngā rangatira o te iwi, “Tīkina taua a Īharaira, o Peerehepa atu ā tae noa ki Rāna, ka kawe mai ai i tō rātou tokomaha ki ahau, kia mōhio ai ahau.”<verse eid="1CH 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 21:3" />Anō rā ko Ioapa, “Mā Ihowā e mea tāna iwi kia rau noa atu i a rātou e noho nei, otiia, e tōku ariki, e te kīngi, ehara ianei rātou katoa i te pononga nā tōku ariki? He aha rā tēnei i whāia ai e tōku ariki? He aha i waiho ai hei, take hē mō Īharaira?”<verse eid="1CH 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 21:4" />Otiia kaha tonu tā te kīngi kupu i tā Ioapa. Heoi, ka tūria atu e Ioapa, hāereerea ana e ia a Īharaira katoa, kua tae ki Hiruhārama. <verse eid="1CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 21:5" />Nā, ka hōmai e Ioapa te tokomaha o te iwi i taua ki a Rāwiri. Nā, a Īharaira katoa, he mano ngā mano me ngā mano kotahi rau, he hunga unu hoari; nā, a Hūrā, e whā rau e whitu tekau mano ngā tāngata unu hoari.<verse eid="1CH 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 21:6" />Ko Rīwai ia rāua ko Pineamine, kīhai i taua e ia i roto i a rātou; he mea whakarihariha hoki ki a Ioapa te kupu a te kīngi. <verse eid="1CH 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 21:7" />Nā, ka riri te Atua ki tēnei mea; ā, patua ana a Īharaira e ia.<verse eid="1CH 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 21:8" />Nā, ka mea a Rāwiri ki te Atua, “Nui atu tōku hara i ahau i mea i tēnei mea. Nā, tēnā, kia whakarērea noatia iho te hē o tāu pononga, nui atu hoki tōku kūware.”<verse eid="1CH 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 21:9" />Nā, ka puta te kupu a Ihowā ki tā Rāwiri matakite, ki a Kara; i kī ia, <verse eid="1CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 21:10" />“Haere, kī atu ki a Rāwiri, mea atu, ‘Ko te kupu tēnei a Ihowā: E toru ēnei mea ka whakaaria atu nei e ahau ki a koe, whiriwhiria tētahi o ēnei māu ā ka meatia e ahau ki a koe.’ ”<verse eid="1CH 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 21:11" />Heoi, ko te taenga o Kara ki a Rāwiri, ka mea ki a ia, “Ko te kupu tēnei a Ihowā, ‘Whiriwhiria māu: <verse eid="1CH 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 21:12" />kia toru rānei ngā tau matekai; kia toru rānei ngā marama e whakangaromia ai koe i te aroaro o ōu hoariri, me te hoari a ōu hoa whawhai e hopu ana i a koe? Kia toru rānei ngā rā o te hoari a Ihowā, arā o te mate urutā ki te whenua, me te anahera a Ihowā e whakangaro ana, i ngā rohe katoa o Īharaira.’ Nā, whakaaroa te kupu e whakahokia e ahau ki tōku kaitono mai.”<verse eid="1CH 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 21:13" />Anō rā ko Rāwiri ki a Kara, “He noa iho ōku whakaaro; nā, kia taka ahau ki te ringa o Ihowā, he nui hoki āna mahi aroha; kaua hoki ahau e taka ki te ringa tangata.”<verse eid="1CH 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 21:14" />Heoi, whakapāngia ana e Ihowā he mate urutā ki a Īharaira; ā, hinga iho o Īharaira e whitu tekau mano tāngata. <verse eid="1CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 21:15" />I tonoa anō e te Atua he anahera ki Hiruhārama whakangaro ai; ā, i a ia e mea ana ki te whakangaro, ka titiro a Ihowā. Nā, ka puta kē tō Ihowā whakaaro mō te kino, ā, ka mea ki te anahera whakangaro, “Kua nui! Kati tōu ringa.” Nā, tū ana te anahera a Ihowā i te patunga wīti a Oronana Iepuhi.<verse eid="1CH 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 21:16" />Nā, ka ara ngā kanohi o Rāwiri, ka kite i te anahera a Ihowā e tū ana i te takiwā o te whenua, o te rangi, me tāna hoari, unu rawa, i tōna ringa, e totoro ana ki runga i Hiruhārama. Kātahi ka tāpapa a Rāwiri rātou ko ngā kaumātua, he kākahu taratara te hīpoki.<verse eid="1CH 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 21:17" />Ka mea a Rāwiri ki te Atua, “He teka ianei nāku i kī kia taua te iwi? Ko ahau tēnei te mea i hara, i mahi nei i te hē; ko ēnei hipi ia, i aha rātou? E Ihowā, e tōku Atua, kia pā rā tōu ringa ki ahau, ki te whare anō o tōku pāpā; kauaka ia ki tāu iwi, hei whiu mō rātou.”<verse eid="1CH 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 21:18" />Kātahi ka kōrero te anahera a Ihowā ki a Kara kia mea ia ki a Rāwiri, kia haere a Rāwiri ki runga, ki te whakaara i tētahi āta ki a Ihowā ki te patunga wīti a Oronana Iepuhi. <verse eid="1CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 21:19" />Nā, haere ana a Rāwiri i tā Kara kōrero i kōrero ai ia i runga i te ingoa o Ihowā.<verse eid="1CH 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 21:20" />Nā, ka tahuri ake a Oronana, ka kite i te anahera; ā, piri ana ia, rātou ko āna tama tokowhā. Nā, i te patu wīti a Oronana. <verse eid="1CH 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 21:21" />Nā, i a Rāwiri e haere ana ki a Oronana, ka titiro a Oronana, ā, ka kite i a Rāwiri, nā, puta ana ia i te patunga wīti, piko ana ki a Rāwiri, tāpapa ana ki te whenua.<verse eid="1CH 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 21:22" />Kātahi ka mea a Rāwiri ki a Oronana, “Hōmai ki ahau te wāhi i tēnei patunga wīti, kia hangā ai e ahau he āta ki a Ihowā; kia tino rite te utu ka hōmai ai e koe ki ahau, kia mutu ai te whiunga o te iwi.”<verse eid="1CH 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 21:23" />Nā, ka mea a Oronana ki a Rāwiri, “Me tango māu; ā, mā tōku ariki, mā te kīngi e mea te mea e pai ana ki tāna titiro. Nanā, ka hoatu e ahau ki a koe ngā kau hei tahunga tinana, me ngā patu wīti hei wahie, me te wīti anō hei whakahere totokore; ka hoatu katoa e ahau.”<verse eid="1CH 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 21:24" />Nā, ka mea a Kīngi Rāwiri ki a Oronana, “Kāhore; engari ka hokona e ahau kia rite anō ngā utu. E kore hoki ahau e tango i tāu mā Ihowā, e kore hoki e whakaeke i ngā mea kīhai i utua hei tahunga tinana.”<verse eid="1CH 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 21:25" />Heoi, e ono rau ngā hekere kōura, he mea pāuna, i hoatu e Rāwiri ki a Oronana mō taua wāhi. <verse eid="1CH 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 21:26" />Ā, hangā ana e Rāwiri he āta ki reira mā Ihowā, whakaekea ana he tahunga tinana, he whakahere mō te pai, ā, karanga ana ki a Ihowā. Nā, ka whakahokia tāna i te rangi, he ahi ki runga ki te āta tahunga tinana.<verse eid="1CH 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 21:27" />Nā, ka kōrero a Ihowā ki te anahera, ā, whakahokia ana e ia tāna hoari ki tōna takotoranga. <verse eid="1CH 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 21:28" />I taua wā anō, i te kitenga o Rāwiri kua whakarongo a Ihowā ki a ia i te patunga wīti a Oronana Iepuhi, ka mea patunga tapu ia ki reira. <verse eid="1CH 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 21:29" />Ko te tapenākara hoki o Ihowā i hangā nei e Mohi ki te koraha, me te āta tahunga tinana, i te wāhi tiketike i Kipeono i taua wā. <verse eid="1CH 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 21:30" />Kīhai ia a Rāwiri i āhei te haere ki mua o taua āta ki te rapu i tā te Atua, i wehi hoki ia i te hoari a te anahera a Ihowā.<verse eid="1CH 21:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1CH 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 22:1" />Kātahi ka kī a Rāwiri, “Ko te whare tēnei o Ihowā, o te Atua, ko te āta tahunga tinana anō tēnei mā Īharaira.”<verse eid="1CH 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Whakarite kia Hanga i te Temepara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 22:2" />I whakahau anō a Rāwiri kia huihuia ngā tāngata iwi kē o te whenua o Īharaira; i whakaritea e ia he kaihahau hei hahau kōhatu tārai, hei hanga mō te whare o te Atua. <verse eid="1CH 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 22:3" />I mahia anō e Rāwiri he rino, tōna nui nā, hei whao mō ngā tatau o ngā kūwaha, mō ngā hononga, me te parāhi anō, he nui noa atu, kīhai i pāunatia, <verse eid="1CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 22:4" />me te rākau, he hīta, kīhai i taua – he maha hoki ngā rākau, ngā hīta, i kawea mai e ngā tāngata o Hairona, o Tāira, ki a Rāwiri.<verse eid="1CH 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 22:5" />Nā, ka mea a Rāwiri, “He taitamariki tāku tama, a Horomona, he ngāwari, ā, ko te whare e hanga mā Ihowā, kia nui rawa te ingoa, te korōria, i ngā whenua katoa; māku e tīmata te mahi mea mō reira.” Nā, he maha ngā mea i pae i a Rāwiri i mua i tōna matenga.<verse eid="1CH 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 22:6" />Kātahi ka karangatia e ia tāna tama a Horomona, ā, whakahaua ana e ia kia hangā te whare o Ihowā, o te Atua o Īharaira. <verse eid="1CH 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 22:7" />Nā, ka mea a Rāwiri ki a Horomona, ki tāna tama: “Ko ahau, i whai ngākau ahau ki te hanga i te whare mō te ingoa o Ihowā, o tōku Atua. <verse eid="1CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 22:8" />Otiia i puta mai te kupu a Ihowā ki ahau; i mea ia: ‘He nui ngā toto i whakahekea e koe; he nui ngā whawhai i whawhai ai koe. E kore e hangā e koe he whare mō tōku ingoa; he nui hoki ngā toto i whakahekea e koe ki te whenua ki tōku aroaro. <verse eid="1CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 22:9" />Nanā, ka whānau he tama māu, he tangata āta noho; ka meinga anō ia e ahau kia āta noho i ōna hoariri ā tawhio noa. Ko tōna ingoa ko Horomona, ā, ka hoatu e ahau te rongo mau, me te rangimārie ki a Īharaira i ōna rā. <verse eid="1CH 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 22:10" />Māna e hanga he whare mō tōku ingoa; ko ia hei tama ki ahau, ko ahau hei pāpā ki a ia. Nā, ka whakapūmautia e ahau te torōna o tōna kīngitanga ki a Īharaira ā ake ake.’<verse eid="1CH 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 22:11" />“Nā, e tāku tama, kia noho a Ihowā ki a koe, kia kake koe, kia hangā anō e koe te whare o Ihowā, o tōu Atua, kia rite anō ki tāna kupu mōu. <verse eid="1CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 22:12" />Kia hōmai anō ia e Ihowā he ngākau whakaaro, he mōhio, ki a koe, kia whakahaua e ia ki a koe he tikanga mō Īharaira. Kia puritia ai e koe te ture a Ihowā, a tōu Atua. <verse eid="1CH 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 22:13" />Ko reira koe kake ai, ki te puritia e koe, ki te mahia, ngā tikanga, me ngā whakaritenga i whakahaua e Ihowā ki a Mohi mō Īharaira. Kia kaha, kia māia. Kaua e wehi, kaua e pāwera.<verse eid="1CH 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 22:14" />“Nanā, i ahau e hē nei, kua pae i ahau he kōura mō te whare o Ihowā, kotahi rau mano taranata, he hiriwa, kotahi mano mano taranata, me te parāhi, me te rino, e kore e taea te pāuna, he nui hoki; me te rākau, me te kōhatu, kua pae i ahau. Māu anō e tāpiri ētahi ki ērā. <verse eid="1CH 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 22:15" />Kei a koe anō tōna tini o ngā kaimahi: o ngā kaihahau, o ngā kaimahi i te kōhatu, i te rākau, me ngā mea mōhio katoa ki ngā mahi katoa. <verse eid="1CH 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 22:16" />E kore e taea te tatau te kōura, te hiriwa, te parāhi, te rino. Whakatika, e mahi, ā, hei a koe a Ihowā.”<verse eid="1CH 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 22:17" />I whakahau anō a Rāwiri i ngā rangatira katoa o Īharaira kia uru ki te mahi a tāna tama, a Horomona, i mea ia, <verse eid="1CH 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 22:18" />“He teka ianei ko Ihowā, ko tō koutou Atua, hei hoa mō koutou? Ā, kua meinga koutou kia āta noho ā tawhio noa? Kua hōmai hoki e ia ngā tāngata o te whenua ki tōku ringa; ā, kua taea te whenua te pēhi i te aroaro o Ihowā, i te aroaro anō o tāna iwi. <verse eid="1CH 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 22:19" />Nā, tukua ō koutou ngākau, ō koutou wairua, ki te rapu i a Ihowā, i tō koutou Atua. Whakatika ki te hanga i te wāhi tapu o te Atua, o Ihowā, ki te kawe mai anō i te āka o te kawenata a Ihowā, i ngā oko tapu a te Atua, ki te whare ka hangā nei mō te ingoa o Ihowā.”<verse eid="1CH 22:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1CH 23" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Whānau o ngā Rīwaiti me āna Mahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 23:1" />Nā, kua koroheketia a Rāwiri, kua rite ōna tau; ā, ka meinga e ia tāna tama a Horomona hei kīngi mō Īharaira.<verse eid="1CH 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 23:2" />Nā, ka huihuia e ia ngā rangatira katoa o Īharaira, rātou ko ngā tohunga, ko ngā Rīwaiti. <verse eid="1CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 23:3" />Nā, ka taua ngā Rīwaiti, ngā mea e toru tekau, he maha atu rānei, ō rātou tau. Nā, ko tō rātou tokomaha, he mea tatau ā-tangata tonu, e toru tekau mā waru mano. <verse eid="1CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 23:4" />“O ēnei, e rua tekau mā whā mano hei whakahaere i te mahi o te whare o Ihowā; nā, ko ngā rangatira, ko ngā kaiwhakarite, e ono mano. <verse eid="1CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 23:5" />Nā, e whā mano hei kaitiaki kūwaha, ā, e whā mano hei whakamoemiti ki a Ihowā i runga i ngā mea whakatangi i hangā e ahau,” e ai tā Rāwiri, “hei mea whakamoemiti.”<verse eid="1CH 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 23:6" />Ā, wehea ana rātou e Rāwiri, he wehenga, he wehenga, ki ngā tama a Rīwai, a Kerehona, a Kohata, a Merari.<verse eid="1CH 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 23:7" />O ngā Kerehoni: ko Rārana, ko Himei. <verse eid="1CH 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 23:8" />Ko ngā tama a Rārana: ko te upoko ko Tehiere, ko Tetama, ko Hoera, tokotoru. <verse eid="1CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 23:9" />Ko ngā tama a Himei: ko Heromoto, ko Hatiere, ko Harana, tokotoru. Ko ngā upoko ēnei o ngā whare o ngā mātua o Rārana <verse eid="1CH 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 23:10" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Himei: ko Iahata, ko Tīnā, ko Ieuhu, ko Peria. Ko ēnei tokowhā he tama nā Himei. <verse eid="1CH 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 23:11" />Ko Iahata te upoko, ko Tita te tuarua; nā, kīhai i tokomaha ngā tama a Ieuhu rāua ko Peria, ā, hei whare matua rāua, kotahi anō tauanga.<verse eid="1CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 23:12" />Ko ngā tama a Kohata: ko Āmarama, ko Itihara, ko Heperona, ko Utiere, tokowhā. <verse eid="1CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 23:13" />Ko ngā tama a Āmarama: ko Ārona rāua ko Mohi. Nā, i motuhia a Ārona hei whakatapu i ngā mea tapu rawa, a ia me āna tama, ake ake hei tahu whakakakara ki te aroaro o Ihowā, hei minita ki a ia, hei manaaki i runga i tōna ingoa ā ake ake. <verse eid="1CH 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 23:14" />Nā, ko Mohi tangata a te Atua, nō te iwi o Rīwai te karangatanga o āna tama. <verse eid="1CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 23:15" />Ko ngā tama a Mohi: ko Kerehoma, ko Eriētere. <verse eid="1CH 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 23:16" />O ngā tama a Kerehoma: ko Hepuere te upoko. <verse eid="1CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 23:17" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Eriētere: ko Rehāpia te upoko. Ā, kāhore atu he tama a Eriētere. He tokomaha rawa ia ngā tama a Rehāpia. <verse eid="1CH 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 23:18" />O ngā tama a Itihara: ko Heromiti te upoko. <verse eid="1CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 23:19" />O ngā tama a Heperona: ko Teria te upoko, ko Amaria te tuarua, ko Tahatiere te tuatoru, ko Tekameama te tuawhā. <verse eid="1CH 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 23:20" />O ngā tama a Utiere: ko Mika te upoko, ko Ihīa te tuarua.<verse eid="1CH 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 23:21" />Ko ngā tama a Merari: ko Māhari, ko Muhi. Ko ngā tama a Māhari: ko Ereātara, ko Kihi. <verse eid="1CH 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 23:22" />Nā, ka mate a Ereātara; kāhore āna tama; engari he tamāhine; ā, riro ana rātou hei wāhine i ō rātou tungāne, i ngā tama a Kihi. <verse eid="1CH 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 23:23" />Ko ngā tama a Muhi: ko Māhari, ko Ērere, ko Teremoto, tokotoru.<verse eid="1CH 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 23:24" />Ko ngā tama ēnei a Rīwai i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua; arā ngā upoko o ngā whare o ngā mātua, he mea tatau ā-tangata, tēnei ingoa, tēnei ingoa o ngā kaimahi i ngā mea mō te whare o Ihowā, te hunga, e rua tekau, he maha atu hoki ō rātou tau.<verse eid="1CH 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 23:25" />I mea hoki a Rāwiri, “Kua meinga nei e Ihowā, e te Atua o Īharaira tāna iwi kia okioki, ā, ka noho tonu ia ki Hiruhārama. <verse eid="1CH 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 23:26" />Me ngā Rīwaiti, heoi anō tā rātou amohanga i te tapenākara, me ōna mea katoa mō ngā mahi ki reira.” <verse eid="1CH 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 23:27" />Nā ngā kupu whakamutunga hoki a Rāwiri i taua ai ngā Rīwaiti e rua nei tekau, he maha atu hoki, ō rātou tau.<verse eid="1CH 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 23:28" />Ko te tūranga hoki mō rātou kei te taha o ngā tama a Ārona, mō ngā mahi o te whare o Ihowā, i ngā marae, i ngā rūma, i te purenga o ngā mea tapu katoa, i te meatanga o te mahi o te whare o te Atua; <verse eid="1CH 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 23:29" />arā, o te taro aroaro, o te parāoa mō te whakahere totokore, o ngā keke rēwenakore, o te mea i tunua ki te pāraharaha, o te mea i parāipanatia, o ngā mea katoa e mēhuatia ana, e rūritia ana. <verse eid="1CH 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 23:30" />Hei tū i tēnei ata, i tēnei ata, ki te whakawhetai, ki te whakamoemiti ki a Ihowā. Kia pērā hoki i te ahiahi, <verse eid="1CH 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 23:31" />hei whakaeke mō ngā tahunga tinana katoa mā Ihowā i ngā hāpati, i ngā marama hou, i ngā hākari i whakaritea. He mea tatau tonu rātou, i runga i te tikanga mō rātou, i te aroaro tonu o Ihowā.<verse eid="1CH 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 23:32" />Ko rātou anō hei tiaki i ngā mea o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, hei tiaki i te wāhi tapu, hei tiaki hoki i ngā mea o ō rātou tuākana, o ngā tama a Ārona, i te mea e mahi ana i ngā mea o te whare o Ihowā.<verse eid="1CH 23:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1CH 24" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Whakaritenga i ngā Tohunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 24:1" />Nā, ko ngā wehenga o ngā tama a Ārona koia ēnei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 24:1">Ko ngā tama a Ārona: ko Nātapa, ko Apihu, ko Ereātara, ko Itamara. <verse eid="1CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 24:2" />I mate ia a Nātapa rāua ko Apihu ki te aroaro o tō rāua pāpā, kāhore hoki ā rāua tama; ā, nā Ereātara rāua ko Itamara i mahi ngā mahi a te tohunga. <verse eid="1CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 24:3" />Nā, ka wehea rātou e Rāwiri rātou ko Hāroko o ngā tama a Ereātara, ko Ahimereke o ngā tama a Itamara, he mea whakarite ki ngā tikanga mā rātou mō ā rātou mahi. <verse eid="1CH 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 24:4" />Nā, ka kitea he tokomaha rawa ngā tino tāngata o ngā tama a Ereātara i o ngā tama a Itamara, ā, ko tō rātou wehenga tēnei; o ngā tama a Ereātara kotahi tekau mā ono ngā tino tāngata o ngā whare o ō rātou mātua; o ngā tama a Itamara, o ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, tokowaru. <verse eid="1CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 24:5" />Ko tō rātou wehenga hoki he mea rota, ko ēnei hui tahi ki ērā; ā, tērā ngā rangatira o te wāhi tapu, me ngā rangatira o te whare o te Atua nō ngā tama a Ereātara, nō ngā tama anō hoki a Itamara.<verse eid="1CH 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 24:6" />He mea tuhituhi rātou nā Hemaia karaipi, tama a Netanēre, o ngā Rīwaiti, ki te aroaro o te kīngi, o ngā rangatira, o Hāroko tohunga rāua ko Ahimereke tama a Apiātara, ki te aroaro anō o ngā upoko o ngā whare o ngā mātua o ngā tohunga, o ngā Rīwaiti; kotahi whare mātua i riro mō Ereātara, kotahi i riro mō Itamara.<verse eid="1CH 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 24:7" />Nā, ko te putanga o te rota tuatahi, nō Tehoiaripi; ko te tuarua nō Irāia, <verse eid="1CH 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 24:8" />ko te tuatoru nō Hārimi, ko te tuawhā nō Heorimi, <verse eid="1CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 24:9" />ko te tuarima nō Marakia, ko te tuaono nō Mīamini, <verse eid="1CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 24:10" />ko te tuawhitu nō Hakoto, ko te tuawaru nō Apia, <verse eid="1CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 24:11" />ko te tuaiwa nō Hehua, ko te tekau nō Hekania, <verse eid="1CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 24:12" />ko te tekau mā tahi nō Eriahipi, ko te tekau mā rua nō Iākimi, <verse eid="1CH 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 24:13" />ko te tekau mā toru nō Hupa, ko te tekau mā whā nō Iehepeapa, <verse eid="1CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 24:14" />ko te tekau mā rima nō Pirika, ko te tekau mā ono nō Imere, <verse eid="1CH 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 24:15" />ko te tekau mā whitu nō Hetiri, ko te tekau mā waru nō Apahehe, <verse eid="1CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 24:16" />ko te tekau mā iwa nō Petahia, ko te rua tekau nō Ehekiere, <verse eid="1CH 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 24:17" />ko te rua tekau mā tahi nō Iakini, ko te rua tekau mā rua nō Kamuru, <verse eid="1CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 24:18" />ko te rua tekau mā toru nō Teraia, ko te rua tekau mā whā nō Maatia.<verse eid="1CH 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 24:19" />Ko ngā tikanga ēnei mō rātou, mō ā rātou mahi, mō te tomo ki te whare o Ihowā, i runga i te ritenga mō rātou, i whakaritea e tō rātou pāpā, e Ārona, ko tā Ihowā, ko tā te Atua o Īharaira i whakahau ai ki a ia.<verse eid="1CH 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Rārangi o ngā Rīwaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 24:20" />Nā, ko ērā atu o ngā tama a Rīwai: o ngā tama a Āmarama, ko Hupaere; o ngā tama a Hupaere, ko Iehereia. <verse eid="1CH 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 24:21" />Nā, ko a Rehāpia: o ngā tama Rehāpia, ko te tuatahi ko Ihīa. <verse eid="1CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 24:22" />O ngā Itihari: ko Heromoto; o ngā tama a Heromoto: ko Iahata. <verse eid="1CH 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 24:23" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Heperona: ko Teria te tuatahi, ko Amaria te tuarua, ko Tahatiere te tuatoru, ko Tekameama te tuawhā. <verse eid="1CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 24:24" />O ngā tama a Utiere: ko Mika; o ngā tama a Mika, ko Hāmiri. <verse eid="1CH 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 24:25" />Ko te teina o Mika: ko Ihīa; o ngā tama a Ihīa: ko Hakaraia. <verse eid="1CH 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 24:26" />Ko ngā tama a Merari: ko Māhari, ko Muhi. Ko ngā tama a Taatia: ko Peno. <verse eid="1CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 24:27" />Ko ngā tama a Merari: arā a Taatia: ko Peno, ko Hōhama, ko Tākuru, ko Ipiri. <verse eid="1CH 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 24:28" />Nā Māhari: ko Ereātara; ā, kāhore a tēnei tama. <verse eid="1CH 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 24:29" />Nā, ko a Kihi, ko te tama a Kihi: ko Ierameere. <verse eid="1CH 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 24:30" />Ko ngā tama anō a Muhi: Māhari, ko Ērere, ko Terimoto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 24:30">Ko ngā tama ēnei a ngā Rīwaiti, nō ngā whare o ō rātou mātua. <verse eid="1CH 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 24:31" />I maka rota anō ēnei i pērā me ō rātou tuākana, me ngā tama a Ārona i te aroaro o Kīngi Rāwiri, o Hāroko anō rāua ko Ahimereke, o ngā upoko anō o ngā whare o ngā mātua o ngā tohunga, o ngā Rīwaiti, arā o ngā tino mātua i te ritenga o ō rātou tēina.<verse eid="1CH 24:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1CH 25" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Kaiwhakatangitangi o te Temepara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 25:1" />Nā Rāwiri hoki, rātou ko ngā rangatira ope, i wehe mō te mahi ētahi o ngā tama a Āhapa, a Hēmana, a Ierutunu, hei poropiti i runga i te hāpa, i te hātere, i te himipora. Nā, ko te tokomaha o ngā kaimahi, me tā rātou mahi koia tēnei:<verse eid="1CH 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 25:2" />Nō ngā tama a Āhapa: ko Tākuru, ko Hōhepa, ko Netania, ko Atarera; ko te kaiwhakamahi mō ngā tama a Āhapa, ko Āhapa; rite tahi ki tā te kīngi tikanga tāna poropiti.<verse eid="1CH 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 25:3" />Ko a Ierutunu: ko ngā tama a Ierutunu; ko Keraria, ko Teri, ko Ihāia, ko Hahapia, ko Matitia, tokoono. Ko tō rātou pāpā ko Ierutunu tō rātou kaiwhakamahi. I poropiti ia i runga i te hāpa, i whakawhetai, i whakamoemiti ki a Ihowā.<verse eid="1CH 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 25:4" />Ko a Hēmana; ko ngā tama a Hēmana: ko Pūkia, ko Matania, ko Utiere, ko Hepuere, ko Terimoto, ko Hanania, ko Hanani, ko Eriata, ko Kirarati, ko Romamati Ētere, ko Iohopekaha, ko Maroti, ko Hotiri, ko Mahatioto. <verse eid="1CH 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 25:5" />Ko ēnei katoa he tama nā Hēmana matakite a te kīngi, mō ngā mea a te Atua, hei hāpai i te haona. Nā, hōmai ana e te Atua ki a Hēmana kotahi tekau mā whā ngā tama, tokotoru ngā tamāhine.<verse eid="1CH 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 25:6" />Ko ēnei katoa he mea whakamahi nā tō rātou pāpā ki te waiata i te whare o Ihowā i runga i ngā himipora, i te hātere, i te hāpa, hei mahi ki te whare o te Atua, hei pērā anō me tā te kīngi i kī ai ki a Āhapa, ki a Ierutunu, ki a Hēmana. <verse eid="1CH 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 25:7" />Nā, ko te tokomaha o rātou, o ō rātou tēina, i whakaakona ki ngā waiata a Ihowā, ko te hunga mōhio katoa, e rua rau e waru tekau mā waru. <verse eid="1CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 25:8" />I maka rota anō rātou mō tā rātou e tiaki ai, te iti, te rahi, te kaiwhakaako rāua ko te ākonga.<verse eid="1CH 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 25:9" />Nā, ko te putanga o te rota tuatahi nō Āhapa, ki a Hōhepa. O te tuarua nō Keraria; tekau mā rua rātou ko ōna tēina, ko āna tama. <verse eid="1CH 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 25:10" />O te tuatoru nō Tākuru: tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 25:11" />O te tuawhā nō Ītiri; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 25:12" />O te tuarima nō Netania; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 25:13" />O te tuaono nō Pūkia; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 25:14" />O te tuawhitu nō Teharera; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 25:15" />O te tuawaru nō Ihāia; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 25:16" />O te tuaiwa nō Matania; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 25:17" />O te tekau nō Himei; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 25:18" />O te tekau mā tahi nō Atarēre; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 25:19" />O te tekau mā rua nō Hahapia; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 25:20" />O te tekau mā toru nō Hupaere; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 25:21" />O te tekau mā whā nō Matitia; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 25:22" />O te tekau mā rima nō Teremoto; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 25:23" />O te tekau mā ono nō Hanania; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 25:24" />O te tekau mā whitu nō Iohopekaha; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 25:25" />O te tekau mā waru nō Hanani; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 25:26" />O te tekau mā iwa nō Maroti; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 25:27" />O te rua tekau nō Eriata; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 25:28" />O te rua tekau mā tahi nō Hotiri; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 25:29" />O te rua tekau mā rua nō Kirarati; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 25:30" />O te rua tekau mā toru nō Mahatioto; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina. <verse eid="1CH 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 25:31" />O te rua tekau mā whā nō Romamati Ētere; tekau mā rua rātou ko āna tama, ko ōna tēina.<verse eid="1CH 25:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1CH 26" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Kaitiaki Kūwaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 26:1" />Nā, ko ngā wehenga o ngā kaitiaki kūwaha: Nō ngā Korohi ko Meheremia tama a Kore, nō ngā tama a Āhapa. <verse eid="1CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 26:2" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Meheremia: ko Hakaraia te mātāmua, ko Teriaere te tuarua, ko Tepāria te tuatoru, ko Iataniere te tuawhā, <verse eid="1CH 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 26:3" />ko Erama te tuarima, ko Iehohanana te tuaono, ko Erioenai te tuawhitu. <verse eid="1CH 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 26:4" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Opere-Eroma: ko Hemaia te mātāmua, ko Iehotāpara te tuarua, ko Ioaha te tuatoru, ko Hakara te tuawhā, ko Netanēre te tuarima, <verse eid="1CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 26:5" />ko Amiere te tuaono, ko Ihākara te tuawhitu, ko Peurutai te tuawaru; he mea manaaki hoki ia nā Ihowā.<verse eid="1CH 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 26:6" />Ā, i whānau anō he tama mā tāna tama mā Hemaia, he rangatira rātou mō te whare o tō rātou pāpā; he mārohirohi hoki rātou, he toa. <verse eid="1CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 26:7" />Ko ngā tama a Hemaia: ko Otoni, ko Repaere, ko Ōpere, ko Eretāpara; he mārohirohi anō ō rātou tēina a Erihu rāua ko Hemakia. <verse eid="1CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 26:8" />Ko ēnei katoa o ngā tama a Opere-Eroma, me ā rātou tama, me ō rātou tēina he kaha ki te mahi, e ono tekau mā rua; nā Opere-Eroma. <verse eid="1CH 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 26:9" />Nā, he tama a Meheremia, he tēina anō, he mārohirohi, tekau mā waru.<verse eid="1CH 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 26:10" />He tama anō a Hōha o ngā tama a Merari: ko Himiri te upoko (ahakoa ehara ia i te mātāmua, i meinga ia hei upoko e tōna pāpā), <verse eid="1CH 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 26:11" />ko Hirikia te tuarua, ko Tepāria te tuatoru, ko Hakaraia te tuawhā; ko ngā tama katoa, me ngā tēina o Hōha, tekau mā toru.<verse eid="1CH 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 26:12" />I roto i ēnei ngā wehenga o ngā kaitiaki kūwaha, arā i roto i ngā tino tāngata, he mahi tiaki pērā i tā ō rātou tuākana, he minita i roto i te whare o Ihowā. <verse eid="1CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 26:13" />I maka rota anō rātou, te iti, te rahi, ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, mō tēnei kūwaha, mō tēnei kūwaha.<verse eid="1CH 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 26:14" />Nā, i taka te rota whaka te rāwhiti ki a Heremia. Kātahi ka makā te rota a tāna tama a Hakaraia, he mōhio ia ki te whakatakoto whakaaro, ā, ko te rota mō te raki i puta ake māna. <verse eid="1CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 26:15" />Ki a Opere-Eroma ko te rota mō te tonga; ā, ki āna tama ko te whare taonga. <verse eid="1CH 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 26:16" />Ki a Tupimi rāua ko Hōha ko tō te hauāuru, me te Kūwaha Harekete, i te huarahi e piki atu ai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 26:16">Tēnei tiakanga i te ritenga mai o tēnei tiakanga. <verse eid="1CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 26:17" />Tokoono ngā Rīwaiti mō tō te rāwhiti, tokowhā mō tō te raki i tēnei rā, i tēnei rā, tokowhā mō tō te tonga i tēnei rā, i tēnei rā, ā, ki te whare taonga tokorua, tokorua. <verse eid="1CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 26:18" />I Parapara whaka te hauāuru tokowhā ki te huarahi, tokorua ki Parapara.<verse eid="1CH 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 26:19" />Ko ngā wehenga ēnei o ngā kaitiaki kūwaha i roto i ngā tama a Kore, i ngā tama anō a Merari.<verse eid="1CH 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ētahi atu Mahi Temepara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 26:20" />Nā, o ngā Rīwaiti, ko Āhia ki ngā taonga o te whare o Ihowā, ki ngā taonga hoki kua oti te whakatapu.<verse eid="1CH 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 26:21" />Ko ngā tama a Rārana; ko ngā tama a ngā Kerehoni nā Rārana, ko ngā upoko o ngā whare o ngā mātua nā Rārana Kerehoni: ko Tehieri. <verse eid="1CH 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 26:22" />Ko ngā tama a Tehieri; ko Tetama, ko tōna teina ko Hoera, i a rātou ngā taonga o te whare o Ihowā.<verse eid="1CH 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 26:23" />Nō ngā Amarami ēnei, rātou ko ngā Itihari, ko ngā Heperoni, ko ngā Utieri:<verse eid="1CH 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 26:24" />Nā, ko Hepuere tama a Kerehoma tama a Mohi te rangatira mō ngā taonga. <verse eid="1CH 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 26:25" />Me ōna tēina: nā Eriētere, tāna tama a Rehāpia, tāna tama a Ihāia, tāna tama a Iorama, tāna tama a Tīkiri, tāna tama a Heromoto. <verse eid="1CH 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 26:26" />Ko tēnei Heromoto rātou ko ōna tēina ngā rangatira mō ngā taonga katoa, mō ngā mea i whakatapua, i whakatapua nei e Kīngi Rāwiri rātou ko ngā upoko o ngā whare o ngā mātua, ko ngā rangatira o ngā mano, o ngā rau, ko ngā rangatira ope. <verse eid="1CH 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 26:27" />Ko ētahi o ngā taonga parakete i riro pārau mai, he mea whakatapu nā rātou kia mau tonu ai te ora o te whare o Ihowā. <verse eid="1CH 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 26:28" />Nā, ko ngā mea katoa i whakatapua e Hamuera matakite, e Haora tama a Kihi, e Āpanēre tama a Nere, e Ioapa tama a Teruia, e te hunga katoa anō i whakatapua ai tētahi mea, i raro ērā i te ringa o Heromoto rātou ko ōna tēina.<verse eid="1CH 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Mahi a Ētahi atu Rīwaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 26:29" />O ngā Itihari, ko Kenania rātou ko āna tama mō ngā mahinga o waho ki a Īharaira, hei rangatira, hei kaiwhakawā. <verse eid="1CH 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 26:30" />O ngā Heperoni, ko Hahapia rātou ko ōna tēina, he mārohirohi, kotahi mano e whitu rau, hei rangatira i roto i te hunga o Īharaira i tēnei taha o Horano whaka te hauāuru, i ngā minitatanga katoa ki a Ihowā, i ngā mahi anō a te kīngi. <verse eid="1CH 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 26:31" />I roto i ngā Heperoni ko Terīa te upoko, arā i roto i ngā Heperoni, i runga anō i ngā whakatupuranga o ngā whare o ngā mātua. I te whā tekau o ngā tau o te kīngitanga o Rāwiri i rapua rātou, ā, kua kitea ētahi mārohirohi i roto i a rātou, he toa, ki Iatere o Kireara. <verse eid="1CH 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 26:32" />Me ōna tēina, he toa, e rua mano e whitu rau, he upoko nō ngā whare o ngā mātua, meinga ana rātou e Kīngi Rāwiri hei rangatira mō ngā Reupeni, mō ngā Kari, mō tētahi tānga o te iwi o Mānahi mō ngā mea katoa a te Atua, mō ngā mea anō a te kīngi.<verse eid="1CH 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1CH 27" />
  <para style="s">He Wehenga Ope Taua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 27:1" />Nā, ko ngā tama a Īharaira, tō rātou tokomaha, ngā upoko o ngā whare o ngā mātua, me ngā rangatira o ngā mano, o ngā rau, me ō rātou rangatira i mahi nei ki te kīngi i ngā mea katoa a ngā wehenga i haere mai nei, i haere atu rānei, i tēnei marama, i tēnei marama, i ngā marama katoa o te tau; e rua tekau mā whā mano o te wehenga kotahi.<verse eid="1CH 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 27:2" />Ko te rangatira o te wehenga tuatahi o te marama tuatahi, ko Iahopeama tama a Tapariere. E rua tekau mā whā mano i tōna wehenga. <verse eid="1CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 27:3" />Nō ngā tama ia a Perete, ko te rangatira o ngā rangatira katoa o te ope mō te marama tuatahi. <verse eid="1CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 27:4" />Ko te rangatira o te wehenga mō te rua o ngā marama, ko Rorai Ahohi, me tōna wehenga; ko Mikiroto te rangatira. E rua tekau mā whā mano i tōna wehenga. <verse eid="1CH 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 27:5" />Ko te tuatoru o ngā rangatira ope, mō te toru o ngā marama, ko Penaia tama a Iehoiara, he tohunga nui. E rua tekau mā whā mano i tōna wehenga. <verse eid="1CH 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 27:6" />Ko taua Penaia tēnei i nui nei i roto i te toru tekau, ko ia hoki te rangatira o te toru tekau. I roto tāna tama a Amitāpara i tōna wehenga. <verse eid="1CH 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 27:7" />Ko te tuawhā, mō te whā o ngā marama, ko Atahere teina o Ioapa, me tāna tama, me Tepāria, i muri i a ia. E rua tekau mā whā mano i tōna wehenga. <verse eid="1CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 27:8" />Ko te tuarima o ngā rangatira, mō te rima o ngā marama, ko Hamahutu Itirahi. E rua tekau mā whā mano i tōna wehenga. <verse eid="1CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 27:9" />Ko te tuaono o ngā rangatira, mō te ono o ngā marama, ko Ira tama a Ikehe Tekoi. E rua tekau mā whā mano i tōna wehenga. <verse eid="1CH 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 27:10" />Ko te tuawhitu, mō te whitu o ngā marama, ko Herete Peroni, nō ngā tama a Ēparaima. E rua tekau mā whā mano i tōna wehenga. <verse eid="1CH 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 27:11" />Ko te tuawaru, mō te waru o ngā marama, ko Hipekai Huhati, nō ngā Terahi. E rua tekau mā whā mano i tōna wehenga. <verse eid="1CH 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 27:12" />Ko te tuaiwa, mō te iwa o ngā marama, ko Apiētere Anatoti, nō ngā Pineamine. E rua tekau mā whā mano i tōna wehenga. <verse eid="1CH 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 27:13" />Ko te tekau, mō te tekau o ngā marama, ko Maharai Netopati, nō ngā Terahi. E rua tekau mā whā mano i tōna wehenga. <verse eid="1CH 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 27:14" />Ko te tekau mā tahi, mō te tekau mā tahi o ngā marama, ko Penaia Piratoni, nō ngā tama a Ēparaima. E rua tekau mā whā mano i tōna wehenga. <verse eid="1CH 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 27:15" />Ko te tekau mā rua, mō te tekau mā rua o ngā marama, ko Hererai Netopati, nō Otoniere. E rua tekau mā whā mano i tōna wehenga.<verse eid="1CH 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">He Rangatira o ngā Iwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 27:16" />Nā, ko ngā rangatira o ngā iwi o Īharaira: o ngā Reupeni, ko Eriētere tama a Tīkiri te rangatira; o ngā Himioni, ko Hepatia tama a Maaka; <verse eid="1CH 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 27:17" />o ngā Rīwaiti: ko Hahapia tama a Kemuere; o ngā Āroni, ko Hāroko; <verse eid="1CH 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 27:18" />o Hūrā: ko Erihu, nō ngā tuākana o Rāwiri; o Ihākara, ko Omori tama a Mikaera; <verse eid="1CH 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 27:19" />o Hepurona: ko Ihimāia tama a Opāria; o Napatari, ko Terimoto tama a Atariere; <verse eid="1CH 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 27:20" />o ngā tama a Ēparaima: ko Hohea tama a Atatia; o tētahi tānga o te iwi o Mānahi, ko Hoera tama a Peraia; <verse eid="1CH 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 27:21" />o tērā tānga o te iwi o Mānahi i Kireara: ko Iro tama a Hakaraia; o Pineamine: ko Taahiere tama a Āpanēre; <verse eid="1CH 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 27:22" />o Rāna: ko Atarēre tama a Ierohama.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:22">Ko ngā rangatira ēnei o ngā iwi o Īharaira.<verse eid="1CH 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 27:23" />Kīhai ia i taua e Rāwiri te hunga e rua tekau, he iti iho hoki ngā tau; i mea hoki a Ihowā, ka whakanuia e ia a Īharaira kia rite ki ngā whetū o te rangi. <verse eid="1CH 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 27:24" />Nā Ioapa tama a Teruia i tīmata te tatau. Otiia kīhai i oti i a ia; nō te mea i pā he riri mō tēnei mea ki a Īharaira; kīhai hoki te tokomaha i uru ki roto ki te tauanga o ngā meatanga o ngā rā o Kīngi Rāwiri.<verse eid="1CH 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Kaiwhakahaere o ngā Taonga o te Kīngi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 27:25" />Nā, ko te rangatira o ngā taonga o te kīngi, ko Ātamawete tama a Ariere. Ko te rangatira o ngā whare taonga i ngā māra, i ngā pā, i ngā pā koraha, i ngā taumaihi, ko Honatana tama a Utia. <verse eid="1CH 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 27:26" />Ko te rangatira hoki o ngā kaimahi o te māra, i mahia ai te oneone, ko Eteri tama a Kerupu. <verse eid="1CH 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 27:27" />Nā, mō ngā māra wāina ko Himei Ramati. Ko te rangatira mō ngā mea o ngā māra wāina e kawea ana ki ngā toa wāina, ko Tapari Hipimi. <verse eid="1CH 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 27:28" />Mō ngā ōriwa, me ngā hikamora i ngā raorao, ko Paara-Hanana Kereri. Mō ngā toa hinu ko Ioaha. <verse eid="1CH 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 27:29" />Mō ngā kau e hāereere ana i Harono ko Hitirai Haroni. Mō ngā kau i ngā mānia ko Hāpata tama a Ararai. <verse eid="1CH 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 27:30" />Mō ngā kāmera ko Ōpiri Ihimaeri. Mō ngā kāihe ko Iehereia Meronoti. <verse eid="1CH 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 27:31" />Mō ngā hipi, ko Iatiti Hākari. Ko ēnei katoa he rangatira nō ngā taonga o Kīngi Rāwiri.<verse eid="1CH 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Kaiwhakatakoto Whakaaro a Rāwiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 27:32" />Ko Honatana hoki, ko te matua kēkē o Rāwiri, he kaiwhakatakoto whakaaro ia, he tangata mōhio, he karaipi. Ko Tehiere hoki tama a Hakamoni hei hoa mō ngā tama a te kīngi. <verse eid="1CH 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 27:33" />Ko Ahitopere te kaiwhakatakoto whakaaro a te kīngi. Ko Huhai Araki he hoa nō te kīngi. <verse eid="1CH 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 27:34" />I muri i a Ahitopere, ko Iehoiara tama a Penaia, ko Apiātara hoki; ā, ko te rangatira ope a te kīngi, ko Ioapa.<verse eid="1CH 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1CH 28" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Tohutohu a Rāwiri mō te Temepara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 28:1" />Nā, ka whakaminea e Rāwiri ngā rangatira katoa o Īharaira: ngā rangatira o ngā iwi, ngā rangatira o ngā wehenga i mahi nei ki te kīngi, me ngā rangatira mano, me ngā rangatira rau, me ngā rangatira anō o ngā taonga, o ngā kararehe a te kīngi, a āna tama, me ngā kaiwhakahaere, me ngā mārohirohi, me ngā tāngata māia katoa, ki Hiruhārama.<verse eid="1CH 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 28:2" />Nā, ka tū ngā waewae o Kīngi Rāwiri ki runga, ā, ka kōrero ia: “Whakarongo mai, e ōku tuākana, e ōku tēina, e tōku iwi. He ngākau tōku ki te hanga i tētahi whare hei okiokinga mō te āka o te kawenata a Ihowā, hei tūranga waewae mō tō tātou Atua; nā, kua rite āku mea hei hanga. <verse eid="1CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 28:3" />Otiia, kua kī mai nei te Atua ki ahau, ‘E kore e hangā e koe he whare mō tōku ingoa; he tangata whawhai koe, kua whakaheke toto hoki koe.’<verse eid="1CH 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 28:4" />“Heoi, kua whiriwhiria nei ahau e Ihowā, e te Atua o Īharaira i roto i te whare katoa o tōku pāpā hei kīngi mō Īharaira ā ake ake. Kua whiriwhiria nei hoki e ia a Hūrā hei rangatira; me te whare anō o tōku pāpā i roto i te whare o Hūrā; i whakapai hoki ia ki ahau i roto i ngā tama a tōku pāpā, ā, meinga ana ahau hei kīngi mō Īharaira katoa. <verse eid="1CH 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 28:5" />Ā, ko tāna i whiriwhiri ai o āku tama katoa, he tokomaha hoki ngā tama i hōmai nei e Ihowā ki ahau, ko tāku tama, ko Horomona hei noho ki te torōna o te kīngitanga o Ihowā ki a Īharaira. <verse eid="1CH 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 28:6" />I mea mai anō ia ki ahau, ‘Ko Horomona, ko tāu tama, māna, e hanga tōku whare, me ōku marae; kua oti hoki ia te whiriwhiri e ahau hei tama māku, ko ahau hoki hei pāpā ki a ia. <verse eid="1CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 28:7" />Ka whakapūmautia anō e ahau tōna kīngitanga ake ake, ki te mau tāna mahi i āku whakahau, i āku whakaritenga, ki te pēnei me tēnei ināianei.’<verse eid="1CH 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 28:8" />“Nā, i te mea e titiro mai nei a Īharaira katoa, arā tā Ihowā whakaminenga, ā, i tō tātou Atua hoki e whakarongo mai nei, puritia, rapua ngā whakahau katoa a Ihowā, a tō koutou Atua, kia riro ai te whenua pai i a koutou, ā, whakarere tonu iho e koutou mō ā koutou tama i muri i a koutou ake ake.”<verse eid="1CH 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 28:9" />Me koe hoki, “E tāku tama, e Horomona, kia mōhio koe ki te Atua o tōu pāpā, kia tapatahi hoki te ngākau, kia hihiko te wairua e mahi ai koe ki a ia; e rapua ana hoki e Ihowā ngā mea o ngā ngākau katoa, ā, e mōhiotia katoatia ana e ia ngā tokonga ake o ngā whakaaro. Ki te rapua ia e koe, ka kitea, ā, ki te whakarērea ia e koe, ka peia koe e ia ā ake ake. <verse eid="1CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 28:10" />Nā, kia mahara, kua whiriwhiria nei hoki koe e Ihowā hei hanga i te whare mō te wāhi tapu. Kia kaha ki te mahi.”<verse eid="1CH 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 28:11" />Kātahi ka hoatu e Rāwiri ki tāna tama, ki a Horomona te tauira mō te whakamahau o te temepara, mō ngā whare anō o reira, mō ōna whare taonga, mō ōna rūma o runga, mō ōna rūma anō i roto, mō te wāhi hoki mō te taupoki. <verse eid="1CH 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 28:12" />Me te tauira mō ngā mea katoa a te wairua i a ia, mō ngā marae o te whare o Ihowā, mō ngā rūma katoa anō ā taka noa, mō ngā whare taonga o te whare o te Atua, mō ngā whare taonga mō ngā mea kua oti te whakatapu. <verse eid="1CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 28:13" />Mō ngā wehenga o ngā tohunga, o ngā Rīwaiti, mō ngā meatanga katoatanga o te mahi mō te whare o Ihowā, mō ngā oko katoa hei mea mahi ki te whare o Ihowā. <verse eid="1CH 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 28:14" />Me te kōura, he mea pāuna, mō ngā mea kōura, mō ngā mea katoa o tēnei mahi, o tēnei mahi; he hiriwa anō mō ngā mea hiriwa katoa, he mea pāuna, mō ngā mea katoa o tēnei mahi, o tēnei mahi: <verse eid="1CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 28:15" />me te taimaha mō ngā tūranga rama kōura, me ō rātou rama kōura; he mea pāuna mō tēnei tūranga, mō tēnei tūranga, mō ō rātou rama anō; he mea pāuna anō mō ngā tūranga hiriwa, mō te tūranga, mō ōna rama, he mea whakarite ki te mahi mō tēnei tūranga, mō tēnei tūranga; <verse eid="1CH 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 28:16" />i pāunatia anō e ia te kōura mō ngā tēpu taro aroaro, mō tēnei tēpu, mō tēnei tēpu; me te hiriwa mō ngā tēpu hiriwa. <verse eid="1CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 28:17" />Me te kōura parakore mō ngā mārau, mō ngā peihana, mō ngā kapu: mō ngā pāta kōura hoki, he mea pāuna mō tēnei pāta, mō tēnei pāta; me te hiriwa anō, he mea pāuna mō ngā pāta hiriwa katoa; <verse eid="1CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 28:18" />mō te āta tahu whakakakara anō he kōura parakore, he mea pāuna; he kōura mō te tauira o te hāriata o ngā kerupima e roha nei ngā parirau hei hīpoki mō te āka o te kawenata a Ihowā.<verse eid="1CH 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 28:19" />“Ko tēnei katoa,” e ai tā Rāwiri, “he mea tuhituhi, he mea whakaatu mai nā Ihowā ki ahau; i runga hoki i ahau tōna ringa; arā, ngā mea katoa o tēnei tauira.”<verse eid="1CH 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 28:20" />I mea anō a Rāwiri ki tāna tama, ki a Horomona, “Kia kaha, kia māia, mahia, kaua e wehi, kaua e pāwera; kei a koe nā hoki a Ihowā, te Atua, arā tōku Atua. E kore ia e whakarere i a koe, e kore anō koe e mahue i a ia, kia oti rā anō ngā mea katoa mō te mahi ki te whare o Ihowā. <verse eid="1CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 28:21" />Nanā, ngā wehenga o ngā tohunga, o ngā Rīwaiti, kei a koe rātou mō ngā mahi katoa ki te whare o te Atua. Kei a koe anō, mō ngā meatanga katoa, ngā tāngata mōhio katoa e hihiko noa āna, mō ngā mahi katoa; me ngā rangatira, me te iwi katoa; kei a koe tonu te kupu katoa.”<verse eid="1CH 28:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1CH 29" />
  <para style="s">He Koha hei Hanga i te Temepara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 29:1" />I mea anō a Kīngi Rāwiri ki te whakaminenga katoa: “Ko tāku tama, ko Horomona, ko te mea kotahi i whiriwhiria nei e te Atua, he tamariki ia, he mea ngāwari, he nui hoki te mahi; ehara hoki i te whare mō te tangata; engari mō Ihowā, mō te Atua. <verse eid="1CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 29:2" />Nā, kua whakapaua nei e ahau ōku uaua ki te mahi mea mai mō te whare o tōku Atua, te kōura mō ngā mea kōura, te hiriwa mō ngā mea hiriwa, te parāhi mō ngā mea parāhi, te rino mō ngā mea rino, te rākau mō ngā mea rākau, ngā kōhatu onika, ngā kōhatu e whakanohoia ana, ngā kōhatu kanapa, me ngā mea kakano whakauru, ngā kōhatu utu nui katoa, me ngā kōhatu mapere, tōna tini. <verse eid="1CH 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 29:3" />Tēnei anō ētahi, he pai tonu hoki nōku ki te whare o tōku Atua; nāku ake tēnei, he kōura, he hiriwa ka hoatu nei mō te whare o tōku Atua, hei tāpiri mō ngā mea katoa kua oti nei i ahau te mahi mai mō te whare tapu: <verse eid="1CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 29:4" />arā, e toru mano taranata kōura, nō te kōura o Ōpira, e whitu mano taranata hiriwa, he mea parakore, hei kōpaki mō ngā taha o ngā whare, <verse eid="1CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 29:5" />ko te kōura mō ngā mea kōura, ko te hiriwa mō ngā mea hiriwa, mō ngā mea katoa, e mahia e ngā ringa o ngā kaimahi. Nā, ko wai e hihiko ana ināianei ki te tāpae i a ia mā Ihowā?”<verse eid="1CH 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 29:6" />Nā, hihiko tonu ngā rangatira o ngā whare o ngā mātua, me ngā rangatira o ngā iwi o Īharaira, ngā rangatira o ngā mano, o ngā rau, rātou ko ngā rangatira o te mahi a te kīngi. <verse eid="1CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 29:7" />Ā, hōmai ana e rātou mō te mahi ki te whare o te Atua he kōura e rima mano taranata, tekau mano tarami, he hiriwa kotahi tekau mano taranata, he parāhi kotahi tekau mā waru mano taranata, he rino kotahi rau mano taranata. <verse eid="1CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 29:8" />Nā, ko te hunga i kitea nei ki a rātou he kōhatu pai, hōmai ana e rātou ki roto ki ngā taonga o te whare o Ihowā, arā ki te ringa o Tehiere Kerehoni. <verse eid="1CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 29:9" />Nā, ka koa te iwi, i a rātou i hihiko nei ki te tāpae noa; he tapatahi hoki te ngākau i hihiko ai rātou ki tā Ihowā mahi; nui atu hoki te koa i koa ai a Kīngi Rāwiri.<verse eid="1CH 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ka Whakapai a Rāwiri i a Ihowā</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 29:10" />Nā, ka whakapai a Rāwiri i a Ihowā i te tirohanga a te whakaminenga katoa; i mea a Rāwiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:10">“Kia whakapaingia koe, e Ihowā,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:10">e te Atua o tō mātou matua, o Īharaira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:10">he mea nō tua whakarere ā ake tonu atu.<verse eid="1CH 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 29:11" />Nōu hoki, e Ihowā, te nui, te mana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:11">te korōria, te wikitōria, te hōnore;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:11">nōu ngā mea katoa i te rangi, i te whenua;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:11">nōu te rangatiratanga, e Ihowā;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:11">he tiketike noa ake hoki koe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:11">hei upoko mō te katoa.<verse eid="1CH 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 29:12" />Nāu ngā taonga, me te hōnore, ko koe hoki hei kīngi mō te katoa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:12">kei tōu ringa te kaha me te mana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:12">mā tōu ringa anō e hōmai te nui, te kaha, mō te katoa.<verse eid="1CH 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 29:13" />Nā, tēnei mātou, e tō mātou Atua, te whakawhetai nei ki a koe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:13">te whakamoemiti nei ki tōu ingoa korōria.<verse eid="1CH 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 29:14" />“Ko wai oti ahau, ā, he aha tōku iwi, i whai kaha ai mātou, i pēnei ai te hihiko? Nāu hoki te katoa, nōu anō hoki tā mātou ka hoatu nei ki a koe. <verse eid="1CH 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 29:15" />He manene hoki mātou i tōu aroaro, he noho noa iho, he pērā me ō mātou mātua; rite tonu ki te ātārangi ō mātou rā i runga i te whenua; kāhore hoki he tūturutanga. <verse eid="1CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 29:16" />E Ihowā, e tō mātou Atua, ko tēnei pūranga katoa kua pae nei i a mātou hei hanga i tētahi whare mōu, mō tōu ingoa tapu, nā tōu ringa ēnei, nāu hoki te katoa. <verse eid="1CH 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 29:17" />E mōhio ana hoki ahau, e tōku Atua, e whakamātauria ana te ngākau e koe, e manako ana hoki koe ki te tika. Ko ahau nei, he tika tōku ngākau i meatia noatia mai ai e ahau ēnei mea katoa; ā, tēnei ahau te koa nei i tōku kitenga i tāu iwi i konei e hihiko ana ki tāu mahi. <verse eid="1CH 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 29:18" />E Ihowā, e te Atua o Āperahama, o Īhaka, o Īharaira, o ō mātou mātua, kia mau tēnei ake nei, ake nei, i roto i ngā tokonga ake o ngā whakaaro o te ngākau o tāu iwi, whakaangahia hoki ō rātou ngākau ki a koe. <verse eid="1CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 29:19" />Ki tāku tama hoki, ki a Horomona, hōmai he ngākau tapatahi, kia puritia ai e ia āu whakahau, āu whakaaturanga, āu tikanga, kia oti katoa i a ia; kia hangā hoki te whare, mō reira nei ngā mea kua pae nei i ahau.”<verse eid="1CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 29:20" />Nā, ka mea a Rāwiri ki te whakaminenga katoa, “Tēnā, whakapaingia a Ihowā, tō koutou Atua.” Nā, kei te whakapai te whakaminenga katoa ki a Ihowā, ki te Atua o ō rātou mātua tuohu ana rātou, piko ana ki a Ihowā, ki te kīngi hoki.<verse eid="1CH 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 29:21" />I patu whakahere anō rātou ki a Ihowā, i whakaeke i ngā tahunga tinana ki a Ihowā i te aonga ake o taua rā; kotahi mano pūru, kotahi mano hipi toa, kotahi mano reme, me ngā ringihanga, me ngā patunga tapu, tōna tini, hei mea mō Īharaira katoa. <verse eid="1CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 29:22" />Nā, kai ana rātou, inu ana i te aroaro o Ihowā i taua rā, he nui te koa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1CH 29:22">Ka Whakawahia e Rāwiri hei Kīngi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 29:22">Ā, ka tuaruatia tā rātou whakakīngi i a Horomona tama a Rāwiri; whakawahia ana ia ki a Ihowā, hei rangatira; ko Hāroko hoki hei tohunga. <verse eid="1CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 29:23" />Kātahi ka noho a Horomona ki te torōna o Ihowā, hei kīngi i muri i tōna pāpā, i a Rāwiri, ā, kake ana; rongo tonu anō ki a ia a Īharaira katoa. <verse eid="1CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 29:24" />Nā, ko ngā rangatira katoa, me ngā mārohirohi, me ngā tama katoa a Kīngi Rāwiri, ngāwari noa iho rātou ki te kīngi, ki a Horomona.<verse eid="1CH 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 29:25" />Ā, whakanuia rawatia ake a Horomona e Ihowā i te tirohanga a Īharaira katoa, hōmai ana ki a ia he korōria kīngi, kāhore nei he rite i ngā kīngi katoa o Īharaira i mua i a ia.<verse eid="1CH 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">He Whakarāpototonga o te Kīngitanga a Rāwiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 29:26" />Heoi, ko Rāwiri tama a Hehe te kīngi o Īharaira katoa. <verse eid="1CH 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 29:27" />Nā, ko ngā rā i kīngi ai ia ki a Īharaira, e whā tekau tau; e whitu ngā tau i kīngi ai ia ki Heperona, e toru tekau mā toru ngā tau i kīngi ai ki Hiruhārama. <verse eid="1CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 29:28" />Nā, ka mate ia, he pai tōna koroheketanga, hira tonu ōna rā, ōna taonga, tōna korōria; ā, ko tāna tama, ko Horomona te kīngi i muri i a ia.<verse eid="1CH 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 29:29" />Nā, ko ngā mahi a Kīngi Rāwiri, ō mua, ō muri, nanā, kua oti te tuhituhi ki ngā kupu a Hamuera matakite, ki ngā kupu anō a Nātana poropiti, ki ngā kupu anō hoki a Kara matakite, <verse eid="1CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 29:30" />me tōna kīngitanga katoa, me tōna māia, me ngā wā i a ia, i a Īharaira, i ngā rangatiratanga katoa o ngā whenua.<verse eid="1CH 29:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 29" />
</usx>